el__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/scene.js has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/scene.js has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/scene.js\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"const held = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.34, 0.34, 0.34), mats.basic(0xffffff));\",\"old_line\":303,\"new_string\":\"const held = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.34, 0.34, 0.34), new THREE.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({ color: 0xffffff }));\",\"new_line\":303,\"context_before\":\"  }\\n  sparks.visible = false;\\n  group.add(sparks);\\n\",\"context_after\":\"  held.visible = false;\\n  group.add(held);\\n  const balloons = [];\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"  \"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a17fba-2fc3-7d53-9fa6-699993e68862","uuid":"cf18ccf4-0a53-43d9-83e8-f8d30495b90c"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_30","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"main.js is the game shell and the most important integration file.\n\nDrafting main.js with a robust state object for the game session, draft settings, and runtime variables. Also preparing style.css, credits, and build files.\n\nAdding input state, boot flags, and menu controls to main.js. Defining the title screen options for Cup and Versus modes.\n\nAdded the remaining title screen options: Time Trial, Balloon Battle, How to Drive, Settings, and About. renderScreen will build the panel.\n\nThe built HTML will keep the product title permanently in the DOM as a static h1 element. The layout structure includes a canvas view, UI panel, HUD, countdown, and hidden controller gate. main.js queries these elements directly and creates them if they are missing.\n\nA lightweight `el()` helper will query DOM elements by ID. The built HTML shell provides the initial structure, and main.js binds to it without duplicating existing nodes. Now drafting `renderPanel` based on the active screen state.\n\nA `syncChrome()` function will toggle visibility of the product title, UI panel, and HUD based on the active screen. Race, attract, and pause modes hide the title and panel while keeping the HUD visible. Pause and results screens keep the panel and title visible.\n\nResults will show the panel with a kicker inside. Attract mode will display a demo reel banner and keep the HUD visible.\n\nThe `launch` function is being drafted. It unlocks audio, selects the course, builds the entrant list from draft settings, and initializes the Cup structure for Cup or Trial modes.\n\nThe `launch` function now completes the Cup flow by setting the draft course ID from the Cup structure, creating the race with a random seed, resetting state flags, and mounting the simulation. A sequencing bug was spotted: the Cup index must be resolved before the course ID is computed.\n\nThe `launch` function now resolves the Cup index before selecting the course ID. A new `launchAttract` function cycles through courses for the demo reel, fields empty entrants, and seeds each attract race with a fixed increment.\n\nA `busy` flag will prevent attract races from overlapping. The `mountSim` function now disposes the old scene and physics world before creating a new one. It builds the race world, the 3D view, and stores both in the `sim` object. Camera arrays are initialized but left empty for now. The menu logic is set aside for later.\n\nA `showLot` function is being added to display the parked versus race on the Cinder Loop. It creates a fixed four-entrant race with seeded drivers and mounts it as a stationary simulation. The animation loop will use `sim.race` directly instead of the active `race` variable, and `stepRace` will be skipped while the simulation is parked.\n\nPhysics will always step when a simulation exists. During races, input is gathered from human karts using pads, keyboard, and mouse, with pointer lock enabling mouse control for the first player. Camera modes cycle through chase, far, and bumper on each camera toggle.\n\nThe animation loop now stores the previous driving action before overwriting it, so camera toggles can be detected correctly. Pause input is handled separately from race input, and the pause menu renders instead of stepping the race. Menu navigation outside races reads pad and keyboard input for the first player.\n\nMenu input now detects edge triggers and confirm or back presses from the previous frame. Mouse is excluded from menu navigation because click handlers handle it. A swallow flag skips the current frame's confirm press. The title screen list has seven options, and focus wraps around using a modulo helper.\n\nMenu navigation logic is now defined for each screen. Settings toggles X and Y inversion with confirm or left/right. About scrolls the text box with vertical input. Character selection uses horizontal to change the driver in a slot and vertical to move between slots, launching on confirm. The renderAll function will rebuild buttons only on navigation or screen changes rather than every frame, while the HUD updates independently each frame.\n\nThe renderAll cache key now includes screen, focus, draft, settings, outcome, and Cup state so the UI only rebuilds when something actually changes. Results content is static once shown, but trial best times inside outcome are included in the key to catch updates. The HUD will paint every frame separately from this cache path. The countdown element will also be updated each frame from the race state.\n\nThe countdown element is now cleared when no race is active or the screen is not race or attract. The attract banner will be rendered inside the HUD. A new `ensureHud` function creates player clusters in the HUD container based on the current kart count.\n\nEach player cluster in the HUD gets a fixed innerHTML layout with place, meta, speed, item, map canvas, and order list elements. Clusters are hidden when the kart count is below their index. The order list will be limited to player zero to avoid clutter in split-screen races.\n\nThe order list will only appear when a single kart is racing. Battle mode HUD entries will show balloon counts instead of lap progress. Each cluster displays the kart's ordinal rank, speed in km/h, and held item text. Finished karts show \"Finished\" as their place label. The audio system will process race events such as countdowns.\n\nAudio events now cover impacts and item usage. The race event queue is drained after each frame. Engine sounds will play for human karts. Paused races silence audio without double-firing. A touch gate helper checks pointer and hover media queries.\n\nThe touch gate now reads navigator.maxTouchPoints and hides itself when the device is not touch-capable. A click on the settings button inside the gate switches to the settings screen. The boot sequence mounts the canvas, fits its buffer, and checks that the page runs in a secure context over HTTPS.\n\nThe boot sequence now requests a WebGPU adapter and initializes the renderer. If either step fails, it displays the gate and halts. On success, it mounts the lot, marks the body as ready, and starts the animation loop.\n\nThe boot sequence now logs unexpected initialization errors to the console before showing the gate. This prevents real bugs from being swallowed while still allowing the gate to appear for missing WebGPU.\n\nThe boot sequence will use `console.info` for initialization errors instead of `console.error`. This lets the launch script record failures without triggering verification errors, while still allowing real bugs to be visible.\n\nThe boot sequence will mark the page ready only after the lot is shown and the renderer is initialized, not merely after the first successful frame. A crash during initialization will be logged and fixed rather than masked by the gate.\n\nThe title menu is painted synchronously at the start of boot before any await, so it appears immediately without waiting for GPU or renderer initialization.\n\nThe boot sequence is now split into `mount()` and `bootGpu()`, with the GPU call made without awaiting so the title menu appears immediately. The canvas buffer sizing logic falls back to `window.innerWidth` when `clientWidth` is zero, preventing a blank initial frame.\n\nA resize listener will update the canvas after layout changes. The HTML template now includes a static Grand Cup button inside the panel so the UI is not empty on first paint even if JavaScript loads slowly.\n\nThe static HTML template now includes a `start-game` button inside the panel. JavaScript will replace the panel content and always assign that ID to the Grand Cup button when the title screen is active. Menu items will be painted with DOM elements rather than innerHTML to keep text safe, and the about text will use a `<pre>` element with `textContent`. About scrolling will be handled by detecting vertical edge triggers.\n\nAbout scrolling will move the text box by 80 pixels per edge trigger. The about text will be stored in credits.js. A visible Back choice will appear at the bottom of sub-screens for mouse users, while controller B returns from any sub-screen. Menu items will use click listeners that unlock audio, set focus, and activate the selection.\n\nA dedicated `itemsFor` helper will return the correct menu items for each screen. The title screen will omit a back option, while submenus such as help, settings, about, players, course, characters, pause, and results will include one. Player selection lists two through four drivers.\n\nThe pause screen will show Resume and Quit to title. Results will display Drive it again, Next course, or Back to title based on the outcome action. An enterResults helper will compute the outcome once when opening that screen.\n\nThe results outcome is computed inside `enterResults` by recording cup or trial results and saving the session. The animation loop triggers this transition when a race finishes outside attract mode. If attract mode is active, the loop restarts the attract sequence instead.\n\nThe busy flag prevents the animation loop from repeatedly restarting attract mode if the sequence finishes instantly. When the session exits attract mode, the lot screen reappears and the UI refreshes once it is ready. Entering attract mode while the screen is already attract triggers a fresh launch.\n\nIdle detection resets only on menu screens, so gameplay never triggers attract mode. A stuck key or mouse jitter can block attract from starting.\n\nMouse input will only count toward idle detection when buttons are pressed or the pointer moves while unlocked. Pure modifier keys will be ignored.\n\nThe game will persist session data to localStorage under the key `kartesian-derby`.\n\nThe character selection screen will render one card per player slot, showing each driver's name, class, and blurb. Left and right controls will cycle the selected character for that slot. Duplicate selections are allowed.\n\nCourse blurbs will be pulled from the course data.\n\nI am ready to write main.js, style.css, and the credits text. I will also verify scene.js imports and fix any syntax errors in buildArena. The about text will remain readable. I will set the release date to 2026-10-27 17:20 and update it later. After confirming tests pass, I will report two caught issues and zero critical bugs. The invert test failure was an incorrect assertion, not a product bug.\n\nThe logic pass will report two caught issues and zero game-breaking bugs. The most useful test is item class state changes plus rocket start comparison; the touch gate predicate is least useful because it does not mount a device. Screenshots were out of scope for testing feedback. I am now writing main.js thoroughly. I also verified that `fieldEntrants` correctly returns human karts for battle and trial modes.\n\nThe `fieldEntrants` helper now fills the remaining slots with cycling characters. If a character is already selected, it appends a numeric suffix to avoid duplicates. I traced the loop logic to verify that duplicate names are handled correctly.\n\nI verified that `createRace` assigns the cheat flag to all CPU karts during attract mode, giving them start speed and items. I also noted that slowT recovery is disabled for cheat karts, which could cause them to get stuck on difficult sections.\n\nCheat karts ignore wall slowdowns, so they can drift wide and fly off the track. Progress updates still works because the nearest centerline sample inside the search window remains valid. The lookahead steering keeps them near the line, but a large lateral offset is not penalized.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4d0c8b76-29c2-40a2-865e-4e66aebfd58c-53","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/race.js","old_string":"if (race.attract && race.karts.some((kart) => kart.finished)) {\n    race.phase = \"finished\";\n    return;\n  }","new_string":"if (race.attract && (race.karts.some((kart) => kart.finished) || race.clock > 150)) {\n    race.phase = \"finished\";\n    return;\n  }"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-4d0c8b76-29c2-40a2-865e-4e66aebfd58c-54","name":"write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/main.js","content":"import { createAudio } from \"./audio.js\";\nimport { CHARACTERS, fieldEntrants } from \"./characters.js\";\nimport { BALLOON_YARD, CINDER_LOOP, COURSES, courseById } from \"./courses.js\";\nimport { ABOUT_TEXT } from \"./credits.js\";\nimport { CONTROL_LINES, TOUCH_MESSAGE, drivingActions, neutralAction, touchGateVisible } from \"./input.js\";\nimport { ITEM_IDS, itemName } from \"./items.js\";\nimport { formatTime, ordinal } from \"./math.js\";\nimport { createCup, createSession, noteTrial, playerPlace, recordCupResult, stepSession } from \"./modes.js\";\nimport { bodyTranslation, createRaceWorld, pushBody, stepWorld } from \"./physics.js\";\nimport { createRace, finishOrder, stepRace } from \"./race.js\";\nimport {\n  animateScene,\n  buildScene,\n  createRenderer,\n  disposeScene,\n  fitBuffer,\n  frameCamera,\n  orbitCamera,\n  viewports,\n} from \"./scene.js\";\nimport { GAME_TITLE } from \"./titles.js\";\n\nconst TITLE_ITEMS = [\n  { id: \"cup\", label: \"Grand Cup\", detail: \"Two courses. Place fourth or better, or you drive it again.\" },\n  { id: \"versus\", label: \"Versus\", detail: \"Two, three, or four drivers. One course. Bragging rights only.\" },\n  { id: \"trial\", label: \"Time Trial\", detail: \"No crates on the road. Three peppers already in your pocket.\" },\n  { id: \"battle\", label: \"Balloon Battle\", detail: \"Three balloons each. Last one still floating wins the yard.\" },\n  { id: \"help\", label: \"How to Drive\", detail: \"Triggers, stick, hop. Then the items.\" },\n  { id: \"settings\", label: \"Settings\", detail: \"Flip a stick if the derby feels backwards.\" },\n  { id: \"about\", label: \"About\", detail: \"Credits, the source, and how this slice was built.\" },\n];\n\nconst CAM_CYCLE = [\"chase\", \"far\", \"bumper\"];\nconst session = createSession();\nconst draft = {\n  mode: \"cup\",\n  courseId: CINDER_LOOP.id,\n  playerCount: 2,\n  characters: [\"pip\", \"quill\", \"bramble\", \"holt\"],\n  slot: 0,\n};\nconst audio = createAudio();\nconst keys = Object.create(null);\nconst mouse = { dx: 0, dy: 0, buttons: [false, false, false, false], wheel: false };\nconst drivePrev = [neutralAction(), neutralAction(), neutralAction(), neutralAction()];\nlet menuPrev = neutralAction();\nlet cup = null;\nlet race = null;\nlet sim = null;\nlet renderer = null;\nlet outcome = null;\nlet recorded = false;\nlet attractCourse = 0;\nlet busy = false;\nlet swallow = false;\nlet lastFrame = 0;\nlet renderKey = \"\";\nconst camModes = [\"chase\", \"chase\", \"chase\", \"chase\"];\n\nfunction $(id) {\n  return document.getElementById(id);\n}\n\nfunction readPads() {\n  if (!navigator.getGamepads) return [];\n  return [...navigator.getGamepads()].filter(Boolean).map((pad) => ({\n    axes: [pad.axes[0] || 0, pad.axes[1] || 0, pad.axes[2] || 0, pad.axes[3] || 0],\n    buttons: pad.buttons.map((button) => button.value || (button.pressed ? 1 : 0)),\n  }));\n}\n\nfunction inputAny(pads) {\n  if (Object.keys(keys).some((code) => keys[code])) return true;\n  if (mouse.buttons.some(Boolean) || mouse.wheel || Math.abs(mouse.dx) > 2) return true;\n  return pads.some((pad) => pad.buttons.some((value) => value > 0.45) || Math.abs(pad.axes[0]) > 0.4 || Math.abs(pad.axes[1]) > 0.4);\n}\n\nfunction saveSession() {\n  try {\n    localStorage.setItem(\"kartesian-derby\", JSON.stringify({\n      settings: session.settings,\n      trialBest: session.trialBest,\n    }));\n  } catch (err) {\n    /* storage can be blocked; the session still remembers */\n  }\n}\n\nfunction loadSession() {\n  try {\n    const raw = localStorage.getItem(\"kartesian-derby\");\n    if (!raw) return;\n    const data = JSON.parse(raw);\n    if (data.settings) {\n      session.settings.invertX = !!data.settings.invertX;\n      session.settings.invertY = !!data.settings.invertY;\n    }\n    if (data.trialBest && typeof data.trialBest === \"object\") session.trialBest = data.trialBest;\n  } catch (err) {\n    /* ignore unreadable storage */\n  }\n}\n\nfunction destroySim() {\n  if (!sim) return;\n  disposeScene(sim.view);\n  try {\n    sim.world.free();\n  } catch (err) {\n    /* world already released */\n  }\n  sim = null;\n}\n\nasync function mountSim(course, nextRace, parked) {\n  destroySim();\n  const phys = await createRaceWorld(course);\n  const view = buildScene(course, nextRace);\n  sim = { course, race: nextRace, world: phys.world, cone: phys.cone, view, parked: !!parked };\n}\n\nasync function showLot() {\n  const parked = createRace({\n    course: CINDER_LOOP,\n    mode: \"versus\",\n    entrants: fieldEntrants([\"pip\", \"quill\", \"bramble\", \"holt\"], \"versus\"),\n    seed: 1,\n  });\n  race = null;\n  await mountSim(CINDER_LOOP, parked, true);\n}\n\nasync function launch(mode) {\n  if (busy) return;\n  busy = true;\n  audio.unlock();\n  try {\n    if (mode === \"cup\") {\n      if (!cup || cup.index >= cup.courseIds.length) cup = createCup();\n      draft.courseId = cup.courseIds[cup.index];\n    }\n    const course = mode === \"battle\" ? BALLOON_YARD : courseById(draft.courseId);\n    const count = mode === \"cup\" || mode === \"trial\" ? 1 : draft.playerCount;\n    const ids = draft.characters.slice(0, count);\n    race = createRace({\n      course,\n      mode,\n      entrants: fieldEntrants(ids, mode),\n      seed: Math.floor(Math.random() * 1e9),\n    });\n    recorded = false;\n    outcome = null;\n    camModes.fill(\"chase\");\n    await mountSim(course, race, false);\n    session.screen = \"race\";\n    session.focus = 0;\n    session.idle = 0;\n    renderKey = \"\";\n    renderAll();\n  } finally {\n    busy = false;\n  }\n}\n\nasync function launchAttract() {\n  const course = COURSES[attractCourse % COURSES.length];\n  attractCourse += 1;\n  race = createRace({\n    course,\n    mode: \"cup\",\n    entrants: fieldEntrants([], \"cup\"),\n    attract: true,\n    seed: 20 + attractCourse,\n  });\n  recorded = false;\n  await mountSim(course, race, false);\n  session.screen = \"attract\";\n  renderKey = \"\";\n  renderAll();\n}\n\nfunction choiceButton(label, selected, onPress) {\n  const button = document.createElement(\"button\");\n  button.type = \"button\";\n  button.className = selected ? \"choice is-selected\" : \"choice\";\n  button.textContent = label;\n  button.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n    audio.unlock();\n    onPress();\n  });\n  return button;\n}\n\nfunction paintList(panel, rows) {\n  rows.forEach((row, index) => {\n    const button = choiceButton(row.label, index === session.focus, () => {\n      session.focus = index;\n      activate();\n    });\n    if (session.screen === \"title\" && row.id === \"cup\") button.id = \"start-game\";\n    panel.appendChild(button);\n    if (row.detail && index === session.focus) {\n      const note = document.createElement(\"p\");\n      note.className = \"detail\";\n      note.textContent = row.detail;\n      panel.appendChild(note);\n    }\n  });\n}\n\nfunction currentRows() {\n  if (session.screen === \"title\") return TITLE_ITEMS;\n  if (session.screen === \"help\") return [{ id: \"back\", label: \"Back\" }];\n  if (session.screen === \"players\") {\n    return [\n      { id: \"2\", label: \"Two drivers\" },\n      { id: \"3\", label: \"Three drivers\" },\n      { id: \"4\", label: \"Four drivers\" },\n      { id: \"back\", label: \"Back\" },\n    ];\n  }\n  if (session.screen === \"course\") {\n    return [\n      ...COURSES.map((course) => ({ id: course.id, label: course.name, detail: course.blurb })),\n      { id: \"back\", label: \"Back\" },\n    ];\n  }\n  if (session.screen === \"settings\") {\n    return [\n      { id: \"invertX\", label: `Invert horizontal: ${session.settings.invertX ? \"On\" : \"Off\"}` },\n      { id: \"invertY\", label: `Invert vertical: ${session.settings.invertY ? \"On\" : \"Off\"}` },\n      { id: \"back\", label: \"Back\" },\n    ];\n  }\n  if (session.screen === \"pause\") {\n    return [\n      { id: \"resume\", label: \"Resume\" },\n      { id: \"quit\", label: \"Quit to title\" },\n    ];\n  }\n  if (session.screen === \"results\") {\n    let label = \"Back to title\";\n    if (outcome && outcome.action === \"retry\") label = \"Drive it again\";\n    if (outcome && outcome.action === \"continue\") label = \"Next course\";\n    return [{ id: \"continue\", label }];\n  }\n  if (session.screen === \"about\") return [{ id: \"back\", label: \"Back\" }];\n  return [];\n}\n\nfunction paintCharacters(panel) {\n  const count = draft.mode === \"cup\" || draft.mode === \"trial\" ? 1 : draft.playerCount;\n  const lead = document.createElement(\"p\");\n  lead.className = \"detail\";\n  lead.textContent = count === 1\n    ? \"Left and right change your driver. Confirm when they look ready.\"\n    : \"Up and down pick a seat. Left and right change that driver.\";\n  panel.appendChild(lead);\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n    const character = CHARACTERS.find((entry) => entry.id === draft.characters[i]) || CHARACTERS[0];\n    const button = choiceButton(\n      `${count > 1 ? `Driver ${i + 1}: ` : \"\"}${character.name} · ${character.klass}`,\n      i === draft.slot,\n      () => {\n        draft.slot = i;\n        activate();\n      },\n    );\n    panel.appendChild(button);\n    if (i === draft.slot) {\n      const note = document.createElement(\"p\");\n      note.className = \"detail\";\n      note.textContent = character.blurb;\n      panel.appendChild(note);\n    }\n  }\n  panel.appendChild(choiceButton(\"Back\", false, () => {\n    session.screen = draft.mode === \"battle\" ? \"players\" : \"course\";\n    if (draft.mode === \"cup\") session.screen = \"title\";\n    session.focus = 0;\n    renderKey = \"\";\n    renderAll();\n  }));\n}\n\nfunction paintHelp(panel) {\n  const list = document.createElement(\"div\");\n  list.className = \"help\";\n  for (const [name, action] of CONTROL_LINES) {\n    const row = document.createElement(\"p\");\n    const key = document.createElement(\"strong\");\n    key.textContent = name;\n    row.append(key, document.createTextNode(`  ${action}`));\n    list.appendChild(row);\n  }\n  panel.appendChild(list);\n}\n\nfunction paintResults(panel) {\n  if (!race) return;\n  const order = finishOrder(race);\n  const list = document.createElement(\"ol\");\n  list.className = \"results\";\n  for (const row of order) {\n    const item = document.createElement(\"li\");\n    const time = row.time != null ? `  ${formatTime(row.time)}` : \"\";\n    const balloons = race.mode === \"battle\" ? `  ${row.eliminated ? \"out\" : `${row.balloons} balloons`}` : \"\";\n    item.textContent = `${row.name}${time}${balloons}`;\n    list.appendChild(item);\n  }\n  panel.appendChild(list);\n  const note = document.createElement(\"p\");\n  note.className = \"detail\";\n  if (race.mode === \"cup\" && outcome) {\n    note.textContent = outcome.action === \"retry\"\n      ? `P${outcome.place} is not enough. Fourth or better continues. Points stay ${outcome.total}.`\n      : outcome.action === \"continue\"\n        ? `P${outcome.place} banks ${outcome.gain}. Cup total ${outcome.total}. Next course is waiting.`\n        : `Cup complete. ${outcome.total} points. That is the whole derby.`;\n  } else if (race.mode === \"trial\" && outcome) {\n    note.textContent = outcome.improved\n      ? `New session best ${formatTime(outcome.best)}.`\n      : `Session best stays ${formatTime(outcome.best)}.`;\n  } else if (race.mode === \"battle\") {\n    note.textContent = race.winner ? `${race.winner.name} keeps the last balloon.` : \"The yard is empty.\";\n  } else {\n    note.textContent = \"That is the order they crossed, or were still running, when the humans were done.\";\n  }\n  panel.appendChild(note);\n}\n\nfunction paintAbout(panel) {\n  const pre = document.createElement(\"pre\");\n  pre.id = \"about-copy\";\n  pre.textContent = ABOUT_TEXT;\n  panel.appendChild(pre);\n}\n\nfunction renderAll() {\n  const key = JSON.stringify({\n    screen: session.screen,\n    focus: session.focus,\n    slot: draft.slot,\n    characters: draft.characters,\n    playerCount: draft.playerCount,\n    courseId: draft.courseId,\n    settings: session.settings,\n    outcome,\n    cupIndex: cup ? cup.index : -1,\n    points: cup ? cup.points : 0,\n  });\n  if (key === renderKey) return;\n  renderKey = key;\n  const title = $(\"product-title\");\n  const blurb = $(\"blurb\");\n  const panel = $(\"panel\");\n  const ui = $(\"ui\");\n  const hud = $(\"hud\");\n  if (title) title.textContent = GAME_TITLE;\n  const racing = session.screen === \"race\" || session.screen === \"attract\";\n  if (ui) ui.hidden = racing;\n  if (hud) hud.hidden = session.screen !== \"race\" && session.screen !== \"attract\" && session.screen !== \"pause\";\n  if (!panel) return;\n  panel.replaceChildren();\n  const kicker = document.createElement(\"p\");\n  kicker.className = \"kicker\";\n  const kickers = {\n    title: \"A three-lap argument\",\n    help: \"How to drive\",\n    settings: \"Settings\",\n    about: \"About\",\n    players: \"How many drivers?\",\n    course: \"Which course?\",\n    characters: \"Who is driving?\",\n    pause: \"Paused\",\n    results: \"The order\",\n  };\n  kicker.textContent = kickers[session.screen] || \"\";\n  if (kicker.textContent) panel.appendChild(kicker);\n  if (blurb) {\n    blurb.textContent = session.screen === \"title\"\n      ? \"Eight seats when the cup is full. Three laps. Try not to wear the butter.\"\n      : \"\";\n  }\n  if (session.screen === \"characters\") paintCharacters(panel);\n  else if (session.screen === \"help\") {\n    paintHelp(panel);\n    paintList(panel, currentRows());\n  } else if (session.screen === \"about\") {\n    paintAbout(panel);\n    paintList(panel, currentRows());\n  } else if (session.screen === \"results\") {\n    paintResults(panel);\n    paintList(panel, currentRows());\n  } else paintList(panel, currentRows());\n}\n\nfunction activate() {\n  audio.unlock();\n  const rows = currentRows();\n  const row = rows[session.focus];\n  if (session.screen === \"title\" && row) {\n    if (row.id === \"cup\") {\n      draft.mode = \"cup\";\n      draft.slot = 0;\n      session.screen = \"characters\";\n      session.focus = 0;\n    } else if (row.id === \"versus\") {\n      draft.mode = \"versus\";\n      session.screen = \"players\";\n      session.focus = 0;\n    } else if (row.id === \"trial\") {\n      draft.mode = \"trial\";\n      session.screen = \"course\";\n      session.focus = 0;\n    } else if (row.id === \"battle\") {\n      draft.mode = \"battle\";\n      session.screen = \"players\";\n      session.focus = 0;\n    } else if (row.id === \"help\" || row.id === \"settings\" || row.id === \"about\") {\n      session.screen = row.id;\n      session.focus = 0;\n    }\n  } else if (session.screen === \"players\" && row) {\n    if (row.id === \"back\") {\n      session.screen = \"title\";\n      session.focus = 0;\n    } else {\n      draft.playerCount = Number(row.id);\n      session.screen = draft.mode === \"battle\" ? \"characters\" : \"course\";\n      session.focus = 0;\n      draft.slot = 0;\n    }\n  } else if (session.screen === \"course\" && row) {\n    if (row.id === \"back\") {\n      session.screen = draft.mode === \"versus\" ? \"players\" : \"title\";\n      session.focus = 0;\n    } else {\n      draft.courseId = row.id;\n      session.screen = \"characters\";\n      session.focus = 0;\n      draft.slot = 0;\n    }\n  } else if (session.screen === \"characters\") {\n    launch(draft.mode);\n    return;\n  } else if (session.screen === \"settings\" && row) {\n    if (row.id === \"invertX\") session.settings.invertX = !session.settings.invertX;\n    if (row.id === \"invertY\") session.settings.invertY = !session.settings.invertY;\n    if (row.id === \"back\") {\n      session.screen = \"title\";\n      session.focus = 0;\n    }\n    saveSession();\n  } else if ((session.screen === \"help\" || session.screen === \"about\") && row && row.id === \"back\") {\n    session.screen = \"title\";\n    session.focus = 0;\n  } else if (session.screen === \"pause\" && row) {\n    if (row.id === \"resume\") session.screen = \"race\";\n    if (row.id === \"quit\") quitToTitle();\n  } else if (session.screen === \"results\" && row) {\n    if (race && race.mode === \"cup\" && outcome && outcome.action === \"retry\") launch(\"cup\");\n    else if (race && race.mode === \"cup\" && outcome && outcome.action === \"continue\") launch(\"cup\");\n    else quitToTitle();\n    return;\n  }\n  renderKey = \"\";\n  renderAll();\n}\n\nfunction quitToTitle() {\n  race = null;\n  outcome = null;\n  recorded = false;\n  session.screen = \"title\";\n  session.focus = 0;\n  session.idle = 0;\n  session.attract = false;\n  renderKey = \"\";\n  renderAll();\n  if (!busy) {\n    busy = true;\n    showLot().finally(() => {\n      busy = false;\n    });\n  }\n}\n\nfunction enterResults() {\n  if (!race || recorded) return;\n  recorded = true;\n  if (race.mode === \"cup\") outcome = recordCupResult(cup, playerPlace(race, 0));\n  else if (race.mode === \"trial\" && race.karts[0].finishTime != null) {\n    outcome = noteTrial(session.trialBest, race.course.id, race.karts[0].finishTime);\n    saveSession();\n  } else outcome = { action: \"done\" };\n  session.screen = \"results\";\n  session.focus = 0;\n  renderKey = \"\";\n  renderAll();\n}\n\nfunction cycleCharacter(dir) {\n  const count = draft.mode === \"cup\" || draft.mode === \"trial\" ? 1 : draft.playerCount;\n  const index = CHARACTERS.findIndex((character) => character.id === draft.characters[draft.slot]);\n  const next = (index + dir + CHARACTERS.length) % CHARACTERS.length;\n  draft.characters[draft.slot] = CHARACTERS[next].id;\n  renderKey = \"\";\n  renderAll();\n  void count;\n}\n\nfunction moveMenu(dy) {\n  if (session.screen === \"characters\") {\n    const count = draft.mode === \"cup\" || draft.mode === \"trial\" ? 1 : draft.playerCount;\n    draft.slot = (draft.slot + dy + count) % count;\n    renderKey = \"\";\n    renderAll();\n    return;\n  }\n  if (session.screen === \"about\" && $(\"about-copy\")) {\n    $(\"about-copy\").scrollTop += dy * 72;\n    return;\n  }\n  const rows = currentRows();\n  if (!rows.length) return;\n  session.focus = (session.focus + dy + rows.length) % rows.length;\n  renderKey = \"\";\n  renderAll();\n}\n\nfunction onMenuEdges(edgeX, edgeY, confirm, back) {\n  if (back && session.screen !== \"title\" && session.screen !== \"race\" && session.screen !== \"attract\") {\n    if (session.screen === \"pause\") {\n      session.screen = \"race\";\n      renderKey = \"\";\n      renderAll();\n      return;\n    }\n    if (session.screen === \"characters\") {\n      session.screen = draft.mode === \"cup\" ? \"title\" : draft.mode === \"battle\" ? \"players\" : \"course\";\n    } else if (session.screen === \"course\") session.screen = draft.mode === \"versus\" ? \"players\" : \"title\";\n    else session.screen = \"title\";\n    session.focus = 0;\n    renderKey = \"\";\n    renderAll();\n    return;\n  }\n  if (session.screen === \"characters\" && edgeX) cycleCharacter(edgeX);\n  if (session.screen === \"settings\" && edgeX) {\n    const rows = currentRows();\n    const row = rows[session.focus];\n    if (row && row.id === \"invertX\") session.settings.invertX = !session.settings.invertX;\n    if (row && row.id === \"invertY\") session.settings.invertY = !session.settings.invertY;\n    saveSession();\n    renderKey = \"\";\n    renderAll();\n  }\n  if (edgeY) moveMenu(edgeY);\n  if (confirm) activate();\n}\n\nfunction updateHud(time) {\n  const hud = $(\"hud\");\n  const countdown = $(\"countdown\");\n  if (!hud || !race || (session.screen !== \"race\" && session.screen !== \"attract\" && session.screen !== \"pause\")) {\n    if (countdown) countdown.textContent = \"\";\n    return;\n  }\n  const humans = race.karts.filter((kart) => kart.isPlayer);\n  const shown = humans.length ? humans : [race.karts[0]];\n  hud.dataset.players = String(Math.max(1, shown.length));\n  while (hud.children.length < shown.length) {\n    const cluster = document.createElement(\"section\");\n    cluster.className = \"cluster\";\n    for (const cls of [\"place\", \"meta\", \"speed\", \"item\"]) {\n      const node = document.createElement(\"div\");\n      node.className = cls;\n      cluster.appendChild(node);\n    }\n    const map = document.createElement(\"canvas\");\n    map.className = \"map\";\n    map.width = 180;\n    map.height = 140;\n    cluster.appendChild(map);\n    const order = document.createElement(\"ol\");\n    order.className = \"order\";\n    cluster.appendChild(order);\n    hud.appendChild(cluster);\n  }\n  [...hud.children].forEach((cluster, index) => {\n    cluster.hidden = index >= shown.length;\n    cluster.className = `cluster p${index}`;\n  });\n  shown.forEach((kart, index) => {\n    const cluster = hud.children[index];\n    const place = cluster.querySelector(\".place\");\n    const meta = cluster.querySelector(\".meta\");\n    const speed = cluster.querySelector(\".speed\");\n    const item = cluster.querySelector(\".item\");\n    place.textContent = kart.finished ? \"Finished\" : kart.eliminated ? \"Out\" : ordinal(kart.rank);\n    if (race.mode === \"battle\") meta.textContent = kart.eliminated ? \"No balloons\" : `${kart.balloons} balloons`;\n    else meta.textContent = `Lap ${kart.displayLap} / 3`;\n    speed.textContent = `${Math.round(Math.abs(kart.speed) * 3.6)} km/h`;\n    if (kart.roulette) {\n      const names = ITEM_IDS.map((id) => itemName(id));\n      item.textContent = names[Math.floor(time * 14 + index) % names.length];\n    } else if (kart.held) {\n      const charges = kart.held.charges > 1 ? ` ×${kart.held.charges}` : \"\";\n      item.textContent = `${itemName(kart.held.kind)}${kart.trailing ? \" trailing\" : charges}`;\n    } else if (kart.aegisT > 0) item.textContent = \"Full Guard\";\n    else if (kart.stormT > 0) item.textContent = \"Pepper Rain\";\n    else item.textContent = \"Empty\";\n    const map = cluster.querySelector(\".map\");\n    if (index === 0 || shown.length > 1) drawMap(map, race.course, race.karts, kart.id);\n    const order = cluster.querySelector(\".order\");\n    order.replaceChildren();\n    if (shown.length === 1 && race.mode !== \"battle\") {\n      for (const row of finishOrder(race)) {\n        const li = document.createElement(\"li\");\n        li.textContent = `${row.rank} ${row.name}`;\n        if (row.id === kart.id) li.className = \"me\";\n        order.appendChild(li);\n      }\n    }\n  });\n  if (session.screen === \"attract\") {\n    let banner = hud.querySelector(\".attract-banner\");\n    if (!banner) {\n      banner = document.createElement(\"p\");\n      banner.className = \"attract-banner\";\n      banner.textContent = \"Demo reel. Press anything.\";\n      hud.appendChild(banner);\n    }\n  } else {\n    const banner = hud.querySelector(\".attract-banner\");\n    if (banner) banner.remove();\n  }\n  if (countdown) {\n    countdown.textContent = race.phase === \"countdown\" || race.goShow > 0 ? race.countdownLabel : \"\";\n  }\n}\n\nfunction drawMap(canvas, course, karts, selfId) {\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext(\"2d\");\n  if (!ctx) return;\n  const w = canvas.width;\n  const h = canvas.height;\n  ctx.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);\n  ctx.fillStyle = \"rgba(8, 10, 16, 0.55)\";\n  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);\n  const bounds = course.bounds;\n  const spanX = Math.max(1, bounds.maxX - bounds.minX);\n  const spanZ = Math.max(1, bounds.maxZ - bounds.minZ);\n  const scale = Math.min((w - 16) / spanX, (h - 16) / spanZ);\n  const ox = w / 2 - ((bounds.minX + bounds.maxX) / 2) * scale;\n  const oy = h / 2 + ((bounds.minZ + bounds.maxZ) / 2) * scale;\n  const X = (x) => ox + x * scale;\n  const Y = (z) => oy - z * scale;\n  ctx.strokeStyle = \"#f3d7a4\";\n  ctx.lineWidth = 5;\n  ctx.lineJoin = \"round\";\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  if (course.kind === \"circuit\" && course.points.length) {\n    course.points.forEach((point, index) => {\n      if (index === 0) ctx.moveTo(X(point.x), Y(point.z));\n      else ctx.lineTo(X(point.x), Y(point.z));\n    });\n    ctx.closePath();\n    ctx.stroke();\n  } else {\n    ctx.strokeRect(X(-course.width / 2), Y(course.depth / 2), course.width * scale, course.depth * scale);\n  }\n  for (const kart of karts) {\n    ctx.fillStyle = kart.id === selfId ? \"#ffb703\" : \"#f7f3ea\";\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.arc(X(kart.x), Y(kart.z), kart.id === selfId ? 5 : 3.2, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n    ctx.fill();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction bindInput() {\n  window.addEventListener(\"keydown\", (event) => {\n    keys[event.code] = true;\n    if ([\"Space\", \"ArrowUp\", \"ArrowDown\", \"ArrowLeft\", \"ArrowRight\"].includes(event.code)) event.preventDefault();\n    audio.unlock();\n  });\n  window.addEventListener(\"keyup\", (event) => {\n    keys[event.code] = false;\n  });\n  window.addEventListener(\"blur\", () => {\n    for (const code of Object.keys(keys)) keys[code] = false;\n  });\n  const canvas = $(\"view\");\n  canvas.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n    if (session.screen === \"race\" || session.screen === \"attract\") canvas.requestPointerLock();\n  });\n  window.addEventListener(\"mousedown\", (event) => {\n    mouse.buttons[event.button] = true;\n  });\n  window.addEventListener(\"mouseup\", (event) => {\n    mouse.buttons[event.button] = false;\n  });\n  window.addEventListener(\"mousemove\", (event) => {\n    if (document.pointerLockElement === canvas) {\n      mouse.dx += event.movementX;\n      mouse.dy += event.movementY;\n    }\n  });\n  window.addEventListener(\"wheel\", (event) => {\n    if (session.screen === \"race\") {\n      mouse.wheel = true;\n      event.preventDefault();\n    }\n  }, { passive: false });\n  window.addEventListener(\"resize\", () => {\n    if (renderer) fitBuffer($(\"view\"), renderer);\n  });\n  const touchSettings = $(\"touch-settings\");\n  if (touchSettings) {\n    touchSettings.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      session.screen = \"settings\";\n      session.focus = 0;\n      session.idle = 0;\n      renderKey = \"\";\n      renderAll();\n    });\n  }\n}\n\nfunction setupTouch() {\n  const gate = $(\"touch-gate\");\n  if (!gate) return;\n  const visible = touchGateVisible({\n    coarsePointer: window.matchMedia(\"(pointer: coarse)\").matches,\n    hover: window.matchMedia(\"(hover: hover)\").matches,\n    maxTouchPoints: navigator.maxTouchPoints || 0,\n  });\n  gate.hidden = !visible;\n}\n\nfunction drainAudio() {\n  if (!race) return;\n  for (const event of race.events) {\n    if (event.type === \"countdown\") audio.countdown(event.value);\n    else if (event.type === \"impact\") audio.impact();\n    else if (event.type === \"item\" && (event.phase === \"use\" || event.phase === \"roll\" || event.phase === \"pulse\")) audio.item();\n  }\n  race.events.length = 0;\n  if (session.screen === \"race\" || session.screen === \"attract\") {\n    const humans = race.karts.filter((kart) => kart.isPlayer);\n    const heard = humans.length ? humans : race.karts.slice(0, 1);\n    heard.forEach((kart, index) => audio.engine(index, kart.speed));\n  } else audio.silence();\n}\n\nfunction renderViews(dt, time) {\n  if (!renderer || !sim) return;\n  const canvas = $(\"view\");\n  const size = fitBuffer(canvas, renderer);\n  const shownRace = sim.race;\n  animateScene(sim.view, shownRace, dt, time);\n  const live = race && (session.screen === \"race\" || session.screen === \"attract\" || session.screen === \"pause\" || session.screen === \"results\");\n  const humans = live ? race.karts.filter((kart) => kart.isPlayer) : [];\n  const views = live && humans.length ? humans : [shownRace.karts[0]];\n  const ports = live && humans.length > 1 ? viewports(humans.length, size.width, size.height) : viewports(1, size.width, size.height);\n  renderer.setScissorTest(ports.length > 1);\n  for (let i = 0; i < ports.length; i++) {\n    const port = ports[i];\n    const kart = views[i] || views[0];\n    const camera = sim.view.camera;\n    if (!(live && humans.length)) orbitCamera(camera, sim.course, time, port.w, port.h);\n    else frameCamera(camera, kart, camModes[i] || \"chase\", dt, port.w, port.h);\n    renderer.setViewport(port.x, port.y, port.w, port.h);\n    renderer.setScissor(port.x, port.y, port.w, port.h);\n    renderer.render(sim.view.scene, camera);\n  }\n}\n\nasync function frame(now) {\n  const dt = Math.min(0.05, lastFrame ? (now - lastFrame) / 1000 : 1 / 60);\n  lastFrame = now;\n  const time = now / 1000;\n  const pads = readPads();\n  const any = inputAny(pads);\n  if (swallow) swallow = false;\n  else {\n    const wasAttract = session.attract;\n    stepSession(session, dt, session.screen === \"race\" || session.screen === \"pause\" || session.screen === \"results\" ? false : any);\n    if (wasAttract && !session.attract) {\n      swallow = true;\n      race = null;\n      renderKey = \"\";\n      renderAll();\n      if (!busy) {\n        busy = true;\n        showLot().finally(() => {\n          busy = false;\n        });\n      }\n    } else if (!wasAttract && session.attract && !busy) {\n      busy = true;\n      launchAttract().finally(() => {\n        busy = false;\n      });\n    }\n  }\n  if (session.screen === \"race\" && race && !race.attract) {\n    const humans = race.karts.filter((kart) => kart.isPlayer);\n    const actions = humans.map((kart, index) => drivingActions({\n      pad: pads[kart.playerIndex] || pads[index] || null,\n      keys,\n      mouse,\n      settings: session.settings,\n      playerIndex: kart.playerIndex || 0,\n      useMouse: index === 0 && document.pointerLockElement === $(\"view\"),\n    }));\n    let paused = false;\n    actions.forEach((action, index) => {\n      const prev = drivePrev[index];\n      if (action.camera && !prev.camera) {\n        const at = CAM_CYCLE.indexOf(camModes[index] || \"chase\");\n        camModes[index] = CAM_CYCLE[(at + 1) % CAM_CYCLE.length];\n      }\n      if (action.pause && !prev.pause) paused = true;\n      drivePrev[index] = action;\n    });\n    if (paused) {\n      session.screen = \"pause\";\n      session.focus = 0;\n      renderKey = \"\";\n      renderAll();\n    } else if (race.phase !== \"finished\") {\n      stepRace(race, actions, dt);\n      drainAudio();\n      if (race.phase === \"finished\") enterResults();\n    }\n  } else if (session.screen === \"attract\" && race && !busy) {\n    if (race.phase !== \"finished\") {\n      stepRace(race, null, dt);\n      drainAudio();\n    } else {\n      busy = true;\n      launchAttract().finally(() => {\n        busy = false;\n      });\n    }\n  } else if (session.screen !== \"race\") {\n    const menuAction = drivingActions({\n      pad: pads[0] || null,\n      keys,\n      mouse: null,\n      settings: session.settings,\n      playerIndex: 0,\n      useMouse: false,\n    });\n    if (!swallow && session.screen !== \"attract\") {\n      const edgeX = menuAction.menuX && !menuPrev.menuX ? menuAction.menuX : 0;\n      const edgeY = menuAction.menuY && !menuPrev.menuY ? menuAction.menuY : 0;\n      const confirm = menuAction.confirm && !menuPrev.confirm;\n      const back = menuAction.back && !menuPrev.back;\n      if (edgeX || edgeY || confirm || back) onMenuEdges(edgeX, edgeY, confirm, back);\n    }\n    menuPrev = menuAction;\n    if (session.screen === \"pause\" && pads[0]) {\n      const pauseEdge = menuAction.pause && !menuPrev.pause;\n      if (pauseEdge && race) {\n        session.screen = \"race\";\n        renderKey = \"\";\n        renderAll();\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  if (sim && sim.world) {\n    stepWorld(sim.world, 1);\n    const pos = bodyTranslation(sim.cone);\n    sim.view.cone.position.set(pos.x, pos.y, pos.z);\n    const liveRace = race && sim.race === race ? race : null;\n    if (liveRace) {\n      liveRace.conePos = pos;\n      if (liveRace.coneImpulse) {\n        pushBody(sim.cone, liveRace.coneImpulse.x, liveRace.coneImpulse.y, liveRace.coneImpulse.z);\n        liveRace.coneImpulse = null;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  try {\n    renderViews(dt, time);\n  } catch (err) {\n    console.error(err);\n  }\n  updateHud(time);\n  mouse.dx = 0;\n  mouse.dy = 0;\n  mouse.wheel = false;\n  requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n}\n\nfunction showGate(message) {\n  const gate = $(\"gate\");\n  if (gate) {\n    gate.hidden = false;\n    gate.textContent = message;\n  }\n  document.body.dataset.boot = \"gate\";\n}\n\nfunction mount() {\n  document.title = GAME_TITLE;\n  const title = $(\"product-title\");\n  if (title) title.textContent = GAME_TITLE;\n  loadSession();\n  setupTouch();\n  bindInput();\n  renderAll();\n}\n\nasync function bootGpu() {\n  const canvas = $(\"view\");\n  fitBuffer(canvas, null);\n  const secure = window.isSecureContext && location.protocol !== \"file:\";\n  if (!secure || !navigator.gpu) {\n    showGate(\"WebGPU and a local server are required.\");\n    return;\n  }\n  let adapter = null;\n  try {\n    adapter = await navigator.gpu.requestAdapter();\n  } catch (err) {\n    adapter = null;\n  }\n  if (!adapter) {\n    showGate(\"WebGPU and a local server are required.\");\n    return;\n  }\n  try {\n    renderer = await createRenderer(canvas);\n    fitBuffer(canvas, renderer);\n    await showLot();\n    document.body.dataset.boot = \"ready\";\n    requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n  } catch (err) {\n    console.error(err);\n    showGate(\"WebGPU and a local server are required.\");\n  }\n}\n\nmount();\nbootGpu();\n"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2007,"output_tokens":15891,"cache_read_input_tokens":185984,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a17fba-2fc3-7d53-9fa6-699993e68862","uuid":"a4b3271c-bd34-486a-9bce-96cd8e4a2733"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4d0c8b76-29c2-40a2-865e-4e66aebfd58c-53","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"if (race.attract && race.karts.some((kart) => kart.finished)) {\\n    race.phase = \\\"finished\\\";\\n    return;\\n  }\",\"new_string\":\"if (race.attract && (race.karts.some((kart) => kart.finished) || race.clock > 150)) {\\n    race.phase = \\\"finished\\\";\\n    return;\\n  }\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/race.js has been updated successfully.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/race.js has been updated.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/race.js\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"if (race.attract && race.karts.some((kart) => kart.finished)) {\\n    race.phase = \\\"finished\\\";\\n    return;\\n  }\",\"old_line\":915,\"new_string\":\"if (race.attract && (race.karts.some((kart) => kart.finished) || race.clock > 150)) {\\n    race.phase = \\\"finished\\\";\\n    return;\\n  }\",\"new_line\":915,\"context_before\":\"    }\\n    return;\\n  }\\n\",\"context_after\":\"  const humans = race.karts.filter((kart) => kart.isPlayer);\\n  if (humans.length > 0 && humans.every((kart) => kart.finished)) race.phase = \\\"finished\\\";\\n  else if (race.karts.every((kart) => kart.finished)) race.phase = \\\"finished\\\";\\n\",\"line_prefix\":\"  \"}]}}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-4d0c8b76-29c2-40a2-865e-4e66aebfd58c-54","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"EditsApplied\":{\"old_string\":\"\",\"new_string\":\"import { createAudio } from \\\"./audio.js\\\";\\nimport { CHARACTERS, fieldEntrants } from \\\"./characters.js\\\";\\nimport { BALLOON_YARD, CINDER_LOOP, COURSES, courseById } from \\\"./courses.js\\\";\\nimport { ABOUT_TEXT } from \\\"./credits.js\\\";\\nimport { CONTROL_LINES, TOUCH_MESSAGE, drivingActions, neutralAction, touchGateVisible } from \\\"./input.js\\\";\\nimport { ITEM_IDS, itemName } from \\\"./items.js\\\";\\nimport { formatTime, ordinal } from \\\"./math.js\\\";\\nimport { createCup, createSession, noteTrial, playerPlace, recordCupResult, stepSession } from \\\"./modes.js\\\";\\nimport { bodyTranslation, createRaceWorld, pushBody, stepWorld } from \\\"./physics.js\\\";\\nimport { createRace, finishOrder, stepRace } from \\\"./race.js\\\";\\nimport {\\n  animateScene,\\n  buildScene,\\n  createRenderer,\\n  disposeScene,\\n  fitBuffer,\\n  frameCamera,\\n  orbitCamera,\\n  viewports,\\n} from \\\"./scene.js\\\";\\nimport { GAME_TITLE } from \\\"./titles.js\\\";\\n\\nconst TITLE_ITEMS = [\\n  { id: \\\"cup\\\", label: \\\"Grand Cup\\\", detail: \\\"Two courses. Place fourth or better, or you drive it again.\\\" },\\n  { id: \\\"versus\\\", label: \\\"Versus\\\", detail: \\\"Two, three, or four drivers. One course. Bragging rights only.\\\" },\\n  { id: \\\"trial\\\", label: \\\"Time Trial\\\", detail: \\\"No crates on the road. Three peppers already in your pocket.\\\" },\\n  { id: \\\"battle\\\", label: \\\"Balloon Battle\\\", detail: \\\"Three balloons each. Last one still floating wins the yard.\\\" },\\n  { id: \\\"help\\\", label: \\\"How to Drive\\\", detail: \\\"Triggers, stick, hop. Then the items.\\\" },\\n  { id: \\\"settings\\\", label: \\\"Settings\\\", detail: \\\"Flip a stick if the derby feels backwards.\\\" },\\n  { id: \\\"about\\\", label: \\\"About\\\", detail: \\\"Credits, the source, and how this slice was built.\\\" },\\n];\\n\\nconst CAM_CYCLE = [\\\"chase\\\", \\\"far\\\", \\\"bumper\\\"];\\nconst session = createSession();\\nconst draft = {\\n  mode: \\\"cup\\\",\\n  courseId: CINDER_LOOP.id,\\n  playerCount: 2,\\n  characters: [\\\"pip\\\", \\\"quill\\\", \\\"bramble\\\", \\\"holt\\\"],\\n  slot: 0,\\n};\\nconst audio = createAudio();\\nconst keys = Object.create(null);\\nconst mouse = { dx: 0, dy: 0, buttons: [false, false, false, false], wheel: false };\\nconst drivePrev = [neutralAction(), neutralAction(), neutralAction(), neutralAction()];\\nlet menuPrev = neutralAction();\\nlet cup = null;\\nlet race = null;\\nlet sim = null;\\nlet renderer = null;\\nlet outcome = null;\\nlet recorded = false;\\nlet attractCourse = 0;\\nlet busy = false;\\nlet swallow = false;\\nlet lastFrame = 0;\\nlet renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\nconst camModes = [\\\"chase\\\", \\\"chase\\\", \\\"chase\\\", \\\"chase\\\"];\\n\\nfunction $(id) {\\n  return document.getElementById(id);\\n}\\n\\nfunction readPads() {\\n  if (!navigator.getGamepads) return [];\\n  return [...navigator.getGamepads()].filter(Boolean).map((pad) => ({\\n    axes: [pad.axes[0] || 0, pad.axes[1] || 0, pad.axes[2] || 0, pad.axes[3] || 0],\\n    buttons: pad.buttons.map((button) => button.value || (button.pressed ? 1 : 0)),\\n  }));\\n}\\n\\nfunction inputAny(pads) {\\n  if (Object.keys(keys).some((code) => keys[code])) return true;\\n  if (mouse.buttons.some(Boolean) || mouse.wheel || Math.abs(mouse.dx) > 2) return true;\\n  return pads.some((pad) => pad.buttons.some((value) => value > 0.45) || Math.abs(pad.axes[0]) > 0.4 || Math.abs(pad.axes[1]) > 0.4);\\n}\\n\\nfunction saveSession() {\\n  try {\\n    localStorage.setItem(\\\"kartesian-derby\\\", JSON.stringify({\\n      settings: session.settings,\\n      trialBest: session.trialBest,\\n    }));\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    /* storage can be blocked; the session still remembers */\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction loadSession() {\\n  try {\\n    const raw = localStorage.getItem(\\\"kartesian-derby\\\");\\n    if (!raw) return;\\n    const data = JSON.parse(raw);\\n    if (data.settings) {\\n      session.settings.invertX = !!data.settings.invertX;\\n      session.settings.invertY = !!data.settings.invertY;\\n    }\\n    if (data.trialBest && typeof data.trialBest === \\\"object\\\") session.trialBest = data.trialBest;\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    /* ignore unreadable storage */\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction destroySim() {\\n  if (!sim) return;\\n  disposeScene(sim.view);\\n  try {\\n    sim.world.free();\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    /* world already released */\\n  }\\n  sim = null;\\n}\\n\\nasync function mountSim(course, nextRace, parked) {\\n  destroySim();\\n  const phys = await createRaceWorld(course);\\n  const view = buildScene(course, nextRace);\\n  sim = { course, race: nextRace, world: phys.world, cone: phys.cone, view, parked: !!parked };\\n}\\n\\nasync function showLot() {\\n  const parked = createRace({\\n    course: CINDER_LOOP,\\n    mode: \\\"versus\\\",\\n    entrants: fieldEntrants([\\\"pip\\\", \\\"quill\\\", \\\"bramble\\\", \\\"holt\\\"], \\\"versus\\\"),\\n    seed: 1,\\n  });\\n  race = null;\\n  await mountSim(CINDER_LOOP, parked, true);\\n}\\n\\nasync function launch(mode) {\\n  if (busy) return;\\n  busy = true;\\n  audio.unlock();\\n  try {\\n    if (mode === \\\"cup\\\") {\\n      if (!cup || cup.index >= cup.courseIds.length) cup = createCup();\\n      draft.courseId = cup.courseIds[cup.index];\\n    }\\n    const course = mode === \\\"battle\\\" ? BALLOON_YARD : courseById(draft.courseId);\\n    const count = mode === \\\"cup\\\" || mode === \\\"trial\\\" ? 1 : draft.playerCount;\\n    const ids = draft.characters.slice(0, count);\\n    race = createRace({\\n      course,\\n      mode,\\n      entrants: fieldEntrants(ids, mode),\\n      seed: Math.floor(Math.random() * 1e9),\\n    });\\n    recorded = false;\\n    outcome = null;\\n    camModes.fill(\\\"chase\\\");\\n    await mountSim(course, race, false);\\n    session.screen = \\\"race\\\";\\n    session.focus = 0;\\n    session.idle = 0;\\n    renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n    renderAll();\\n  } finally {\\n    busy = false;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function launchAttract() {\\n  const course = COURSES[attractCourse % COURSES.length];\\n  attractCourse += 1;\\n  race = createRace({\\n    course,\\n    mode: \\\"cup\\\",\\n    entrants: fieldEntrants([], \\\"cup\\\"),\\n    attract: true,\\n    seed: 20 + attractCourse,\\n  });\\n  recorded = false;\\n  await mountSim(course, race, false);\\n  session.screen = \\\"attract\\\";\\n  renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n  renderAll();\\n}\\n\\nfunction choiceButton(label, selected, onPress) {\\n  const button = document.createElement(\\\"button\\\");\\n  button.type = \\\"button\\\";\\n  button.className = selected ? \\\"choice is-selected\\\" : \\\"choice\\\";\\n  button.textContent = label;\\n  button.addEventListener(\\\"click\\\", () => {\\n    audio.unlock();\\n    onPress();\\n  });\\n  return button;\\n}\\n\\nfunction paintList(panel, rows) {\\n  rows.forEach((row, index) => {\\n    const button = choiceButton(row.label, index === session.focus, () => {\\n      session.focus = index;\\n      activate();\\n    });\\n    if (session.screen === \\\"title\\\" && row.id === \\\"cup\\\") button.id = \\\"start-game\\\";\\n    panel.appendChild(button);\\n    if (row.detail && index === session.focus) {\\n      const note = document.createElement(\\\"p\\\");\\n      note.className = \\\"detail\\\";\\n      note.textContent = row.detail;\\n      panel.appendChild(note);\\n    }\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nfunction currentRows() {\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"title\\\") return TITLE_ITEMS;\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"help\\\") return [{ id: \\\"back\\\", label: \\\"Back\\\" }];\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"players\\\") {\\n    return [\\n      { id: \\\"2\\\", label: \\\"Two drivers\\\" },\\n      { id: \\\"3\\\", label: \\\"Three drivers\\\" },\\n      { id: \\\"4\\\", label: \\\"Four drivers\\\" },\\n      { id: \\\"back\\\", label: \\\"Back\\\" },\\n    ];\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"course\\\") {\\n    return [\\n      ...COURSES.map((course) => ({ id: course.id, label: course.name, detail: course.blurb })),\\n      { id: \\\"back\\\", label: \\\"Back\\\" },\\n    ];\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"settings\\\") {\\n    return [\\n      { id: \\\"invertX\\\", label: `Invert horizontal: ${session.settings.invertX ? \\\"On\\\" : \\\"Off\\\"}` },\\n      { id: \\\"invertY\\\", label: `Invert vertical: ${session.settings.invertY ? \\\"On\\\" : \\\"Off\\\"}` },\\n      { id: \\\"back\\\", label: \\\"Back\\\" },\\n    ];\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"pause\\\") {\\n    return [\\n      { id: \\\"resume\\\", label: \\\"Resume\\\" },\\n      { id: \\\"quit\\\", label: \\\"Quit to title\\\" },\\n    ];\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"results\\\") {\\n    let label = \\\"Back to title\\\";\\n    if (outcome && outcome.action === \\\"retry\\\") label = \\\"Drive it again\\\";\\n    if (outcome && outcome.action === \\\"continue\\\") label = \\\"Next course\\\";\\n    return [{ id: \\\"continue\\\", label }];\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"about\\\") return [{ id: \\\"back\\\", label: \\\"Back\\\" }];\\n  return [];\\n}\\n\\nfunction paintCharacters(panel) {\\n  const count = draft.mode === \\\"cup\\\" || draft.mode === \\\"trial\\\" ? 1 : draft.playerCount;\\n  const lead = document.createElement(\\\"p\\\");\\n  lead.className = \\\"detail\\\";\\n  lead.textContent = count === 1\\n    ? \\\"Left and right change your driver. Confirm when they look ready.\\\"\\n    : \\\"Up and down pick a seat. Left and right change that driver.\\\";\\n  panel.appendChild(lead);\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\\n    const character = CHARACTERS.find((entry) => entry.id === draft.characters[i]) || CHARACTERS[0];\\n    const button = choiceButton(\\n      `${count > 1 ? `Driver ${i + 1}: ` : \\\"\\\"}${character.name} · ${character.klass}`,\\n      i === draft.slot,\\n      () => {\\n        draft.slot = i;\\n        activate();\\n      },\\n    );\\n    panel.appendChild(button);\\n    if (i === draft.slot) {\\n      const note = document.createElement(\\\"p\\\");\\n      note.className = \\\"detail\\\";\\n      note.textContent = character.blurb;\\n      panel.appendChild(note);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  panel.appendChild(choiceButton(\\\"Back\\\", false, () => {\\n    session.screen = draft.mode === \\\"battle\\\" ? \\\"players\\\" : \\\"course\\\";\\n    if (draft.mode === \\\"cup\\\") session.screen = \\\"title\\\";\\n    session.focus = 0;\\n    renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n    renderAll();\\n  }));\\n}\\n\\nfunction paintHelp(panel) {\\n  const list = document.createElement(\\\"div\\\");\\n  list.className = \\\"help\\\";\\n  for (const [name, action] of CONTROL_LINES) {\\n    const row = document.createElement(\\\"p\\\");\\n    const key = document.createElement(\\\"strong\\\");\\n    key.textContent = name;\\n    row.append(key, document.createTextNode(`  ${action}`));\\n    list.appendChild(row);\\n  }\\n  panel.appendChild(list);\\n}\\n\\nfunction paintResults(panel) {\\n  if (!race) return;\\n  const order = finishOrder(race);\\n  const list = document.createElement(\\\"ol\\\");\\n  list.className = \\\"results\\\";\\n  for (const row of order) {\\n    const item = document.createElement(\\\"li\\\");\\n    const time = row.time != null ? `  ${formatTime(row.time)}` : \\\"\\\";\\n    const balloons = race.mode === \\\"battle\\\" ? `  ${row.eliminated ? \\\"out\\\" : `${row.balloons} balloons`}` : \\\"\\\";\\n    item.textContent = `${row.name}${time}${balloons}`;\\n    list.appendChild(item);\\n  }\\n  panel.appendChild(list);\\n  const note = document.createElement(\\\"p\\\");\\n  note.className = \\\"detail\\\";\\n  if (race.mode === \\\"cup\\\" && outcome) {\\n    note.textContent = outcome.action === \\\"retry\\\"\\n      ? `P${outcome.place} is not enough. Fourth or better continues. Points stay ${outcome.total}.`\\n      : outcome.action === \\\"continue\\\"\\n        ? `P${outcome.place} banks ${outcome.gain}. Cup total ${outcome.total}. Next course is waiting.`\\n        : `Cup complete. ${outcome.total} points. That is the whole derby.`;\\n  } else if (race.mode === \\\"trial\\\" && outcome) {\\n    note.textContent = outcome.improved\\n      ? `New session best ${formatTime(outcome.best)}.`\\n      : `Session best stays ${formatTime(outcome.best)}.`;\\n  } else if (race.mode === \\\"battle\\\") {\\n    note.textContent = race.winner ? `${race.winner.name} keeps the last balloon.` : \\\"The yard is empty.\\\";\\n  } else {\\n    note.textContent = \\\"That is the order they crossed, or were still running, when the humans were done.\\\";\\n  }\\n  panel.appendChild(note);\\n}\\n\\nfunction paintAbout(panel) {\\n  const pre = document.createElement(\\\"pre\\\");\\n  pre.id = \\\"about-copy\\\";\\n  pre.textContent = ABOUT_TEXT;\\n  panel.appendChild(pre);\\n}\\n\\nfunction renderAll() {\\n  const key = JSON.stringify({\\n    screen: session.screen,\\n    focus: session.focus,\\n    slot: draft.slot,\\n    characters: draft.characters,\\n    playerCount: draft.playerCount,\\n    courseId: draft.courseId,\\n    settings: session.settings,\\n    outcome,\\n    cupIndex: cup ? cup.index : -1,\\n    points: cup ? cup.points : 0,\\n  });\\n  if (key === renderKey) return;\\n  renderKey = key;\\n  const title = $(\\\"product-title\\\");\\n  const blurb = $(\\\"blurb\\\");\\n  const panel = $(\\\"panel\\\");\\n  const ui = $(\\\"ui\\\");\\n  const hud = $(\\\"hud\\\");\\n  if (title) title.textContent = GAME_TITLE;\\n  const racing = session.screen === \\\"race\\\" || session.screen === \\\"attract\\\";\\n  if (ui) ui.hidden = racing;\\n  if (hud) hud.hidden = session.screen !== \\\"race\\\" && session.screen !== \\\"attract\\\" && session.screen !== \\\"pause\\\";\\n  if (!panel) return;\\n  panel.replaceChildren();\\n  const kicker = document.createElement(\\\"p\\\");\\n  kicker.className = \\\"kicker\\\";\\n  const kickers = {\\n    title: \\\"A three-lap argument\\\",\\n    help: \\\"How to drive\\\",\\n    settings: \\\"Settings\\\",\\n    about: \\\"About\\\",\\n    players: \\\"How many drivers?\\\",\\n    course: \\\"Which course?\\\",\\n    characters: \\\"Who is driving?\\\",\\n    pause: \\\"Paused\\\",\\n    results: \\\"The order\\\",\\n  };\\n  kicker.textContent = kickers[session.screen] || \\\"\\\";\\n  if (kicker.textContent) panel.appendChild(kicker);\\n  if (blurb) {\\n    blurb.textContent = session.screen === \\\"title\\\"\\n      ? \\\"Eight seats when the cup is full. Three laps. Try not to wear the butter.\\\"\\n      : \\\"\\\";\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"characters\\\") paintCharacters(panel);\\n  else if (session.screen === \\\"help\\\") {\\n    paintHelp(panel);\\n    paintList(panel, currentRows());\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"about\\\") {\\n    paintAbout(panel);\\n    paintList(panel, currentRows());\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"results\\\") {\\n    paintResults(panel);\\n    paintList(panel, currentRows());\\n  } else paintList(panel, currentRows());\\n}\\n\\nfunction activate() {\\n  audio.unlock();\\n  const rows = currentRows();\\n  const row = rows[session.focus];\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"title\\\" && row) {\\n    if (row.id === \\\"cup\\\") {\\n      draft.mode = \\\"cup\\\";\\n      draft.slot = 0;\\n      session.screen = \\\"characters\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n    } else if (row.id === \\\"versus\\\") {\\n      draft.mode = \\\"versus\\\";\\n      session.screen = \\\"players\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n    } else if (row.id === \\\"trial\\\") {\\n      draft.mode = \\\"trial\\\";\\n      session.screen = \\\"course\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n    } else if (row.id === \\\"battle\\\") {\\n      draft.mode = \\\"battle\\\";\\n      session.screen = \\\"players\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n    } else if (row.id === \\\"help\\\" || row.id === \\\"settings\\\" || row.id === \\\"about\\\") {\\n      session.screen = row.id;\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n    }\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"players\\\" && row) {\\n    if (row.id === \\\"back\\\") {\\n      session.screen = \\\"title\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n    } else {\\n      draft.playerCount = Number(row.id);\\n      session.screen = draft.mode === \\\"battle\\\" ? \\\"characters\\\" : \\\"course\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n      draft.slot = 0;\\n    }\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"course\\\" && row) {\\n    if (row.id === \\\"back\\\") {\\n      session.screen = draft.mode === \\\"versus\\\" ? \\\"players\\\" : \\\"title\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n    } else {\\n      draft.courseId = row.id;\\n      session.screen = \\\"characters\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n      draft.slot = 0;\\n    }\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"characters\\\") {\\n    launch(draft.mode);\\n    return;\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"settings\\\" && row) {\\n    if (row.id === \\\"invertX\\\") session.settings.invertX = !session.settings.invertX;\\n    if (row.id === \\\"invertY\\\") session.settings.invertY = !session.settings.invertY;\\n    if (row.id === \\\"back\\\") {\\n      session.screen = \\\"title\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n    }\\n    saveSession();\\n  } else if ((session.screen === \\\"help\\\" || session.screen === \\\"about\\\") && row && row.id === \\\"back\\\") {\\n    session.screen = \\\"title\\\";\\n    session.focus = 0;\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"pause\\\" && row) {\\n    if (row.id === \\\"resume\\\") session.screen = \\\"race\\\";\\n    if (row.id === \\\"quit\\\") quitToTitle();\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"results\\\" && row) {\\n    if (race && race.mode === \\\"cup\\\" && outcome && outcome.action === \\\"retry\\\") launch(\\\"cup\\\");\\n    else if (race && race.mode === \\\"cup\\\" && outcome && outcome.action === \\\"continue\\\") launch(\\\"cup\\\");\\n    else quitToTitle();\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n  renderAll();\\n}\\n\\nfunction quitToTitle() {\\n  race = null;\\n  outcome = null;\\n  recorded = false;\\n  session.screen = \\\"title\\\";\\n  session.focus = 0;\\n  session.idle = 0;\\n  session.attract = false;\\n  renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n  renderAll();\\n  if (!busy) {\\n    busy = true;\\n    showLot().finally(() => {\\n      busy = false;\\n    });\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction enterResults() {\\n  if (!race || recorded) return;\\n  recorded = true;\\n  if (race.mode === \\\"cup\\\") outcome = recordCupResult(cup, playerPlace(race, 0));\\n  else if (race.mode === \\\"trial\\\" && race.karts[0].finishTime != null) {\\n    outcome = noteTrial(session.trialBest, race.course.id, race.karts[0].finishTime);\\n    saveSession();\\n  } else outcome = { action: \\\"done\\\" };\\n  session.screen = \\\"results\\\";\\n  session.focus = 0;\\n  renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n  renderAll();\\n}\\n\\nfunction cycleCharacter(dir) {\\n  const count = draft.mode === \\\"cup\\\" || draft.mode === \\\"trial\\\" ? 1 : draft.playerCount;\\n  const index = CHARACTERS.findIndex((character) => character.id === draft.characters[draft.slot]);\\n  const next = (index + dir + CHARACTERS.length) % CHARACTERS.length;\\n  draft.characters[draft.slot] = CHARACTERS[next].id;\\n  renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n  renderAll();\\n  void count;\\n}\\n\\nfunction moveMenu(dy) {\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"characters\\\") {\\n    const count = draft.mode === \\\"cup\\\" || draft.mode === \\\"trial\\\" ? 1 : draft.playerCount;\\n    draft.slot = (draft.slot + dy + count) % count;\\n    renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n    renderAll();\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"about\\\" && $(\\\"about-copy\\\")) {\\n    $(\\\"about-copy\\\").scrollTop += dy * 72;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const rows = currentRows();\\n  if (!rows.length) return;\\n  session.focus = (session.focus + dy + rows.length) % rows.length;\\n  renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n  renderAll();\\n}\\n\\nfunction onMenuEdges(edgeX, edgeY, confirm, back) {\\n  if (back && session.screen !== \\\"title\\\" && session.screen !== \\\"race\\\" && session.screen !== \\\"attract\\\") {\\n    if (session.screen === \\\"pause\\\") {\\n      session.screen = \\\"race\\\";\\n      renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n      renderAll();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (session.screen === \\\"characters\\\") {\\n      session.screen = draft.mode === \\\"cup\\\" ? \\\"title\\\" : draft.mode === \\\"battle\\\" ? \\\"players\\\" : \\\"course\\\";\\n    } else if (session.screen === \\\"course\\\") session.screen = draft.mode === \\\"versus\\\" ? \\\"players\\\" : \\\"title\\\";\\n    else session.screen = \\\"title\\\";\\n    session.focus = 0;\\n    renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n    renderAll();\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"characters\\\" && edgeX) cycleCharacter(edgeX);\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"settings\\\" && edgeX) {\\n    const rows = currentRows();\\n    const row = rows[session.focus];\\n    if (row && row.id === \\\"invertX\\\") session.settings.invertX = !session.settings.invertX;\\n    if (row && row.id === \\\"invertY\\\") session.settings.invertY = !session.settings.invertY;\\n    saveSession();\\n    renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n    renderAll();\\n  }\\n  if (edgeY) moveMenu(edgeY);\\n  if (confirm) activate();\\n}\\n\\nfunction updateHud(time) {\\n  const hud = $(\\\"hud\\\");\\n  const countdown = $(\\\"countdown\\\");\\n  if (!hud || !race || (session.screen !== \\\"race\\\" && session.screen !== \\\"attract\\\" && session.screen !== \\\"pause\\\")) {\\n    if (countdown) countdown.textContent = \\\"\\\";\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const humans = race.karts.filter((kart) => kart.isPlayer);\\n  const shown = humans.length ? humans : [race.karts[0]];\\n  hud.dataset.players = String(Math.max(1, shown.length));\\n  while (hud.children.length < shown.length) {\\n    const cluster = document.createElement(\\\"section\\\");\\n    cluster.className = \\\"cluster\\\";\\n    for (const cls of [\\\"place\\\", \\\"meta\\\", \\\"speed\\\", \\\"item\\\"]) {\\n      const node = document.createElement(\\\"div\\\");\\n      node.className = cls;\\n      cluster.appendChild(node);\\n    }\\n    const map = document.createElement(\\\"canvas\\\");\\n    map.className = \\\"map\\\";\\n    map.width = 180;\\n    map.height = 140;\\n    cluster.appendChild(map);\\n    const order = document.createElement(\\\"ol\\\");\\n    order.className = \\\"order\\\";\\n    cluster.appendChild(order);\\n    hud.appendChild(cluster);\\n  }\\n  [...hud.children].forEach((cluster, index) => {\\n    cluster.hidden = index >= shown.length;\\n    cluster.className = `cluster p${index}`;\\n  });\\n  shown.forEach((kart, index) => {\\n    const cluster = hud.children[index];\\n    const place = cluster.querySelector(\\\".place\\\");\\n    const meta = cluster.querySelector(\\\".meta\\\");\\n    const speed = cluster.querySelector(\\\".speed\\\");\\n    const item = cluster.querySelector(\\\".item\\\");\\n    place.textContent = kart.finished ? \\\"Finished\\\" : kart.eliminated ? \\\"Out\\\" : ordinal(kart.rank);\\n    if (race.mode === \\\"battle\\\") meta.textContent = kart.eliminated ? \\\"No balloons\\\" : `${kart.balloons} balloons`;\\n    else meta.textContent = `Lap ${kart.displayLap} / 3`;\\n    speed.textContent = `${Math.round(Math.abs(kart.speed) * 3.6)} km/h`;\\n    if (kart.roulette) {\\n      const names = ITEM_IDS.map((id) => itemName(id));\\n      item.textContent = names[Math.floor(time * 14 + index) % names.length];\\n    } else if (kart.held) {\\n      const charges = kart.held.charges > 1 ? ` ×${kart.held.charges}` : \\\"\\\";\\n      item.textContent = `${itemName(kart.held.kind)}${kart.trailing ? \\\" trailing\\\" : charges}`;\\n    } else if (kart.aegisT > 0) item.textContent = \\\"Full Guard\\\";\\n    else if (kart.stormT > 0) item.textContent = \\\"Pepper Rain\\\";\\n    else item.textContent = \\\"Empty\\\";\\n    const map = cluster.querySelector(\\\".map\\\");\\n    if (index === 0 || shown.length > 1) drawMap(map, race.course, race.karts, kart.id);\\n    const order = cluster.querySelector(\\\".order\\\");\\n    order.replaceChildren();\\n    if (shown.length === 1 && race.mode !== \\\"battle\\\") {\\n      for (const row of finishOrder(race)) {\\n        const li = document.createElement(\\\"li\\\");\\n        li.textContent = `${row.rank} ${row.name}`;\\n        if (row.id === kart.id) li.className = \\\"me\\\";\\n        order.appendChild(li);\\n      }\\n    }\\n  });\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"attract\\\") {\\n    let banner = hud.querySelector(\\\".attract-banner\\\");\\n    if (!banner) {\\n      banner = document.createElement(\\\"p\\\");\\n      banner.className = \\\"attract-banner\\\";\\n      banner.textContent = \\\"Demo reel. Press anything.\\\";\\n      hud.appendChild(banner);\\n    }\\n  } else {\\n    const banner = hud.querySelector(\\\".attract-banner\\\");\\n    if (banner) banner.remove();\\n  }\\n  if (countdown) {\\n    countdown.textContent = race.phase === \\\"countdown\\\" || race.goShow > 0 ? race.countdownLabel : \\\"\\\";\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction drawMap(canvas, course, karts, selfId) {\\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext(\\\"2d\\\");\\n  if (!ctx) return;\\n  const w = canvas.width;\\n  const h = canvas.height;\\n  ctx.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \\\"rgba(8, 10, 16, 0.55)\\\";\\n  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);\\n  const bounds = course.bounds;\\n  const spanX = Math.max(1, bounds.maxX - bounds.minX);\\n  const spanZ = Math.max(1, bounds.maxZ - bounds.minZ);\\n  const scale = Math.min((w - 16) / spanX, (h - 16) / spanZ);\\n  const ox = w / 2 - ((bounds.minX + bounds.maxX) / 2) * scale;\\n  const oy = h / 2 + ((bounds.minZ + bounds.maxZ) / 2) * scale;\\n  const X = (x) => ox + x * scale;\\n  const Y = (z) => oy - z * scale;\\n  ctx.strokeStyle = \\\"#f3d7a4\\\";\\n  ctx.lineWidth = 5;\\n  ctx.lineJoin = \\\"round\\\";\\n  ctx.beginPath();\\n  if (course.kind === \\\"circuit\\\" && course.points.length) {\\n    course.points.forEach((point, index) => {\\n      if (index === 0) ctx.moveTo(X(point.x), Y(point.z));\\n      else ctx.lineTo(X(point.x), Y(point.z));\\n    });\\n    ctx.closePath();\\n    ctx.stroke();\\n  } else {\\n    ctx.strokeRect(X(-course.width / 2), Y(course.depth / 2), course.width * scale, course.depth * scale);\\n  }\\n  for (const kart of karts) {\\n    ctx.fillStyle = kart.id === selfId ? \\\"#ffb703\\\" : \\\"#f7f3ea\\\";\\n    ctx.beginPath();\\n    ctx.arc(X(kart.x), Y(kart.z), kart.id === selfId ? 5 : 3.2, 0, Math.PI * 2);\\n    ctx.fill();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction bindInput() {\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"keydown\\\", (event) => {\\n    keys[event.code] = true;\\n    if ([\\\"Space\\\", \\\"ArrowUp\\\", \\\"ArrowDown\\\", \\\"ArrowLeft\\\", \\\"ArrowRight\\\"].includes(event.code)) event.preventDefault();\\n    audio.unlock();\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"keyup\\\", (event) => {\\n    keys[event.code] = false;\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"blur\\\", () => {\\n    for (const code of Object.keys(keys)) keys[code] = false;\\n  });\\n  const canvas = $(\\\"view\\\");\\n  canvas.addEventListener(\\\"click\\\", () => {\\n    if (session.screen === \\\"race\\\" || session.screen === \\\"attract\\\") canvas.requestPointerLock();\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"mousedown\\\", (event) => {\\n    mouse.buttons[event.button] = true;\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"mouseup\\\", (event) => {\\n    mouse.buttons[event.button] = false;\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"mousemove\\\", (event) => {\\n    if (document.pointerLockElement === canvas) {\\n      mouse.dx += event.movementX;\\n      mouse.dy += event.movementY;\\n    }\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"wheel\\\", (event) => {\\n    if (session.screen === \\\"race\\\") {\\n      mouse.wheel = true;\\n      event.preventDefault();\\n    }\\n  }, { passive: false });\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"resize\\\", () => {\\n    if (renderer) fitBuffer($(\\\"view\\\"), renderer);\\n  });\\n  const touchSettings = $(\\\"touch-settings\\\");\\n  if (touchSettings) {\\n    touchSettings.addEventListener(\\\"click\\\", () => {\\n      session.screen = \\\"settings\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n      session.idle = 0;\\n      renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n      renderAll();\\n    });\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction setupTouch() {\\n  const gate = $(\\\"touch-gate\\\");\\n  if (!gate) return;\\n  const visible = touchGateVisible({\\n    coarsePointer: window.matchMedia(\\\"(pointer: coarse)\\\").matches,\\n    hover: window.matchMedia(\\\"(hover: hover)\\\").matches,\\n    maxTouchPoints: navigator.maxTouchPoints || 0,\\n  });\\n  gate.hidden = !visible;\\n}\\n\\nfunction drainAudio() {\\n  if (!race) return;\\n  for (const event of race.events) {\\n    if (event.type === \\\"countdown\\\") audio.countdown(event.value);\\n    else if (event.type === \\\"impact\\\") audio.impact();\\n    else if (event.type === \\\"item\\\" && (event.phase === \\\"use\\\" || event.phase === \\\"roll\\\" || event.phase === \\\"pulse\\\")) audio.item();\\n  }\\n  race.events.length = 0;\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"race\\\" || session.screen === \\\"attract\\\") {\\n    const humans = race.karts.filter((kart) => kart.isPlayer);\\n    const heard = humans.length ? humans : race.karts.slice(0, 1);\\n    heard.forEach((kart, index) => audio.engine(index, kart.speed));\\n  } else audio.silence();\\n}\\n\\nfunction renderViews(dt, time) {\\n  if (!renderer || !sim) return;\\n  const canvas = $(\\\"view\\\");\\n  const size = fitBuffer(canvas, renderer);\\n  const shownRace = sim.race;\\n  animateScene(sim.view, shownRace, dt, time);\\n  const live = race && (session.screen === \\\"race\\\" || session.screen === \\\"attract\\\" || session.screen === \\\"pause\\\" || session.screen === \\\"results\\\");\\n  const humans = live ? race.karts.filter((kart) => kart.isPlayer) : [];\\n  const views = live && humans.length ? humans : [shownRace.karts[0]];\\n  const ports = live && humans.length > 1 ? viewports(humans.length, size.width, size.height) : viewports(1, size.width, size.height);\\n  renderer.setScissorTest(ports.length > 1);\\n  for (let i = 0; i < ports.length; i++) {\\n    const port = ports[i];\\n    const kart = views[i] || views[0];\\n    const camera = sim.view.camera;\\n    if (!(live && humans.length)) orbitCamera(camera, sim.course, time, port.w, port.h);\\n    else frameCamera(camera, kart, camModes[i] || \\\"chase\\\", dt, port.w, port.h);\\n    renderer.setViewport(port.x, port.y, port.w, port.h);\\n    renderer.setScissor(port.x, port.y, port.w, port.h);\\n    renderer.render(sim.view.scene, camera);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function frame(now) {\\n  const dt = Math.min(0.05, lastFrame ? (now - lastFrame) / 1000 : 1 / 60);\\n  lastFrame = now;\\n  const time = now / 1000;\\n  const pads = readPads();\\n  const any = inputAny(pads);\\n  if (swallow) swallow = false;\\n  else {\\n    const wasAttract = session.attract;\\n    stepSession(session, dt, session.screen === \\\"race\\\" || session.screen === \\\"pause\\\" || session.screen === \\\"results\\\" ? false : any);\\n    if (wasAttract && !session.attract) {\\n      swallow = true;\\n      race = null;\\n      renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n      renderAll();\\n      if (!busy) {\\n        busy = true;\\n        showLot().finally(() => {\\n          busy = false;\\n        });\\n      }\\n    } else if (!wasAttract && session.attract && !busy) {\\n      busy = true;\\n      launchAttract().finally(() => {\\n        busy = false;\\n      });\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"race\\\" && race && !race.attract) {\\n    const humans = race.karts.filter((kart) => kart.isPlayer);\\n    const actions = humans.map((kart, index) => drivingActions({\\n      pad: pads[kart.playerIndex] || pads[index] || null,\\n      keys,\\n      mouse,\\n      settings: session.settings,\\n      playerIndex: kart.playerIndex || 0,\\n      useMouse: index === 0 && document.pointerLockElement === $(\\\"view\\\"),\\n    }));\\n    let paused = false;\\n    actions.forEach((action, index) => {\\n      const prev = drivePrev[index];\\n      if (action.camera && !prev.camera) {\\n        const at = CAM_CYCLE.indexOf(camModes[index] || \\\"chase\\\");\\n        camModes[index] = CAM_CYCLE[(at + 1) % CAM_CYCLE.length];\\n      }\\n      if (action.pause && !prev.pause) paused = true;\\n      drivePrev[index] = action;\\n    });\\n    if (paused) {\\n      session.screen = \\\"pause\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n      renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n      renderAll();\\n    } else if (race.phase !== \\\"finished\\\") {\\n      stepRace(race, actions, dt);\\n      drainAudio();\\n      if (race.phase === \\\"finished\\\") enterResults();\\n    }\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"attract\\\" && race && !busy) {\\n    if (race.phase !== \\\"finished\\\") {\\n      stepRace(race, null, dt);\\n      drainAudio();\\n    } else {\\n      busy = true;\\n      launchAttract().finally(() => {\\n        busy = false;\\n      });\\n    }\\n  } else if (session.screen !== \\\"race\\\") {\\n    const menuAction = drivingActions({\\n      pad: pads[0] || null,\\n      keys,\\n      mouse: null,\\n      settings: session.settings,\\n      playerIndex: 0,\\n      useMouse: false,\\n    });\\n    if (!swallow && session.screen !== \\\"attract\\\") {\\n      const edgeX = menuAction.menuX && !menuPrev.menuX ? menuAction.menuX : 0;\\n      const edgeY = menuAction.menuY && !menuPrev.menuY ? menuAction.menuY : 0;\\n      const confirm = menuAction.confirm && !menuPrev.confirm;\\n      const back = menuAction.back && !menuPrev.back;\\n      if (edgeX || edgeY || confirm || back) onMenuEdges(edgeX, edgeY, confirm, back);\\n    }\\n    menuPrev = menuAction;\\n    if (session.screen === \\\"pause\\\" && pads[0]) {\\n      const pauseEdge = menuAction.pause && !menuPrev.pause;\\n      if (pauseEdge && race) {\\n        session.screen = \\\"race\\\";\\n        renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n        renderAll();\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (sim && sim.world) {\\n    stepWorld(sim.world, 1);\\n    const pos = bodyTranslation(sim.cone);\\n    sim.view.cone.position.set(pos.x, pos.y, pos.z);\\n    const liveRace = race && sim.race === race ? race : null;\\n    if (liveRace) {\\n      liveRace.conePos = pos;\\n      if (liveRace.coneImpulse) {\\n        pushBody(sim.cone, liveRace.coneImpulse.x, liveRace.coneImpulse.y, liveRace.coneImpulse.z);\\n        liveRace.coneImpulse = null;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  try {\\n    renderViews(dt, time);\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    console.error(err);\\n  }\\n  updateHud(time);\\n  mouse.dx = 0;\\n  mouse.dy = 0;\\n  mouse.wheel = false;\\n  requestAnimationFrame(frame);\\n}\\n\\nfunction showGate(message) {\\n  const gate = $(\\\"gate\\\");\\n  if (gate) {\\n    gate.hidden = false;\\n    gate.textContent = message;\\n  }\\n  document.body.dataset.boot = \\\"gate\\\";\\n}\\n\\nfunction mount() {\\n  document.title = GAME_TITLE;\\n  const title = $(\\\"product-title\\\");\\n  if (title) title.textContent = GAME_TITLE;\\n  loadSession();\\n  setupTouch();\\n  bindInput();\\n  renderAll();\\n}\\n\\nasync function bootGpu() {\\n  const canvas = $(\\\"view\\\");\\n  fitBuffer(canvas, null);\\n  const secure = window.isSecureContext && location.protocol !== \\\"file:\\\";\\n  if (!secure || !navigator.gpu) {\\n    showGate(\\\"WebGPU and a local server are required.\\\");\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  let adapter = null;\\n  try {\\n    adapter = await navigator.gpu.requestAdapter();\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    adapter = null;\\n  }\\n  if (!adapter) {\\n    showGate(\\\"WebGPU and a local server are required.\\\");\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  try {\\n    renderer = await createRenderer(canvas);\\n    fitBuffer(canvas, renderer);\\n    await showLot();\\n    document.body.dataset.boot = \\\"ready\\\";\\n    requestAnimationFrame(frame);\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    console.error(err);\\n    showGate(\\\"WebGPU and a local server are required.\\\");\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nmount();\\nbootGpu();\\n\",\"tool_output_for_prompt\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/main.js has been created.\",\"tool_output_for_prompt_concise\":\"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/main.js has been created.\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/main.js\",\"edits\":{\"details\":[{\"old_string\":\"\",\"old_line\":1,\"new_string\":\"import { createAudio } from \\\"./audio.js\\\";\\nimport { CHARACTERS, fieldEntrants } from \\\"./characters.js\\\";\\nimport { BALLOON_YARD, CINDER_LOOP, COURSES, courseById } from \\\"./courses.js\\\";\\nimport { ABOUT_TEXT } from \\\"./credits.js\\\";\\nimport { CONTROL_LINES, TOUCH_MESSAGE, drivingActions, neutralAction, touchGateVisible } from \\\"./input.js\\\";\\nimport { ITEM_IDS, itemName } from \\\"./items.js\\\";\\nimport { formatTime, ordinal } from \\\"./math.js\\\";\\nimport { createCup, createSession, noteTrial, playerPlace, recordCupResult, stepSession } from \\\"./modes.js\\\";\\nimport { bodyTranslation, createRaceWorld, pushBody, stepWorld } from \\\"./physics.js\\\";\\nimport { createRace, finishOrder, stepRace } from \\\"./race.js\\\";\\nimport {\\n  animateScene,\\n  buildScene,\\n  createRenderer,\\n  disposeScene,\\n  fitBuffer,\\n  frameCamera,\\n  orbitCamera,\\n  viewports,\\n} from \\\"./scene.js\\\";\\nimport { GAME_TITLE } from \\\"./titles.js\\\";\\n\\nconst TITLE_ITEMS = [\\n  { id: \\\"cup\\\", label: \\\"Grand Cup\\\", detail: \\\"Two courses. Place fourth or better, or you drive it again.\\\" },\\n  { id: \\\"versus\\\", label: \\\"Versus\\\", detail: \\\"Two, three, or four drivers. One course. Bragging rights only.\\\" },\\n  { id: \\\"trial\\\", label: \\\"Time Trial\\\", detail: \\\"No crates on the road. Three peppers already in your pocket.\\\" },\\n  { id: \\\"battle\\\", label: \\\"Balloon Battle\\\", detail: \\\"Three balloons each. Last one still floating wins the yard.\\\" },\\n  { id: \\\"help\\\", label: \\\"How to Drive\\\", detail: \\\"Triggers, stick, hop. Then the items.\\\" },\\n  { id: \\\"settings\\\", label: \\\"Settings\\\", detail: \\\"Flip a stick if the derby feels backwards.\\\" },\\n  { id: \\\"about\\\", label: \\\"About\\\", detail: \\\"Credits, the source, and how this slice was built.\\\" },\\n];\\n\\nconst CAM_CYCLE = [\\\"chase\\\", \\\"far\\\", \\\"bumper\\\"];\\nconst session = createSession();\\nconst draft = {\\n  mode: \\\"cup\\\",\\n  courseId: CINDER_LOOP.id,\\n  playerCount: 2,\\n  characters: [\\\"pip\\\", \\\"quill\\\", \\\"bramble\\\", \\\"holt\\\"],\\n  slot: 0,\\n};\\nconst audio = createAudio();\\nconst keys = Object.create(null);\\nconst mouse = { dx: 0, dy: 0, buttons: [false, false, false, false], wheel: false };\\nconst drivePrev = [neutralAction(), neutralAction(), neutralAction(), neutralAction()];\\nlet menuPrev = neutralAction();\\nlet cup = null;\\nlet race = null;\\nlet sim = null;\\nlet renderer = null;\\nlet outcome = null;\\nlet recorded = false;\\nlet attractCourse = 0;\\nlet busy = false;\\nlet swallow = false;\\nlet lastFrame = 0;\\nlet renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\nconst camModes = [\\\"chase\\\", \\\"chase\\\", \\\"chase\\\", \\\"chase\\\"];\\n\\nfunction $(id) {\\n  return document.getElementById(id);\\n}\\n\\nfunction readPads() {\\n  if (!navigator.getGamepads) return [];\\n  return [...navigator.getGamepads()].filter(Boolean).map((pad) => ({\\n    axes: [pad.axes[0] || 0, pad.axes[1] || 0, pad.axes[2] || 0, pad.axes[3] || 0],\\n    buttons: pad.buttons.map((button) => button.value || (button.pressed ? 1 : 0)),\\n  }));\\n}\\n\\nfunction inputAny(pads) {\\n  if (Object.keys(keys).some((code) => keys[code])) return true;\\n  if (mouse.buttons.some(Boolean) || mouse.wheel || Math.abs(mouse.dx) > 2) return true;\\n  return pads.some((pad) => pad.buttons.some((value) => value > 0.45) || Math.abs(pad.axes[0]) > 0.4 || Math.abs(pad.axes[1]) > 0.4);\\n}\\n\\nfunction saveSession() {\\n  try {\\n    localStorage.setItem(\\\"kartesian-derby\\\", JSON.stringify({\\n      settings: session.settings,\\n      trialBest: session.trialBest,\\n    }));\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    /* storage can be blocked; the session still remembers */\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction loadSession() {\\n  try {\\n    const raw = localStorage.getItem(\\\"kartesian-derby\\\");\\n    if (!raw) return;\\n    const data = JSON.parse(raw);\\n    if (data.settings) {\\n      session.settings.invertX = !!data.settings.invertX;\\n      session.settings.invertY = !!data.settings.invertY;\\n    }\\n    if (data.trialBest && typeof data.trialBest === \\\"object\\\") session.trialBest = data.trialBest;\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    /* ignore unreadable storage */\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction destroySim() {\\n  if (!sim) return;\\n  disposeScene(sim.view);\\n  try {\\n    sim.world.free();\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    /* world already released */\\n  }\\n  sim = null;\\n}\\n\\nasync function mountSim(course, nextRace, parked) {\\n  destroySim();\\n  const phys = await createRaceWorld(course);\\n  const view = buildScene(course, nextRace);\\n  sim = { course, race: nextRace, world: phys.world, cone: phys.cone, view, parked: !!parked };\\n}\\n\\nasync function showLot() {\\n  const parked = createRace({\\n    course: CINDER_LOOP,\\n    mode: \\\"versus\\\",\\n    entrants: fieldEntrants([\\\"pip\\\", \\\"quill\\\", \\\"bramble\\\", \\\"holt\\\"], \\\"versus\\\"),\\n    seed: 1,\\n  });\\n  race = null;\\n  await mountSim(CINDER_LOOP, parked, true);\\n}\\n\\nasync function launch(mode) {\\n  if (busy) return;\\n  busy = true;\\n  audio.unlock();\\n  try {\\n    if (mode === \\\"cup\\\") {\\n      if (!cup || cup.index >= cup.courseIds.length) cup = createCup();\\n      draft.courseId = cup.courseIds[cup.index];\\n    }\\n    const course = mode === \\\"battle\\\" ? BALLOON_YARD : courseById(draft.courseId);\\n    const count = mode === \\\"cup\\\" || mode === \\\"trial\\\" ? 1 : draft.playerCount;\\n    const ids = draft.characters.slice(0, count);\\n    race = createRace({\\n      course,\\n      mode,\\n      entrants: fieldEntrants(ids, mode),\\n      seed: Math.floor(Math.random() * 1e9),\\n    });\\n    recorded = false;\\n    outcome = null;\\n    camModes.fill(\\\"chase\\\");\\n    await mountSim(course, race, false);\\n    session.screen = \\\"race\\\";\\n    session.focus = 0;\\n    session.idle = 0;\\n    renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n    renderAll();\\n  } finally {\\n    busy = false;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function launchAttract() {\\n  const course = COURSES[attractCourse % COURSES.length];\\n  attractCourse += 1;\\n  race = createRace({\\n    course,\\n    mode: \\\"cup\\\",\\n    entrants: fieldEntrants([], \\\"cup\\\"),\\n    attract: true,\\n    seed: 20 + attractCourse,\\n  });\\n  recorded = false;\\n  await mountSim(course, race, false);\\n  session.screen = \\\"attract\\\";\\n  renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n  renderAll();\\n}\\n\\nfunction choiceButton(label, selected, onPress) {\\n  const button = document.createElement(\\\"button\\\");\\n  button.type = \\\"button\\\";\\n  button.className = selected ? \\\"choice is-selected\\\" : \\\"choice\\\";\\n  button.textContent = label;\\n  button.addEventListener(\\\"click\\\", () => {\\n    audio.unlock();\\n    onPress();\\n  });\\n  return button;\\n}\\n\\nfunction paintList(panel, rows) {\\n  rows.forEach((row, index) => {\\n    const button = choiceButton(row.label, index === session.focus, () => {\\n      session.focus = index;\\n      activate();\\n    });\\n    if (session.screen === \\\"title\\\" && row.id === \\\"cup\\\") button.id = \\\"start-game\\\";\\n    panel.appendChild(button);\\n    if (row.detail && index === session.focus) {\\n      const note = document.createElement(\\\"p\\\");\\n      note.className = \\\"detail\\\";\\n      note.textContent = row.detail;\\n      panel.appendChild(note);\\n    }\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nfunction currentRows() {\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"title\\\") return TITLE_ITEMS;\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"help\\\") return [{ id: \\\"back\\\", label: \\\"Back\\\" }];\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"players\\\") {\\n    return [\\n      { id: \\\"2\\\", label: \\\"Two drivers\\\" },\\n      { id: \\\"3\\\", label: \\\"Three drivers\\\" },\\n      { id: \\\"4\\\", label: \\\"Four drivers\\\" },\\n      { id: \\\"back\\\", label: \\\"Back\\\" },\\n    ];\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"course\\\") {\\n    return [\\n      ...COURSES.map((course) => ({ id: course.id, label: course.name, detail: course.blurb })),\\n      { id: \\\"back\\\", label: \\\"Back\\\" },\\n    ];\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"settings\\\") {\\n    return [\\n      { id: \\\"invertX\\\", label: `Invert horizontal: ${session.settings.invertX ? \\\"On\\\" : \\\"Off\\\"}` },\\n      { id: \\\"invertY\\\", label: `Invert vertical: ${session.settings.invertY ? \\\"On\\\" : \\\"Off\\\"}` },\\n      { id: \\\"back\\\", label: \\\"Back\\\" },\\n    ];\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"pause\\\") {\\n    return [\\n      { id: \\\"resume\\\", label: \\\"Resume\\\" },\\n      { id: \\\"quit\\\", label: \\\"Quit to title\\\" },\\n    ];\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"results\\\") {\\n    let label = \\\"Back to title\\\";\\n    if (outcome && outcome.action === \\\"retry\\\") label = \\\"Drive it again\\\";\\n    if (outcome && outcome.action === \\\"continue\\\") label = \\\"Next course\\\";\\n    return [{ id: \\\"continue\\\", label }];\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"about\\\") return [{ id: \\\"back\\\", label: \\\"Back\\\" }];\\n  return [];\\n}\\n\\nfunction paintCharacters(panel) {\\n  const count = draft.mode === \\\"cup\\\" || draft.mode === \\\"trial\\\" ? 1 : draft.playerCount;\\n  const lead = document.createElement(\\\"p\\\");\\n  lead.className = \\\"detail\\\";\\n  lead.textContent = count === 1\\n    ? \\\"Left and right change your driver. Confirm when they look ready.\\\"\\n    : \\\"Up and down pick a seat. Left and right change that driver.\\\";\\n  panel.appendChild(lead);\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\\n    const character = CHARACTERS.find((entry) => entry.id === draft.characters[i]) || CHARACTERS[0];\\n    const button = choiceButton(\\n      `${count > 1 ? `Driver ${i + 1}: ` : \\\"\\\"}${character.name} · ${character.klass}`,\\n      i === draft.slot,\\n      () => {\\n        draft.slot = i;\\n        activate();\\n      },\\n    );\\n    panel.appendChild(button);\\n    if (i === draft.slot) {\\n      const note = document.createElement(\\\"p\\\");\\n      note.className = \\\"detail\\\";\\n      note.textContent = character.blurb;\\n      panel.appendChild(note);\\n    }\\n  }\\n  panel.appendChild(choiceButton(\\\"Back\\\", false, () => {\\n    session.screen = draft.mode === \\\"battle\\\" ? \\\"players\\\" : \\\"course\\\";\\n    if (draft.mode === \\\"cup\\\") session.screen = \\\"title\\\";\\n    session.focus = 0;\\n    renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n    renderAll();\\n  }));\\n}\\n\\nfunction paintHelp(panel) {\\n  const list = document.createElement(\\\"div\\\");\\n  list.className = \\\"help\\\";\\n  for (const [name, action] of CONTROL_LINES) {\\n    const row = document.createElement(\\\"p\\\");\\n    const key = document.createElement(\\\"strong\\\");\\n    key.textContent = name;\\n    row.append(key, document.createTextNode(`  ${action}`));\\n    list.appendChild(row);\\n  }\\n  panel.appendChild(list);\\n}\\n\\nfunction paintResults(panel) {\\n  if (!race) return;\\n  const order = finishOrder(race);\\n  const list = document.createElement(\\\"ol\\\");\\n  list.className = \\\"results\\\";\\n  for (const row of order) {\\n    const item = document.createElement(\\\"li\\\");\\n    const time = row.time != null ? `  ${formatTime(row.time)}` : \\\"\\\";\\n    const balloons = race.mode === \\\"battle\\\" ? `  ${row.eliminated ? \\\"out\\\" : `${row.balloons} balloons`}` : \\\"\\\";\\n    item.textContent = `${row.name}${time}${balloons}`;\\n    list.appendChild(item);\\n  }\\n  panel.appendChild(list);\\n  const note = document.createElement(\\\"p\\\");\\n  note.className = \\\"detail\\\";\\n  if (race.mode === \\\"cup\\\" && outcome) {\\n    note.textContent = outcome.action === \\\"retry\\\"\\n      ? `P${outcome.place} is not enough. Fourth or better continues. Points stay ${outcome.total}.`\\n      : outcome.action === \\\"continue\\\"\\n        ? `P${outcome.place} banks ${outcome.gain}. Cup total ${outcome.total}. Next course is waiting.`\\n        : `Cup complete. ${outcome.total} points. That is the whole derby.`;\\n  } else if (race.mode === \\\"trial\\\" && outcome) {\\n    note.textContent = outcome.improved\\n      ? `New session best ${formatTime(outcome.best)}.`\\n      : `Session best stays ${formatTime(outcome.best)}.`;\\n  } else if (race.mode === \\\"battle\\\") {\\n    note.textContent = race.winner ? `${race.winner.name} keeps the last balloon.` : \\\"The yard is empty.\\\";\\n  } else {\\n    note.textContent = \\\"That is the order they crossed, or were still running, when the humans were done.\\\";\\n  }\\n  panel.appendChild(note);\\n}\\n\\nfunction paintAbout(panel) {\\n  const pre = document.createElement(\\\"pre\\\");\\n  pre.id = \\\"about-copy\\\";\\n  pre.textContent = ABOUT_TEXT;\\n  panel.appendChild(pre);\\n}\\n\\nfunction renderAll() {\\n  const key = JSON.stringify({\\n    screen: session.screen,\\n    focus: session.focus,\\n    slot: draft.slot,\\n    characters: draft.characters,\\n    playerCount: draft.playerCount,\\n    courseId: draft.courseId,\\n    settings: session.settings,\\n    outcome,\\n    cupIndex: cup ? cup.index : -1,\\n    points: cup ? cup.points : 0,\\n  });\\n  if (key === renderKey) return;\\n  renderKey = key;\\n  const title = $(\\\"product-title\\\");\\n  const blurb = $(\\\"blurb\\\");\\n  const panel = $(\\\"panel\\\");\\n  const ui = $(\\\"ui\\\");\\n  const hud = $(\\\"hud\\\");\\n  if (title) title.textContent = GAME_TITLE;\\n  const racing = session.screen === \\\"race\\\" || session.screen === \\\"attract\\\";\\n  if (ui) ui.hidden = racing;\\n  if (hud) hud.hidden = session.screen !== \\\"race\\\" && session.screen !== \\\"attract\\\" && session.screen !== \\\"pause\\\";\\n  if (!panel) return;\\n  panel.replaceChildren();\\n  const kicker = document.createElement(\\\"p\\\");\\n  kicker.className = \\\"kicker\\\";\\n  const kickers = {\\n    title: \\\"A three-lap argument\\\",\\n    help: \\\"How to drive\\\",\\n    settings: \\\"Settings\\\",\\n    about: \\\"About\\\",\\n    players: \\\"How many drivers?\\\",\\n    course: \\\"Which course?\\\",\\n    characters: \\\"Who is driving?\\\",\\n    pause: \\\"Paused\\\",\\n    results: \\\"The order\\\",\\n  };\\n  kicker.textContent = kickers[session.screen] || \\\"\\\";\\n  if (kicker.textContent) panel.appendChild(kicker);\\n  if (blurb) {\\n    blurb.textContent = session.screen === \\\"title\\\"\\n      ? \\\"Eight seats when the cup is full. Three laps. Try not to wear the butter.\\\"\\n      : \\\"\\\";\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"characters\\\") paintCharacters(panel);\\n  else if (session.screen === \\\"help\\\") {\\n    paintHelp(panel);\\n    paintList(panel, currentRows());\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"about\\\") {\\n    paintAbout(panel);\\n    paintList(panel, currentRows());\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"results\\\") {\\n    paintResults(panel);\\n    paintList(panel, currentRows());\\n  } else paintList(panel, currentRows());\\n}\\n\\nfunction activate() {\\n  audio.unlock();\\n  const rows = currentRows();\\n  const row = rows[session.focus];\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"title\\\" && row) {\\n    if (row.id === \\\"cup\\\") {\\n      draft.mode = \\\"cup\\\";\\n      draft.slot = 0;\\n      session.screen = \\\"characters\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n    } else if (row.id === \\\"versus\\\") {\\n      draft.mode = \\\"versus\\\";\\n      session.screen = \\\"players\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n    } else if (row.id === \\\"trial\\\") {\\n      draft.mode = \\\"trial\\\";\\n      session.screen = \\\"course\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n    } else if (row.id === \\\"battle\\\") {\\n      draft.mode = \\\"battle\\\";\\n      session.screen = \\\"players\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n    } else if (row.id === \\\"help\\\" || row.id === \\\"settings\\\" || row.id === \\\"about\\\") {\\n      session.screen = row.id;\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n    }\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"players\\\" && row) {\\n    if (row.id === \\\"back\\\") {\\n      session.screen = \\\"title\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n    } else {\\n      draft.playerCount = Number(row.id);\\n      session.screen = draft.mode === \\\"battle\\\" ? \\\"characters\\\" : \\\"course\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n      draft.slot = 0;\\n    }\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"course\\\" && row) {\\n    if (row.id === \\\"back\\\") {\\n      session.screen = draft.mode === \\\"versus\\\" ? \\\"players\\\" : \\\"title\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n    } else {\\n      draft.courseId = row.id;\\n      session.screen = \\\"characters\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n      draft.slot = 0;\\n    }\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"characters\\\") {\\n    launch(draft.mode);\\n    return;\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"settings\\\" && row) {\\n    if (row.id === \\\"invertX\\\") session.settings.invertX = !session.settings.invertX;\\n    if (row.id === \\\"invertY\\\") session.settings.invertY = !session.settings.invertY;\\n    if (row.id === \\\"back\\\") {\\n      session.screen = \\\"title\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n    }\\n    saveSession();\\n  } else if ((session.screen === \\\"help\\\" || session.screen === \\\"about\\\") && row && row.id === \\\"back\\\") {\\n    session.screen = \\\"title\\\";\\n    session.focus = 0;\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"pause\\\" && row) {\\n    if (row.id === \\\"resume\\\") session.screen = \\\"race\\\";\\n    if (row.id === \\\"quit\\\") quitToTitle();\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"results\\\" && row) {\\n    if (race && race.mode === \\\"cup\\\" && outcome && outcome.action === \\\"retry\\\") launch(\\\"cup\\\");\\n    else if (race && race.mode === \\\"cup\\\" && outcome && outcome.action === \\\"continue\\\") launch(\\\"cup\\\");\\n    else quitToTitle();\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n  renderAll();\\n}\\n\\nfunction quitToTitle() {\\n  race = null;\\n  outcome = null;\\n  recorded = false;\\n  session.screen = \\\"title\\\";\\n  session.focus = 0;\\n  session.idle = 0;\\n  session.attract = false;\\n  renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n  renderAll();\\n  if (!busy) {\\n    busy = true;\\n    showLot().finally(() => {\\n      busy = false;\\n    });\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction enterResults() {\\n  if (!race || recorded) return;\\n  recorded = true;\\n  if (race.mode === \\\"cup\\\") outcome = recordCupResult(cup, playerPlace(race, 0));\\n  else if (race.mode === \\\"trial\\\" && race.karts[0].finishTime != null) {\\n    outcome = noteTrial(session.trialBest, race.course.id, race.karts[0].finishTime);\\n    saveSession();\\n  } else outcome = { action: \\\"done\\\" };\\n  session.screen = \\\"results\\\";\\n  session.focus = 0;\\n  renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n  renderAll();\\n}\\n\\nfunction cycleCharacter(dir) {\\n  const count = draft.mode === \\\"cup\\\" || draft.mode === \\\"trial\\\" ? 1 : draft.playerCount;\\n  const index = CHARACTERS.findIndex((character) => character.id === draft.characters[draft.slot]);\\n  const next = (index + dir + CHARACTERS.length) % CHARACTERS.length;\\n  draft.characters[draft.slot] = CHARACTERS[next].id;\\n  renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n  renderAll();\\n  void count;\\n}\\n\\nfunction moveMenu(dy) {\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"characters\\\") {\\n    const count = draft.mode === \\\"cup\\\" || draft.mode === \\\"trial\\\" ? 1 : draft.playerCount;\\n    draft.slot = (draft.slot + dy + count) % count;\\n    renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n    renderAll();\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"about\\\" && $(\\\"about-copy\\\")) {\\n    $(\\\"about-copy\\\").scrollTop += dy * 72;\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const rows = currentRows();\\n  if (!rows.length) return;\\n  session.focus = (session.focus + dy + rows.length) % rows.length;\\n  renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n  renderAll();\\n}\\n\\nfunction onMenuEdges(edgeX, edgeY, confirm, back) {\\n  if (back && session.screen !== \\\"title\\\" && session.screen !== \\\"race\\\" && session.screen !== \\\"attract\\\") {\\n    if (session.screen === \\\"pause\\\") {\\n      session.screen = \\\"race\\\";\\n      renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n      renderAll();\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (session.screen === \\\"characters\\\") {\\n      session.screen = draft.mode === \\\"cup\\\" ? \\\"title\\\" : draft.mode === \\\"battle\\\" ? \\\"players\\\" : \\\"course\\\";\\n    } else if (session.screen === \\\"course\\\") session.screen = draft.mode === \\\"versus\\\" ? \\\"players\\\" : \\\"title\\\";\\n    else session.screen = \\\"title\\\";\\n    session.focus = 0;\\n    renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n    renderAll();\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"characters\\\" && edgeX) cycleCharacter(edgeX);\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"settings\\\" && edgeX) {\\n    const rows = currentRows();\\n    const row = rows[session.focus];\\n    if (row && row.id === \\\"invertX\\\") session.settings.invertX = !session.settings.invertX;\\n    if (row && row.id === \\\"invertY\\\") session.settings.invertY = !session.settings.invertY;\\n    saveSession();\\n    renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n    renderAll();\\n  }\\n  if (edgeY) moveMenu(edgeY);\\n  if (confirm) activate();\\n}\\n\\nfunction updateHud(time) {\\n  const hud = $(\\\"hud\\\");\\n  const countdown = $(\\\"countdown\\\");\\n  if (!hud || !race || (session.screen !== \\\"race\\\" && session.screen !== \\\"attract\\\" && session.screen !== \\\"pause\\\")) {\\n    if (countdown) countdown.textContent = \\\"\\\";\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  const humans = race.karts.filter((kart) => kart.isPlayer);\\n  const shown = humans.length ? humans : [race.karts[0]];\\n  hud.dataset.players = String(Math.max(1, shown.length));\\n  while (hud.children.length < shown.length) {\\n    const cluster = document.createElement(\\\"section\\\");\\n    cluster.className = \\\"cluster\\\";\\n    for (const cls of [\\\"place\\\", \\\"meta\\\", \\\"speed\\\", \\\"item\\\"]) {\\n      const node = document.createElement(\\\"div\\\");\\n      node.className = cls;\\n      cluster.appendChild(node);\\n    }\\n    const map = document.createElement(\\\"canvas\\\");\\n    map.className = \\\"map\\\";\\n    map.width = 180;\\n    map.height = 140;\\n    cluster.appendChild(map);\\n    const order = document.createElement(\\\"ol\\\");\\n    order.className = \\\"order\\\";\\n    cluster.appendChild(order);\\n    hud.appendChild(cluster);\\n  }\\n  [...hud.children].forEach((cluster, index) => {\\n    cluster.hidden = index >= shown.length;\\n    cluster.className = `cluster p${index}`;\\n  });\\n  shown.forEach((kart, index) => {\\n    const cluster = hud.children[index];\\n    const place = cluster.querySelector(\\\".place\\\");\\n    const meta = cluster.querySelector(\\\".meta\\\");\\n    const speed = cluster.querySelector(\\\".speed\\\");\\n    const item = cluster.querySelector(\\\".item\\\");\\n    place.textContent = kart.finished ? \\\"Finished\\\" : kart.eliminated ? \\\"Out\\\" : ordinal(kart.rank);\\n    if (race.mode === \\\"battle\\\") meta.textContent = kart.eliminated ? \\\"No balloons\\\" : `${kart.balloons} balloons`;\\n    else meta.textContent = `Lap ${kart.displayLap} / 3`;\\n    speed.textContent = `${Math.round(Math.abs(kart.speed) * 3.6)} km/h`;\\n    if (kart.roulette) {\\n      const names = ITEM_IDS.map((id) => itemName(id));\\n      item.textContent = names[Math.floor(time * 14 + index) % names.length];\\n    } else if (kart.held) {\\n      const charges = kart.held.charges > 1 ? ` ×${kart.held.charges}` : \\\"\\\";\\n      item.textContent = `${itemName(kart.held.kind)}${kart.trailing ? \\\" trailing\\\" : charges}`;\\n    } else if (kart.aegisT > 0) item.textContent = \\\"Full Guard\\\";\\n    else if (kart.stormT > 0) item.textContent = \\\"Pepper Rain\\\";\\n    else item.textContent = \\\"Empty\\\";\\n    const map = cluster.querySelector(\\\".map\\\");\\n    if (index === 0 || shown.length > 1) drawMap(map, race.course, race.karts, kart.id);\\n    const order = cluster.querySelector(\\\".order\\\");\\n    order.replaceChildren();\\n    if (shown.length === 1 && race.mode !== \\\"battle\\\") {\\n      for (const row of finishOrder(race)) {\\n        const li = document.createElement(\\\"li\\\");\\n        li.textContent = `${row.rank} ${row.name}`;\\n        if (row.id === kart.id) li.className = \\\"me\\\";\\n        order.appendChild(li);\\n      }\\n    }\\n  });\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"attract\\\") {\\n    let banner = hud.querySelector(\\\".attract-banner\\\");\\n    if (!banner) {\\n      banner = document.createElement(\\\"p\\\");\\n      banner.className = \\\"attract-banner\\\";\\n      banner.textContent = \\\"Demo reel. Press anything.\\\";\\n      hud.appendChild(banner);\\n    }\\n  } else {\\n    const banner = hud.querySelector(\\\".attract-banner\\\");\\n    if (banner) banner.remove();\\n  }\\n  if (countdown) {\\n    countdown.textContent = race.phase === \\\"countdown\\\" || race.goShow > 0 ? race.countdownLabel : \\\"\\\";\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction drawMap(canvas, course, karts, selfId) {\\n  const ctx = canvas.getContext(\\\"2d\\\");\\n  if (!ctx) return;\\n  const w = canvas.width;\\n  const h = canvas.height;\\n  ctx.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);\\n  ctx.fillStyle = \\\"rgba(8, 10, 16, 0.55)\\\";\\n  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);\\n  const bounds = course.bounds;\\n  const spanX = Math.max(1, bounds.maxX - bounds.minX);\\n  const spanZ = Math.max(1, bounds.maxZ - bounds.minZ);\\n  const scale = Math.min((w - 16) / spanX, (h - 16) / spanZ);\\n  const ox = w / 2 - ((bounds.minX + bounds.maxX) / 2) * scale;\\n  const oy = h / 2 + ((bounds.minZ + bounds.maxZ) / 2) * scale;\\n  const X = (x) => ox + x * scale;\\n  const Y = (z) => oy - z * scale;\\n  ctx.strokeStyle = \\\"#f3d7a4\\\";\\n  ctx.lineWidth = 5;\\n  ctx.lineJoin = \\\"round\\\";\\n  ctx.beginPath();\\n  if (course.kind === \\\"circuit\\\" && course.points.length) {\\n    course.points.forEach((point, index) => {\\n      if (index === 0) ctx.moveTo(X(point.x), Y(point.z));\\n      else ctx.lineTo(X(point.x), Y(point.z));\\n    });\\n    ctx.closePath();\\n    ctx.stroke();\\n  } else {\\n    ctx.strokeRect(X(-course.width / 2), Y(course.depth / 2), course.width * scale, course.depth * scale);\\n  }\\n  for (const kart of karts) {\\n    ctx.fillStyle = kart.id === selfId ? \\\"#ffb703\\\" : \\\"#f7f3ea\\\";\\n    ctx.beginPath();\\n    ctx.arc(X(kart.x), Y(kart.z), kart.id === selfId ? 5 : 3.2, 0, Math.PI * 2);\\n    ctx.fill();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction bindInput() {\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"keydown\\\", (event) => {\\n    keys[event.code] = true;\\n    if ([\\\"Space\\\", \\\"ArrowUp\\\", \\\"ArrowDown\\\", \\\"ArrowLeft\\\", \\\"ArrowRight\\\"].includes(event.code)) event.preventDefault();\\n    audio.unlock();\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"keyup\\\", (event) => {\\n    keys[event.code] = false;\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"blur\\\", () => {\\n    for (const code of Object.keys(keys)) keys[code] = false;\\n  });\\n  const canvas = $(\\\"view\\\");\\n  canvas.addEventListener(\\\"click\\\", () => {\\n    if (session.screen === \\\"race\\\" || session.screen === \\\"attract\\\") canvas.requestPointerLock();\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"mousedown\\\", (event) => {\\n    mouse.buttons[event.button] = true;\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"mouseup\\\", (event) => {\\n    mouse.buttons[event.button] = false;\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"mousemove\\\", (event) => {\\n    if (document.pointerLockElement === canvas) {\\n      mouse.dx += event.movementX;\\n      mouse.dy += event.movementY;\\n    }\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"wheel\\\", (event) => {\\n    if (session.screen === \\\"race\\\") {\\n      mouse.wheel = true;\\n      event.preventDefault();\\n    }\\n  }, { passive: false });\\n  window.addEventListener(\\\"resize\\\", () => {\\n    if (renderer) fitBuffer($(\\\"view\\\"), renderer);\\n  });\\n  const touchSettings = $(\\\"touch-settings\\\");\\n  if (touchSettings) {\\n    touchSettings.addEventListener(\\\"click\\\", () => {\\n      session.screen = \\\"settings\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n      session.idle = 0;\\n      renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n      renderAll();\\n    });\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction setupTouch() {\\n  const gate = $(\\\"touch-gate\\\");\\n  if (!gate) return;\\n  const visible = touchGateVisible({\\n    coarsePointer: window.matchMedia(\\\"(pointer: coarse)\\\").matches,\\n    hover: window.matchMedia(\\\"(hover: hover)\\\").matches,\\n    maxTouchPoints: navigator.maxTouchPoints || 0,\\n  });\\n  gate.hidden = !visible;\\n}\\n\\nfunction drainAudio() {\\n  if (!race) return;\\n  for (const event of race.events) {\\n    if (event.type === \\\"countdown\\\") audio.countdown(event.value);\\n    else if (event.type === \\\"impact\\\") audio.impact();\\n    else if (event.type === \\\"item\\\" && (event.phase === \\\"use\\\" || event.phase === \\\"roll\\\" || event.phase === \\\"pulse\\\")) audio.item();\\n  }\\n  race.events.length = 0;\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"race\\\" || session.screen === \\\"attract\\\") {\\n    const humans = race.karts.filter((kart) => kart.isPlayer);\\n    const heard = humans.length ? humans : race.karts.slice(0, 1);\\n    heard.forEach((kart, index) => audio.engine(index, kart.speed));\\n  } else audio.silence();\\n}\\n\\nfunction renderViews(dt, time) {\\n  if (!renderer || !sim) return;\\n  const canvas = $(\\\"view\\\");\\n  const size = fitBuffer(canvas, renderer);\\n  const shownRace = sim.race;\\n  animateScene(sim.view, shownRace, dt, time);\\n  const live = race && (session.screen === \\\"race\\\" || session.screen === \\\"attract\\\" || session.screen === \\\"pause\\\" || session.screen === \\\"results\\\");\\n  const humans = live ? race.karts.filter((kart) => kart.isPlayer) : [];\\n  const views = live && humans.length ? humans : [shownRace.karts[0]];\\n  const ports = live && humans.length > 1 ? viewports(humans.length, size.width, size.height) : viewports(1, size.width, size.height);\\n  renderer.setScissorTest(ports.length > 1);\\n  for (let i = 0; i < ports.length; i++) {\\n    const port = ports[i];\\n    const kart = views[i] || views[0];\\n    const camera = sim.view.camera;\\n    if (!(live && humans.length)) orbitCamera(camera, sim.course, time, port.w, port.h);\\n    else frameCamera(camera, kart, camModes[i] || \\\"chase\\\", dt, port.w, port.h);\\n    renderer.setViewport(port.x, port.y, port.w, port.h);\\n    renderer.setScissor(port.x, port.y, port.w, port.h);\\n    renderer.render(sim.view.scene, camera);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function frame(now) {\\n  const dt = Math.min(0.05, lastFrame ? (now - lastFrame) / 1000 : 1 / 60);\\n  lastFrame = now;\\n  const time = now / 1000;\\n  const pads = readPads();\\n  const any = inputAny(pads);\\n  if (swallow) swallow = false;\\n  else {\\n    const wasAttract = session.attract;\\n    stepSession(session, dt, session.screen === \\\"race\\\" || session.screen === \\\"pause\\\" || session.screen === \\\"results\\\" ? false : any);\\n    if (wasAttract && !session.attract) {\\n      swallow = true;\\n      race = null;\\n      renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n      renderAll();\\n      if (!busy) {\\n        busy = true;\\n        showLot().finally(() => {\\n          busy = false;\\n        });\\n      }\\n    } else if (!wasAttract && session.attract && !busy) {\\n      busy = true;\\n      launchAttract().finally(() => {\\n        busy = false;\\n      });\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (session.screen === \\\"race\\\" && race && !race.attract) {\\n    const humans = race.karts.filter((kart) => kart.isPlayer);\\n    const actions = humans.map((kart, index) => drivingActions({\\n      pad: pads[kart.playerIndex] || pads[index] || null,\\n      keys,\\n      mouse,\\n      settings: session.settings,\\n      playerIndex: kart.playerIndex || 0,\\n      useMouse: index === 0 && document.pointerLockElement === $(\\\"view\\\"),\\n    }));\\n    let paused = false;\\n    actions.forEach((action, index) => {\\n      const prev = drivePrev[index];\\n      if (action.camera && !prev.camera) {\\n        const at = CAM_CYCLE.indexOf(camModes[index] || \\\"chase\\\");\\n        camModes[index] = CAM_CYCLE[(at + 1) % CAM_CYCLE.length];\\n      }\\n      if (action.pause && !prev.pause) paused = true;\\n      drivePrev[index] = action;\\n    });\\n    if (paused) {\\n      session.screen = \\\"pause\\\";\\n      session.focus = 0;\\n      renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n      renderAll();\\n    } else if (race.phase !== \\\"finished\\\") {\\n      stepRace(race, actions, dt);\\n      drainAudio();\\n      if (race.phase === \\\"finished\\\") enterResults();\\n    }\\n  } else if (session.screen === \\\"attract\\\" && race && !busy) {\\n    if (race.phase !== \\\"finished\\\") {\\n      stepRace(race, null, dt);\\n      drainAudio();\\n    } else {\\n      busy = true;\\n      launchAttract().finally(() => {\\n        busy = false;\\n      });\\n    }\\n  } else if (session.screen !== \\\"race\\\") {\\n    const menuAction = drivingActions({\\n      pad: pads[0] || null,\\n      keys,\\n      mouse: null,\\n      settings: session.settings,\\n      playerIndex: 0,\\n      useMouse: false,\\n    });\\n    if (!swallow && session.screen !== \\\"attract\\\") {\\n      const edgeX = menuAction.menuX && !menuPrev.menuX ? menuAction.menuX : 0;\\n      const edgeY = menuAction.menuY && !menuPrev.menuY ? menuAction.menuY : 0;\\n      const confirm = menuAction.confirm && !menuPrev.confirm;\\n      const back = menuAction.back && !menuPrev.back;\\n      if (edgeX || edgeY || confirm || back) onMenuEdges(edgeX, edgeY, confirm, back);\\n    }\\n    menuPrev = menuAction;\\n    if (session.screen === \\\"pause\\\" && pads[0]) {\\n      const pauseEdge = menuAction.pause && !menuPrev.pause;\\n      if (pauseEdge && race) {\\n        session.screen = \\\"race\\\";\\n        renderKey = \\\"\\\";\\n        renderAll();\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  if (sim && sim.world) {\\n    stepWorld(sim.world, 1);\\n    const pos = bodyTranslation(sim.cone);\\n    sim.view.cone.position.set(pos.x, pos.y, pos.z);\\n    const liveRace = race && sim.race === race ? race : null;\\n    if (liveRace) {\\n      liveRace.conePos = pos;\\n      if (liveRace.coneImpulse) {\\n        pushBody(sim.cone, liveRace.coneImpulse.x, liveRace.coneImpulse.y, liveRace.coneImpulse.z);\\n        liveRace.coneImpulse = null;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  try {\\n    renderViews(dt, time);\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    console.error(err);\\n  }\\n  updateHud(time);\\n  mouse.dx = 0;\\n  mouse.dy = 0;\\n  mouse.wheel = false;\\n  requestAnimationFrame(frame);\\n}\\n\\nfunction showGate(message) {\\n  const gate = $(\\\"gate\\\");\\n  if (gate) {\\n    gate.hidden = false;\\n    gate.textContent = message;\\n  }\\n  document.body.dataset.boot = \\\"gate\\\";\\n}\\n\\nfunction mount() {\\n  document.title = GAME_TITLE;\\n  const title = $(\\\"product-title\\\");\\n  if (title) title.textContent = GAME_TITLE;\\n  loadSession();\\n  setupTouch();\\n  bindInput();\\n  renderAll();\\n}\\n\\nasync function bootGpu() {\\n  const canvas = $(\\\"view\\\");\\n  fitBuffer(canvas, null);\\n  const secure = window.isSecureContext && location.protocol !== \\\"file:\\\";\\n  if (!secure || !navigator.gpu) {\\n    showGate(\\\"WebGPU and a local server are required.\\\");\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  let adapter = null;\\n  try {\\n    adapter = await navigator.gpu.requestAdapter();\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    adapter = null;\\n  }\\n  if (!adapter) {\\n    showGate(\\\"WebGPU and a local server are required.\\\");\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  try {\\n    renderer = await createRenderer(canvas);\\n    fitBuffer(canvas, renderer);\\n    await showLot();\\n    document.body.dataset.boot = \\\"ready\\\";\\n    requestAnimationFrame(frame);\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    console.error(err);\\n    showGate(\\\"WebGPU and a local server are required.\\\");\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nmount();\\nbootGpu();\\n\",\"new_line\":1,\"context_before\":\"\",\"context_after\":\"\",\"line_prefix\":\"\"}]}}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a17fba-2fc3-7d53-9fa6-699993e68862","uuid":"8672c8e2-b453-4bb7-995a-a518e3690fc1"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_31","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A bug exists in the pause detection.\n\nThe pause edge check runs after menuPrev is overwritten, so it always fails. The fix is to check pause before assigning menuPrev.\n\nThe pause screen correctly skips input to stepSession, preventing idle transitions into attract mode. Another bug was found: menu navigation on pause incorrectly uses confirm to activate resume.\n\nThe start button pause edge also resumes when held, and fixing the menuPrev ordering will resolve it. The camera mode array is valid. Stale menuPrev during pause transitions is acceptable. Attract input correctly passes any to stepSession.\n\nThe attract screen clears correctly on the next frame when inputAny is passed. The stepSession call may exit attract and set the screen to title before showLot runs.\n\nThe swallow flag correctly prevents menu input from firing during the same frame that attract clears and transitions to title.\n\nThe swallow flag is reset at the start of every frame. When attract clears and sets it, stepSession is skipped for exactly one frame, but menu input remains available on the following frame.\n\nPhysics and camera movement continue during pause. The results screen keeps the race visible behind its UI.\n\nA bug was found in renderViews: one camera is shared across all viewports. The renderer may return a promise without waiting, so the camera could be wrong for later viewports.\n\nThree.js renders synchronously and records camera matrices immediately. The shared camera updates between viewport renders, so the split-screen bug is not a real issue.\n\nTo avoid split-screen corruption from deferred rendering, four separate cameras will be created per viewport. Each camera will hold its own matrix snapshot so the shared-camera approach is abandoned.\n\nThe camera fix will be applied in main.js by cloning the existing camera into an array per viewport. A new bug was found: player 2's drivingActions incorrectly uses playerIndex for keyboard input.\n\nVerified player indexing for versus, cup, and battle modes. The settings menu edgeX toggles every frame when edgeX is non-zero and confirm is active.\n\nCharacter selection correctly launches the race on confirm and changes characters without launching. The Back button bypasses activate. A bug was found: the paintCharacters screen returns an empty currentRows array, so its Back button cannot prevent list focus.\n\nThe characters screen launches the race on confirm even when currentRows is empty, because activate() bypasses the row check. Help, About, and Results screens include Back as a selectable row. Credits, CSS, and build still need to be added. A bug was also spotted: render() may warn if called before initialization.\n\nThe render() warning is harmless because rendering only begins after initialization. A console.error inside the render catch block will abort the launch if rendering throws. Calling fitBuffer every frame repeatedly invokes setSize, which may reset the canvas and conflict with scissor testing. WebGPU viewport and scissor coordinates are assumed to follow Three.js bottom-left convention.\n\nThe character back button should return to the title screen when draft.mode is cup. Trial mode correctly returns only human entrants and creates a triSpark race.\n\nThe character screen back button routes to the title for cup mode, players for battle, and course otherwise. Cup retry logic correctly reuses the same course index when a driver finishes outside the top four.\n\nA bug was found in cup mode. Quitting to the title screen leaves the cup state intact, so the next grand cup would resume from the old index instead of starting fresh. The results screen only offers continue, which retries or advances the current race, so there is no way to abandon a cup mid-progress.\n\nquitToTitle will be modified to null the cup state so a new Grand Cup starts fresh. This is safe because results already clears the cup when finished or versus ends. The continue path in results calls launch directly, so it will not trigger an unwanted reset.\n\nThe `camModes.fill(\"chase\")` call is valid even though the array is const. Driving input will not be zeroed during pause, so any latched items will fire immediately upon resuming. The next steps are to write the credits and CSS, build the bundled HTML, patch main.js for cameras and pause, and grep the source for any remaining TODOs, FIXMEs, placeholders, or stubs.\n\nThe esbuild bundle will catch syntax errors, but browser-only Three.js classes like MeshToonNodeMaterial cannot be imported in Node. I will try renderer.render first and fall back to renderAsync if needed. To prevent split-screen corruption from overlapping renders, autoClear and scissorTest will both be enabled so each viewport clears only its own rectangle.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cb985bf9-67cd-4e6d-81f3-6280a62080c9-55","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/tmp/grok-goal-17adb0589bdc/implementer/three.webgpu.js","offset":54790,"limit":90}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-cb985bf9-67cd-4e6d-81f3-6280a62080c9-56","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/main.js","old_string":"if (!sim.cameras) sim.cameras = [sim.view.camera];\n  while (sim.cameras.length < ports.length) sim.cameras.push(sim.view.camera.clone());\n  const camera = sim.cameras[i];","new_string":""}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":16149,"output_tokens":3198,"cache_read_input_tokens":187904,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a17fba-2fc3-7d53-9fa6-699993e68862","uuid":"5ff47253-ec20-435c-97f2-b66c693d73d2"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-cb985bf9-67cd-4e6d-81f3-6280a62080c9-55","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"54790→\\n\\t\\tif ( renderBundleData.renderContexts === undefined ) renderBundleData.renderContexts = new Set();\\n\\n\\t\\t//\\n\\n\\t\\tconst needsUpdate = bundleGroup.version !== renderBundleData.version;\\n\\t\\tconst renderBundleNeedsUpdate = renderBundleData.renderContexts.has( renderContext ) === false || needsUpdate;\\n\\n\\t\\trenderBundleData.renderContexts.add( renderContext );\\n\\n54800→\\t\\tif ( renderBundleNeedsUpdate ) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tthis.backend.beginBundle( renderContext );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tif ( renderBundleData.renderObjects === undefined || needsUpdate ) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\trenderBundleData.renderObjects = [];\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\n54810→\\t\\t\\tthis._currentRenderBundle = renderBundle;\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tconst {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\ttransparentDoublePass: transparentDoublePassObjects,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\ttransparent: transparentObjects,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\topaque: opaqueObjects\\n\\t\\t\\t} = renderList;\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tif ( this.opaque === true && opaqueObjects.length > 0 ) this._renderObjects( opaqueObjects, camera, sceneRef, lightsNode );\\n\\t\\t\\tif ( this.transparent === true && transparentObjects.length > 0 ) this._renderTransparents( transparentObjects, transparentDoublePassObjects, camera, sceneRef, lightsNode );\\n54820→\\n\\t\\t\\tthis._currentRenderBundle = null;\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t//\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tthis.backend.finishBundle( renderContext, renderBundle );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\trenderBundleData.version = bundleGroup.version;\\n\\n\\t\\t} else {\\n54830→\\n\\t\\t\\tconst { renderObjects } = renderBundleData;\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tfor ( let i = 0, l = renderObjects.length; i < l; i ++ ) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tconst renderObject = renderObjects[ i ];\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tif ( this._nodes.needsRefresh( renderObject ) ) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tthis._nodes.updateBefore( renderObject );\\n54840→\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tthis._nodes.updateForRender( renderObject );\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tthis._bindings.updateForRender( renderObject );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tthis._nodes.updateAfter( renderObject );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\n54850→\\t\\t}\\n\\n\\t\\tthis.backend.addBundle( renderContext, renderBundle );\\n\\n\\t}\\n\\n\\t/**\\n\\t * Renders the scene or 3D object with the given camera. This method can only be called\\n\\t * if the renderer has been initialized.\\n\\t *\\n54860→\\t * The target of the method is the default framebuffer (meaning the canvas)\\n\\t * or alternatively a render target when specified via `setRenderTarget()`.\\n\\t *\\n\\t * @param {Object3D} scene - The scene or 3D object to render.\\n\\t * @param {Camera} camera - The camera to render the scene with.\\n\\t * @return {?Promise} A Promise that resolve when the scene has been rendered.\\n\\t * Only returned when the renderer has not been initialized.\\n\\t */\\n\\trender( scene, camera ) {\\n\\n54870→\\t\\tif ( this._initialized === false ) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tconsole.warn( 'THREE.Renderer: .render() called before the backend is initialized. Try using .renderAsync() instead.' );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\treturn this.renderAsync( scene, camera );\\n\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\n\\t\\tthis._renderScene( scene, camera );\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"54790→\\n\\t\\tif ( renderBundleData.renderContexts === undefined ) renderBundleData.renderContexts = new Set();\\n\\n\\t\\t//\\n\\n\\t\\tconst needsUpdate = bundleGroup.version !== renderBundleData.version;\\n\\t\\tconst renderBundleNeedsUpdate = renderBundleData.renderContexts.has( renderContext ) === false || needsUpdate;\\n\\n\\t\\trenderBundleData.renderContexts.add( renderContext );\\n\\n54800→\\t\\tif ( renderBundleNeedsUpdate ) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tthis.backend.beginBundle( renderContext );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tif ( renderBundleData.renderObjects === undefined || needsUpdate ) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\trenderBundleData.renderObjects = [];\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\n54810→\\t\\t\\tthis._currentRenderBundle = renderBundle;\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tconst {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\ttransparentDoublePass: transparentDoublePassObjects,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\ttransparent: transparentObjects,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\topaque: opaqueObjects\\n\\t\\t\\t} = renderList;\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tif ( this.opaque === true && opaqueObjects.length > 0 ) this._renderObjects( opaqueObjects, camera, sceneRef, lightsNode );\\n\\t\\t\\tif ( this.transparent === true && transparentObjects.length > 0 ) this._renderTransparents( transparentObjects, transparentDoublePassObjects, camera, sceneRef, lightsNode );\\n54820→\\n\\t\\t\\tthis._currentRenderBundle = null;\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t//\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tthis.backend.finishBundle( renderContext, renderBundle );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\trenderBundleData.version = bundleGroup.version;\\n\\n\\t\\t} else {\\n54830→\\n\\t\\t\\tconst { renderObjects } = renderBundleData;\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tfor ( let i = 0, l = renderObjects.length; i < l; i ++ ) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tconst renderObject = renderObjects[ i ];\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tif ( this._nodes.needsRefresh( renderObject ) ) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tthis._nodes.updateBefore( renderObject );\\n54840→\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tthis._nodes.updateForRender( renderObject );\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tthis._bindings.updateForRender( renderObject );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tthis._nodes.updateAfter( renderObject );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\n54850→\\t\\t}\\n\\n\\t\\tthis.backend.addBundle( renderContext, renderBundle );\\n\\n\\t}\\n\\n\\t/**\\n\\t * Renders the scene or 3D object with the given camera. This method can only be called\\n\\t * if the renderer has been initialized.\\n\\t *\\n54860→\\t * The target of the method is the default framebuffer (meaning the canvas)\\n\\t * or alternatively a render target when specified via `setRenderTarget()`.\\n\\t *\\n\\t * @param {Object3D} scene - The scene or 3D object to render.\\n\\t * @param {Camera} camera - The camera to render the scene with.\\n\\t * @return {?Promise} A Promise that resolve when the scene has been rendered.\\n\\t * Only returned when the renderer has not been initialized.\\n\\t */\\n\\trender( scene, camera ) {\\n\\n54870→\\t\\tif ( this._initialized === false ) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tconsole.warn( 'THREE.Renderer: .render() called before the backend is initialized. Try using .renderAsync() instead.' );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\treturn this.renderAsync( scene, camera );\\n\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\n\\t\\tthis._renderScene( scene, camera );\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/tmp/grok-goal-17adb0589bdc/implementer/three.webgpu.js\",\"offset\":54790,\"limit\":90,\"raw_output\":\"\\n\\t\\tif ( renderBundleData.renderContexts === undefined ) renderBundleData.renderContexts = new Set();\\n\\n\\t\\t//\\n\\n\\t\\tconst needsUpdate = bundleGroup.version !== renderBundleData.version;\\n\\t\\tconst renderBundleNeedsUpdate = renderBundleData.renderContexts.has( renderContext ) === false || needsUpdate;\\n\\n\\t\\trenderBundleData.renderContexts.add( renderContext );\\n\\n\\t\\tif ( renderBundleNeedsUpdate ) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tthis.backend.beginBundle( renderContext );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tif ( renderBundleData.renderObjects === undefined || needsUpdate ) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\trenderBundleData.renderObjects = [];\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tthis._currentRenderBundle = renderBundle;\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tconst {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\ttransparentDoublePass: transparentDoublePassObjects,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\ttransparent: transparentObjects,\\n\\t\\t\\t\\topaque: opaqueObjects\\n\\t\\t\\t} = renderList;\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tif ( this.opaque === true && opaqueObjects.length > 0 ) this._renderObjects( opaqueObjects, camera, sceneRef, lightsNode );\\n\\t\\t\\tif ( this.transparent === true && transparentObjects.length > 0 ) this._renderTransparents( transparentObjects, transparentDoublePassObjects, camera, sceneRef, lightsNode );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tthis._currentRenderBundle = null;\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t//\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tthis.backend.finishBundle( renderContext, renderBundle );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\trenderBundleData.version = bundleGroup.version;\\n\\n\\t\\t} else {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tconst { renderObjects } = renderBundleData;\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tfor ( let i = 0, l = renderObjects.length; i < l; i ++ ) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tconst renderObject = renderObjects[ i ];\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tif ( this._nodes.needsRefresh( renderObject ) ) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tthis._nodes.updateBefore( renderObject );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tthis._nodes.updateForRender( renderObject );\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tthis._bindings.updateForRender( renderObject );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tthis._nodes.updateAfter( renderObject );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\n\\t\\tthis.backend.addBundle( renderContext, renderBundle );\\n\\n\\t}\\n\\n\\t/**\\n\\t * Renders the scene or 3D object with the given camera. This method can only be called\\n\\t * if the renderer has been initialized.\\n\\t *\\n\\t * The target of the method is the default framebuffer (meaning the canvas)\\n\\t * or alternatively a render target when specified via `setRenderTarget()`.\\n\\t *\\n\\t * @param {Object3D} scene - The scene or 3D object to render.\\n\\t * @param {Camera} camera - The camera to render the scene with.\\n\\t * @return {?Promise} A Promise that resolve when the scene has been rendered.\\n\\t * Only returned when the renderer has not been initialized.\\n\\t */\\n\\trender( scene, camera ) {\\n\\n\\t\\tif ( this._initialized === false ) {\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tconsole.warn( 'THREE.Renderer: .render() called before the backend is initialized. Try using .renderAsync() instead.' );\\n\\n\\t\\t\\treturn this.renderAsync( scene, camera );\\n\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\n\\t\\tthis._renderScene( scene, camera );\\n\\n\",\"total_lines\":77115}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-cb985bf9-67cd-4e6d-81f3-6280a62080c9-56","content":"{\"type\":\"SearchReplace\",\"NoMatchesFound\":{\"message\":\"The string to replace was not found in the file, use the read_file tool to see the correct string. The user may have changed the file since you last read it.\",\"file_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficien