{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_41","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Planning the road ribbon winding geometry. Each position will use two vertices: a right vertex and a left vertex.\n\nThe triangle indices are a, a+2, a+1. The right vertex at station i is at +z and the left vertex is at -z. The next right vertex is at +x. This yields an edge along +x and one along +z. The winding must be CCW to keep the upward normal.\n\nThe original triangle winding produced a downward normal, which would cull the road from above. The indices must be reversed to a, a+1, a+2, a+1, a+3, a+2 so the first triangle uses right, left, next-right. The edge along +z is now verified.\n\nThe wall ribbon uses the same vertex indices. The right wall normal must point inward.\n\nThe wall normal for side +1 is currently +right, pointing outward from the track. It should instead point inward toward the camera at -right.\n\nThe wall triangle normal for side +1 is (0, 0, -1). This points outward from the track. FrontSide culling would hide the walls from the camera.\n\nThe outward normal and the stored normal both point +right. Flipping the wall indices or inverting the normal will make the walls visible from the track.\n\nDoubleSide is the right choice for walls so both orbit and chase cameras can see them. The road should keep FrontSide with upward normals. The grass plane normal is being checked against its rotation.\n\nThe grass plane normal is confirmed to point upward after the -90° rotation. The wall material will be set to DoubleSide, though care is needed because materials are shared via cache.\n\nThe wall material will be cloned or rebuilt directly in buildCircuit. This avoids mutating the shared toon() cache and prevents DoubleSide from affecting every mesh that uses that color.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-920c2e59-c24a-4de6-8aff-253ba970f436-28","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/courses.js","offset":134,"limit":120}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-920c2e59-c24a-4de6-8aff-253ba970f436-29","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"side:","path":"/tmp/grok-goal-17adb0589bdc/implementer/three.webgpu.js","head_limit":5}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3637,"output_tokens":2002,"cache_read_input_tokens":67840,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a17fba-2fc3-7d53-9fa6-699993e68862","uuid":"0c6ff7db-6fd8-48d6-8a61-32db9eb00f3c"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-920c2e59-c24a-4de6-8aff-253ba970f436-28","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"134→const cinder = buildCourse({\\n  id: \\\"cinder-loop\\\",\\n  name: \\\"Cinder Loop\\\",\\n  kind: \\\"circuit\\\",\\n  blurb: \\\"A warm quarry oval. The shoulders are made of bad ideas.\\\",\\n  laps: 3,\\n140→  roadHalf: 8,\\n  wallHalf: 12.2,\\n  sky: 0xf2b48a,\\n  road: 0x3c4454,\\n  shoulder: 0xc6a36e,\\n  grass: 0x6ea24a,\\n  wall: 0x8d4636,\\n  fog: 0xf2b48a,\\n  accent: 0xffb703,\\n  points: stadiumPoints(130, 42, (x, z) => {\\n150→    const ramp = smoothHill((x - 40) / 50);\\n    const cap = Math.max(0, 1 - Math.abs(z) / 42);\\n    return ramp * cap * 7.5;\\n  }),\\n});\\n\\nconst lantern = buildCourse({\\n  id: \\\"lantern-causeway\\\",\\n  name: \\\"Lantern Causeway\\\",\\n  kind: \\\"circuit\\\",\\n160→  blurb: \\\"Night harbor, narrow bridge, one rude hairpin.\\\",\\n  laps: 3,\\n  roadHalf: 6.6,\\n  wallHalf: 10.4,\\n  sky: 0x14182e,\\n  road: 0x2c3448,\\n  shoulder: 0x3e4c5c,\\n  grass: 0x16343c,\\n  wall: 0xd0893a,\\n  fog: 0x14182e,\\n170→  accent: 0xffc56b,\\n  points: stadiumPoints(168, 30, (x, z) => {\\n    if (z > 10) {\\n      const along = smoothHill((x + 84) / 168);\\n      const crest = Math.sin(along * Math.PI);\\n      return crest * 8.2;\\n    }\\n    if (x < -70) return smoothHill((Math.abs(z) - 8) / 24) * 2.2;\\n    return 0;\\n  }),\\n180→});\\n\\nexport const BALLOON_YARD = {\\n  id: \\\"balloon-yard\\\",\\n  name: \\\"Balloon Yard\\\",\\n  kind: \\\"arena\\\",\\n  blurb: \\\"A walled yard. Three balloons. Do not be polite.\\\",\\n  laps: 0,\\n  roadHalf: 99,\\n  wallHalf: 99,\\n190→  width: 72,\\n  depth: 52,\\n  sky: 0x9fd4ff,\\n  road: 0xd9c7a6,\\n  shoulder: 0xcbb892,\\n  grass: 0xd9c7a6,\\n  wall: 0x6b4a38,\\n  fog: 0x9fd4ff,\\n  accent: 0xff5d8f,\\n  obstacles: [\\n200→    { type: \\\"cyl\\\", x: 0, z: 0, r: 4.2 },\\n    { type: \\\"box\\\", x: -18, z: -10, hx: 4.2, hz: 2.6 },\\n    { type: \\\"box\\\", x: 18, z: 10, hx: 4.2, hz: 2.6 },\\n    { type: \\\"cyl\\\", x: -20, z: 14, r: 2.4 },\\n    { type: \\\"cyl\\\", x: 20, z: -14, r: 2.4 },\\n    { type: \\\"box\\\", x: 0, z: 16, hx: 7, hz: 1.6 },\\n    { type: \\\"box\\\", x: 0, z: -16, hx: 7, hz: 1.6 },\\n  ],\\n  spawns: [\\n    { x: 0, z: -18, heading: 0 },\\n210→    { x: 0, z: 18, heading: Math.PI },\\n    { x: -26, z: 0, heading: Math.PI / 2 },\\n    { x: 26, z: 0, heading: -Math.PI / 2 },\\n  ],\\n  boxSpots: [\\n    { x: -12, z: -12 },\\n    { x: 12, z: -12 },\\n    { x: -12, z: 12 },\\n    { x: 12, z: 12 },\\n    { x: -28, z: -18 },\\n220→    { x: 28, z: 18 },\\n  ],\\n  bounds: { minX: -36, maxX: 36, minZ: -26, maxZ: 26, maxY: 0 },\\n  length: 1,\\n  points: [],\\n  segLen: [],\\n};\\n\\nfunction withBoxes(course) {\\n  if (course.kind !== \\\"circuit\\\") return course;\\n230→  const boxes = [];\\n  const count = 8;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\\n    boxes.push({\\n      progress: ((i + 0.5) * course.length) / count,\\n      lateral: i % 2 === 0 ? -3.1 : 3.1,\\n    });\\n  }\\n  return { ...course, boxSpots: boxes };\\n}\\n240→\\nexport const CINDER_LOOP = withBoxes(cinder);\\nexport const LANTERN_CAUSEWAY = withBoxes(lantern);\\nexport const COURSES = [CINDER_LOOP, LANTERN_CAUSEWAY];\\nexport const CUP_IDS = [\\\"cinder-loop\\\", \\\"lantern-causeway\\\"];\\n\\nexport function courseById(id) {\\n  if (id === BALLOON_YARD.id) return BALLOON_YARD;\\n  return COURSES.find((course) => course.id === id) || CINDER_LOOP;\\n}\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"134→const cinder = buildCourse({\\n  id: \\\"cinder-loop\\\",\\n  name: \\\"Cinder Loop\\\",\\n  kind: \\\"circuit\\\",\\n  blurb: \\\"A warm quarry oval. The shoulders are made of bad ideas.\\\",\\n  laps: 3,\\n140→  roadHalf: 8,\\n  wallHalf: 12.2,\\n  sky: 0xf2b48a,\\n  road: 0x3c4454,\\n  shoulder: 0xc6a36e,\\n  grass: 0x6ea24a,\\n  wall: 0x8d4636,\\n  fog: 0xf2b48a,\\n  accent: 0xffb703,\\n  points: stadiumPoints(130, 42, (x, z) => {\\n150→    const ramp = smoothHill((x - 40) / 50);\\n    const cap = Math.max(0, 1 - Math.abs(z) / 42);\\n    return ramp * cap * 7.5;\\n  }),\\n});\\n\\nconst lantern = buildCourse({\\n  id: \\\"lantern-causeway\\\",\\n  name: \\\"Lantern Causeway\\\",\\n  kind: \\\"circuit\\\",\\n160→  blurb: \\\"Night harbor, narrow bridge, one rude hairpin.\\\",\\n  laps: 3,\\n  roadHalf: 6.6,\\n  wallHalf: 10.4,\\n  sky: 0x14182e,\\n  road: 0x2c3448,\\n  shoulder: 0x3e4c5c,\\n  grass: 0x16343c,\\n  wall: 0xd0893a,\\n  fog: 0x14182e,\\n170→  accent: 0xffc56b,\\n  points: stadiumPoints(168, 30, (x, z) => {\\n    if (z > 10) {\\n      const along = smoothHill((x + 84) / 168);\\n      const crest = Math.sin(along * Math.PI);\\n      return crest * 8.2;\\n    }\\n    if (x < -70) return smoothHill((Math.abs(z) - 8) / 24) * 2.2;\\n    return 0;\\n  }),\\n180→});\\n\\nexport const BALLOON_YARD = {\\n  id: \\\"balloon-yard\\\",\\n  name: \\\"Balloon Yard\\\",\\n  kind: \\\"arena\\\",\\n  blurb: \\\"A walled yard. Three balloons. Do not be polite.\\\",\\n  laps: 0,\\n  roadHalf: 99,\\n  wallHalf: 99,\\n190→  width: 72,\\n  depth: 52,\\n  sky: 0x9fd4ff,\\n  road: 0xd9c7a6,\\n  shoulder: 0xcbb892,\\n  grass: 0xd9c7a6,\\n  wall: 0x6b4a38,\\n  fog: 0x9fd4ff,\\n  accent: 0xff5d8f,\\n  obstacles: [\\n200→    { type: \\\"cyl\\\", x: 0, z: 0, r: 4.2 },\\n    { type: \\\"box\\\", x: -18, z: -10, hx: 4.2, hz: 2.6 },\\n    { type: \\\"box\\\", x: 18, z: 10, hx: 4.2, hz: 2.6 },\\n    { type: \\\"cyl\\\", x: -20, z: 14, r: 2.4 },\\n    { type: \\\"cyl\\\", x: 20, z: -14, r: 2.4 },\\n    { type: \\\"box\\\", x: 0, z: 16, hx: 7, hz: 1.6 },\\n    { type: \\\"box\\\", x: 0, z: -16, hx: 7, hz: 1.6 },\\n  ],\\n  spawns: [\\n    { x: 0, z: -18, heading: 0 },\\n210→    { x: 0, z: 18, heading: Math.PI },\\n    { x: -26, z: 0, heading: Math.PI / 2 },\\n    { x: 26, z: 0, heading: -Math.PI / 2 },\\n  ],\\n  boxSpots: [\\n    { x: -12, z: -12 },\\n    { x: 12, z: -12 },\\n    { x: -12, z: 12 },\\n    { x: 12, z: 12 },\\n    { x: -28, z: -18 },\\n220→    { x: 28, z: 18 },\\n  ],\\n  bounds: { minX: -36, maxX: 36, minZ: -26, maxZ: 26, maxY: 0 },\\n  length: 1,\\n  points: [],\\n  segLen: [],\\n};\\n\\nfunction withBoxes(course) {\\n  if (course.kind !== \\\"circuit\\\") return course;\\n230→  const boxes = [];\\n  const count = 8;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\\n    boxes.push({\\n      progress: ((i + 0.5) * course.length) / count,\\n      lateral: i % 2 === 0 ? -3.1 : 3.1,\\n    });\\n  }\\n  return { ...course, boxSpots: boxes };\\n}\\n240→\\nexport const CINDER_LOOP = withBoxes(cinder);\\nexport const LANTERN_CAUSEWAY = withBoxes(lantern);\\nexport const COURSES = [CINDER_LOOP, LANTERN_CAUSEWAY];\\nexport const CUP_IDS = [\\\"cinder-loop\\\", \\\"lantern-causeway\\\"];\\n\\nexport function courseById(id) {\\n  if (id === BALLOON_YARD.id) return BALLOON_YARD;\\n  return COURSES.find((course) => course.id === id) || CINDER_LOOP;\\n}\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/courses.js\",\"offset\":134,\"limit\":120,\"raw_output\":\"const cinder = buildCourse({\\n  id: \\\"cinder-loop\\\",\\n  name: \\\"Cinder Loop\\\",\\n  kind: \\\"circuit\\\",\\n  blurb: \\\"A warm quarry oval. The shoulders are made of bad ideas.\\\",\\n  laps: 3,\\n  roadHalf: 8,\\n  wallHalf: 12.2,\\n  sky: 0xf2b48a,\\n  road: 0x3c4454,\\n  shoulder: 0xc6a36e,\\n  grass: 0x6ea24a,\\n  wall: 0x8d4636,\\n  fog: 0xf2b48a,\\n  accent: 0xffb703,\\n  points: stadiumPoints(130, 42, (x, z) => {\\n    const ramp = smoothHill((x - 40) / 50);\\n    const cap = Math.max(0, 1 - Math.abs(z) / 42);\\n    return ramp * cap * 7.5;\\n  }),\\n});\\n\\nconst lantern = buildCourse({\\n  id: \\\"lantern-causeway\\\",\\n  name: \\\"Lantern Causeway\\\",\\n  kind: \\\"circuit\\\",\\n  blurb: \\\"Night harbor, narrow bridge, one rude hairpin.\\\",\\n  laps: 3,\\n  roadHalf: 6.6,\\n  wallHalf: 10.4,\\n  sky: 0x14182e,\\n  road: 0x2c3448,\\n  shoulder: 0x3e4c5c,\\n  grass: 0x16343c,\\n  wall: 0xd0893a,\\n  fog: 0x14182e,\\n  accent: 0xffc56b,\\n  points: stadiumPoints(168, 30, (x, z) => {\\n    if (z > 10) {\\n      const along = smoothHill((x + 84) / 168);\\n      const crest = Math.sin(along * Math.PI);\\n      return crest * 8.2;\\n    }\\n    if (x < -70) return smoothHill((Math.abs(z) - 8) / 24) * 2.2;\\n    return 0;\\n  }),\\n});\\n\\nexport const BALLOON_YARD = {\\n  id: \\\"balloon-yard\\\",\\n  name: \\\"Balloon Yard\\\",\\n  kind: \\\"arena\\\",\\n  blurb: \\\"A walled yard. Three balloons. Do not be polite.\\\",\\n  laps: 0,\\n  roadHalf: 99,\\n  wallHalf: 99,\\n  width: 72,\\n  depth: 52,\\n  sky: 0x9fd4ff,\\n  road: 0xd9c7a6,\\n  shoulder: 0xcbb892,\\n  grass: 0xd9c7a6,\\n  wall: 0x6b4a38,\\n  fog: 0x9fd4ff,\\n  accent: 0xff5d8f,\\n  obstacles: [\\n    { type: \\\"cyl\\\", x: 0, z: 0, r: 4.2 },\\n    { type: \\\"box\\\", x: -18, z: -10, hx: 4.2, hz: 2.6 },\\n    { type: \\\"box\\\", x: 18, z: 10, hx: 4.2, hz: 2.6 },\\n    { type: \\\"cyl\\\", x: -20, z: 14, r: 2.4 },\\n    { type: \\\"cyl\\\", x: 20, z: -14, r: 2.4 },\\n    { type: \\\"box\\\", x: 0, z: 16, hx: 7, hz: 1.6 },\\n    { type: \\\"box\\\", x: 0, z: -16, hx: 7, hz: 1.6 },\\n  ],\\n  spawns: [\\n    { x: 0, z: -18, heading: 0 },\\n    { x: 0, z: 18, heading: Math.PI },\\n    { x: -26, z: 0, heading: Math.PI / 2 },\\n    { x: 26, z: 0, heading: -Math.PI / 2 },\\n  ],\\n  boxSpots: [\\n    { x: -12, z: -12 },\\n    { x: 12, z: -12 },\\n    { x: -12, z: 12 },\\n    { x: 12, z: 12 },\\n    { x: -28, z: -18 },\\n    { x: 28, z: 18 },\\n  ],\\n  bounds: { minX: -36, maxX: 36, minZ: -26, maxZ: 26, maxY: 0 },\\n  length: 1,\\n  points: [],\\n  segLen: [],\\n};\\n\\nfunction withBoxes(course) {\\n  if (course.kind !== \\\"circuit\\\") return course;\\n  const boxes = [];\\n  const count = 8;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\\n    boxes.push({\\n      progress: ((i + 0.5) * course.length) / count,\\n      lateral: i % 2 === 0 ? -3.1 : 3.1,\\n    });\\n  }\\n  return { ...course, boxSpots: boxes };\\n}\\n\\nexport const CINDER_LOOP = withBoxes(cinder);\\nexport const LANTERN_CAUSEWAY = withBoxes(lantern);\\nexport const COURSES = [CINDER_LOOP, LANTERN_CAUSEWAY];\\nexport const CUP_IDS = [\\\"cinder-loop\\\", \\\"lantern-causeway\\\"];\\n\\nexport function courseById(id) {\\n  if (id === BALLOON_YARD.id) return BALLOON_YARD;\\n  return COURSES.find((course) => course.id === id) || CINDER_LOOP;\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":249}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-920c2e59-c24a-4de6-8aff-253ba970f436-29","content":"{\"type\":\"GrepSearch\",\"stdout\":[60,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,114,101,115,117,108,116,32,119,111,114,107,115,112,97,99,101,95,112,97,116,104,61,34,47,104,111,109,101,47,109,105,99,104,97,47,100,101,118,47,99,99,45,109,97,116,114,105,120,47,114,117,110,115,47,103,114,111,107,45,120,104,105,103,104,95,95,101,120,97,109,112,108,101,95,95,118,50,95,95,99,101,108,95,95,102,114,101,101,95,95,101,102,102,105,99,105,101,110,116,95,95,111,110,47,119,111,114,107,34,62,10,70,111,117,110,100,32,97,116,32,108,101,97,115,116,32,53,32,109,97,116,99,104,105,110,103,32,108,105,110,101,115,10,47,116,109,112,47,103,114,111,107,45,103,111,97,108,45,49,55,97,100,98,48,53,56,57,98,100,99,47,105,109,112,108,101,109,101,110,116,101,114,47,116,104,114,101,101,46,119,101,98,103,112,117,46,106,115,10,50,52,49,57,49,58,9,9,9,9,115,105,100,101,58,32,66,97,99,107,83,105,100,101,44,10,53,50,55,50,51,58,9,9,99,111,110,115,116,32,109,97,116,101,114,105,97,108,32,61,32,110,101,119,32,77,101,115,104,66,97,115,105,99,77,97,116,101,114,105,97,108,40,32,123,32,99,111,108,111,114,58,32,48,120,102,102,102,102,102,102,44,32,115,105,100,101,58,32,70,114,111,110,116,83,105,100,101,32,125,32,41,59,10,53,50,55,52,56,58,9,9,9,108,97,121,101,114,46,112,108,97,110,101,46,109,97,11