{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_45","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I have a solid plan and am beginning implementation now.\n\nscene.js needs ribbon index flips, DoubleSide materials, finish line and curb dimensions, a cameras array, and toon() side support. main.js needs pause edge order fixes, camera indexing, null cup cleanup on quit, and removal of the boot failure console.error. courses.js may export roadStrip.\n\nI will export `roadStrip` from courses.js so scene.js can import it. This avoids a large geometry move and keeps the Three.js dependency out of Node.\n\nWriting the `roadStrip` function now. It samples course points, offsets them by half-width and lift, and builds vertex positions and normals. The ribbon indices are being ordered so the cross product yields upward-pointing normals.\n\nThe `roadStrip` function is complete. A new `ribbon` helper in scene.js now builds the Three.js geometry from its output. Tests will be added to game.test.mjs, including a travel-along-heading check using the shipped stepRace course.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0f79ff8a-e922-4378-9b99-328510bce116-36","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/test/game.test.mjs","limit":40}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-0f79ff8a-e922-4378-9b99-328510bce116-37","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/test/game.test.mjs","offset":400,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3434,"output_tokens":900,"cache_read_input_tokens":83072,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a17fba-2fc3-7d53-9fa6-699993e68862","uuid":"3307a4fb-1459-44af-8712-7fc71bb4cc9c"}
