{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_54","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Verifying the cross product's y component.\n\nThe cross product's j component had the wrong sign. The correct formula is ez * fx - ex * fz, giving +64 and confirming the normal points upward.\n\nThe test assertion formula is wrong. It should use ez * fx - ex * fz to match the correct cross product sign. The original winding order was right, next-right, left.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The road winding is already facing up. The test used the wrong sign for the cross product’s Y component, so I’ll correct that assertion."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-101ef18e-a2f0-443c-9aae-0d4fec074e01-63","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/test/game.test.mjs","old_string":"  const ny = (bx - ax) * (cz - az) - (bz - az) * (cx - ax);\n  assert.ok(ny > 0, `road normal y ${ny}`);","new_string":"  const ny = (bz - az) * (cx - ax) - (bx - ax) * (cz - az);\n  assert.ok(ny > 0, `road normal y ${ny}`);"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1623,"output_tokens":811,"cache_read_input_tokens":100864,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a17fba-2fc3-7d53-9fa6-699993e68862","uuid":"daec034a-25eb-4554-b482-f6df6c9a1e87"}
