{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_78","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Device loss occurs before the after-boot mark.\n\nThe canvas device dies during the initial boot sequence. The `fitBuffer` call writes `canvas.width`, which likely destroys the GPU context before the after-boot mark.\n\nThe console order shows the rapier warning appears during showLot, after the initial setSize. This suggests the device loss is not caused by the early buffer resize. It may instead stem from the first render or the heavy scene setup.\n\nThe device-lost promise is asynchronous. It could resolve after the rapier warning if `setSize` destroys the context, or before the mark if the first render does. Both scenarios fit the observed console order.\n\nTemporary console.log markers will be added to main.js at key boot stages. These will reveal the exact execution order before the final build.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1cab6d61-bb59-436d-a4be-7286b42f0d87-97","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/main.js","old_string":"    renderer = await createRenderer(canvas);\n    fitBuffer(canvas, renderer);\n    await showLot();\n    document.body.dataset.boot = \"ready\";\n    requestAnimationFrame(frame);","new_string":"    renderer = await createRenderer(canvas);\n    console.log(\"MARK renderer\");\n    fitBuffer(canvas, renderer);\n    console.log(\"MARK sized\");\n    await showLot();\n    console.log(\"MARK lot\");\n    document.body.dataset.boot = \"ready\";\n    requestAnimationFrame(frame);"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1cab6d61-bb59-436d-a4be-7286b42f0d87-98","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.