{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_87","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"A single box crashes the device on first render.\n\nThe crash likely stems from renderer setup rather than scene complexity. Suspects include tone mapping, color space, pixel ratio, shadow maps, antialiasing, and canvas resizing.\n\nThe crash occurs at the MARK render log inside renderViews, before fitBuffer or renderer.render() are called. This points to the renderer setup itself as the cause.\n\nThe crash likely stems from an asynchronous device loss triggered by the initial `setSize` call during boot, not from `renderer.render()` itself. The canvas resize appears to destroy the WebGL context after the first frame begins.\n\nThe log order cannot distinguish between a `setSize`-triggered device loss and a `render()`-triggered one. Both scenarios could produce the same sequence of MARK logs.\n\nThe first frame's fitBuffer should not trigger a second setSize because the fitted dimensions already match from boot. This rules out a repeated resize as the cause. The crash likely stems from renderer.render() itself or an asynchronous device loss from the initial boot call. Removing all setSize calls entirely will isolate the true source.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-17b73303-d1d7-427f-9a47-1b2d8369aa90-108","name":"search_replace","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/scene.js","old_string":"  if (renderer) {\n    if (fitted.width !== width || fitted.height !== height) {\n      renderer.setPixelRatio(1);\n      renderer.setSize(width, height, false);\n      fitted.width = width;\n      fitted.height = height;\n    }\n  } else if (canvas.width !== width || canvas.height !== height) {","new_string":"  if (renderer) {\n    fitted.width = width;\n    fitted.height = height;\n  } else if (canvas.width !== width || canvas.height !== height) {"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":746,"output_tokens":924,"cache_read_input_tokens":140672,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a17fba-2fc3-7d53-9fa6-699993e68862","uuid":"0a67c9d5-da14-4133-8185-ad6f8eacfe05"}
