{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_96","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed the race title, Grand Cup button, 1280x720 canvas, lap/place/speed display for eight drivers, and three-second countdown.\n\nAbout screen verified. No console errors. Speed is zero during countdown. Two logs match. Next: confirm HTML titles and banned words, write stack-notes.md, flip plan checkboxes, kill the server, update todos, and check deviations. Disabling shadows is not a deviation. Filename is correct.\n\nUnit tests still pass at 14. The logs are valid because the tests do not import scene or credits modules, and the edited files were not modified after the green run. Stack notes will document the Cel shader using MeshToonNodeMaterial with a four-stop nearest DataTexture gradient, plus inverse-hull outlines scaled to 1.045 with MeshBasicNodeMaterial on BackSide.\n\nLighting uses directional, hemisphere and ambient sources. Lantern course adds point lights. Shadow maps are disabled.\n\nAnimation includes wheel spin from speed, bobbing and leaning drivers, tumbling crates, flame flicker, drift sparks, held item spin and balloon float.\n\nMenu flows are now defined. Grand Cup routes through character selection to Cinder Loop then Lantern Causeway. Versus supports two to four players. Time Trial and Balloon Battle each select a player count and characters before racing.\n\nThe final reply will include Source Information, Engine Feedback, Prompt Feedback, and Testing Feedback. The about screen contains the testing feedback section.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3bdd452d-507d-4ad9-9577-366a79196f7b-127","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"Deviations","path":"/home/micha/.grok/sessions/%2Fhome%2Fmicha%2Fdev%2Fcc-matrix%2Fruns%2Fgrok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on%2Fwork/01a17fba-2fc3-7d53-9fa6-699993e68862/goal/plan.md"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-3bdd452d-507d-4ad9-9577-366a79196f7