{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_146","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe pause bug stems from a race condition: the pause state is set without seeding menuPrev, so the next frame treats the still-held Escape key as a rising edge and immediately returns to the race. The fix at main.js:830-840 copies the current pause/back action into menuPrev when entering pause, ensuring the edge fires only afterReviewing the pause  release.\n\nThe `seedHeldMenu` helper merges the heldlogic for remaining  action into a neutral base and sets `pause:bugs. true`. On the next frame, the pause screen triggers the else branch at line 858. The pause edge is then evaluated against `menuPrev` to prevent an immediate resume.\n\nThe seeded menuPrev preserves both pause and back as true. This blocks the pause edge while Escape remains held, since menuEdges requires the current state to be true and the previous state \n\nFound the root cause.to be false. The edge The race branch pauses only fires once the without seeding menuPrev, key is released. so the next frame treats the held pause as a rising edge and returns to the race. The fix seeds menuPrev with seedHeldMenu, which always forces pause to true.\n\nThe next frame now detects the pause edge and returns to race.\n\nA second Escape press The back edge is swallowed correctly resumes the by onMenuEdges. race because Escape is mapped to both pause and back. The Resume menu option uses confirm on that row. A potential issue was noted: seedHeldMenu receives drivingActions with playerIndex 0 and pads[0].\n\nConfirmed the fix handles edge cases correctly. While Escape is held, both back and pause edges remain false,","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1189604a-5fee-4701-9a19-3a8911c4641c-11","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/input.js","offset":1,"limit":90}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1189604a-5fee-4701-9a19-3a8911c4641c-12","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/scene.js","offset":200,"limit":70}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1189604a-5fee-4701-9a19-3a8911c4641c-13","name":"grep","input":{"pattern":"outlineMaterialOptions|BackSide|seedHeldMenu|side:","glob":"**/Kartesian-Derby*.html"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1189604a-5fee-4701-9a19-3a8911c4641c-14","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/tmp/grok-goal-17adb0589bdc/implementer/unit-tests-2.log","limit":80}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-1189604a-5fee-4701-9a19-3a8911c4641c-15","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/tmp/grok-goal-17adb0589bdc/implementer/launch-1.log","limit":120}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32378,"output_tokens":1066,"cache_read_input_tokens":1792,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a17fba-2fc3-7d53-9fa6-699993e68862","uuid":"25394057-0643-46b1-a6dc-55412feb178e"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1189604a-5fee-4701-9a19-3a8911c4641c-11","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { clamp } from \\\"./math.js\\\";\\n\\nexport const TOUCH_MESSAGE = \\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\";\\nexport const ATTRACT_IDLE_SEC = 10;\\nconst DEADZONE = 0.18;\\n\\nexport function neutralAction() {\\n  return {\\n    steer: 0,\\n10→    accel: false,\\n    brake: false,\\n    hop: false,\\n    useItem: false,\\n    camera: false,\\n    pause: false,\\n    confirm: false,\\n    back: false,\\n    menuX: 0,\\n    menuY: 0,\\n20→  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function applyAxisInvert(x, y, settings) {\\n  return {\\n    x: settings && settings.invertX ? -x : x,\\n    y: settings && settings.invertY ? -y : y,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n30→export function touchGateVisible(env) {\\n  return !!(env && env.coarsePointer && !env.hover && env.maxTouchPoints > 0);\\n}\\n\\nfunction buttonDown(buttons, index, threshold = 0.5) {\\n  return (buttons && buttons[index] ? buttons[index] : 0) > threshold;\\n}\\n\\nexport function actionsFromPad(pad, settings) {\\n  const axes = (pad && pad.axes) || [0, 0, 0, 0];\\n40→  const buttons = (pad && pad.buttons) || [];\\n  const stick = applyAxisInvert(axes[0] || 0, axes[1] || 0, settings || {});\\n  const steer = Math.abs(stick.x) < DEADZONE ? 0 : clamp(stick.x, -1, 1);\\n  const sy = Math.abs(stick.y) < DEADZONE ? 0 : stick.y;\\n  const dpadX = (buttonDown(buttons, 15) ? 1 : 0) - (buttonDown(buttons, 14) ? 1 : 0);\\n  const dpadY = (buttonDown(buttons, 13) ? 1 : 0) - (buttonDown(buttons, 12) ? 1 : 0);\\n  return {\\n    steer,\\n    accel: buttonDown(buttons, 7, 0.12),\\n    brake: buttonDown(buttons, 6, 0.12),\\n50→    hop: buttonDown(buttons, 5),\\n    useItem: buttonDown(buttons, 4),\\n    camera: buttonDown(buttons, 3),\\n    pause: buttonDown(buttons, 9),\\n    confirm: buttonDown(buttons, 0),\\n    back: buttonDown(buttons, 1),\\n    menuX: dpadX || (Math.abs(steer) > 0.55 ? Math.sign(steer) : 0),\\n    menuY: dpadY || (Math.abs(sy) > 0.55 ? Math.sign(sy) : 0),\\n  };\\n}\\n60→\\nconst KEYSETS = [\\n  { accel: \\\"KeyW\\\", brake: \\\"KeyS\\\", left: \\\"KeyA\\\", right: \\\"KeyD\\\", hop: \\\"Space\\\", item: \\\"KeyF\\\", camera: \\\"KeyC\\\", pause: \\\"Escape\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"ArrowUp\\\", brake: \\\"ArrowDown\\\", left: \\\"ArrowLeft\\\", right: \\\"ArrowRight\\\", hop: \\\"ShiftRight\\\", item: \\\"Slash\\\", camera: \\\"Quote\\\", pause: \\\"Enter\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"KeyI\\\", brake: \\\"KeyK\\\", left: \\\"KeyJ\\\", right: \\\"KeyL\\\", hop: \\\"KeyU\\\", item: \\\"KeyO\\\", camera: \\\"KeyP\\\", pause: \\\"\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"Numpad8\\\", brake: \\\"Numpad5\\\", left: \\\"Numpad4\\\", right: \\\"Numpad6\\\", hop: \\\"Numpad7\\\", item: \\\"Numpad9\\\", camera: \\\"NumpadAdd\\\", pause: \\\"\\\" },\\n];\\n\\nexport function actionsFromKeys(down, playerIndex) {\\n  const keys = KEYSETS[playerIndex] || KEYSETS[0];\\n70→  const on = (code) => !!(code && down && down[code]);\\n  let steer = 0;\\n  if (on(keys.left)) steer -= 1;\\n  if (on(keys.right)) steer += 1;\\n  const menuX = playerIndex === 0\\n    ? (on(\\\"ArrowRight\\\") || on(\\\"KeyD\\\") ? 1 : 0) - (on(\\\"ArrowLeft\\\") || on(\\\"KeyA\\\") ? 1 : 0)\\n    : 0;\\n  const menuY = playerIndex === 0\\n    ? (on(\\\"ArrowDown\\\") || on(\\\"KeyS\\\") ? 1 : 0) - (on(\\\"ArrowUp\\\") || on(\\\"KeyW\\\") ? 1 : 0)\\n    : 0;\\n80→  return {\\n    steer,\\n    accel: on(keys.accel),\\n    brake: on(keys.brake),\\n    hop: on(keys.hop),\\n    useItem: on(keys.item),\\n    camera: on(keys.camera),\\n    pause: on(keys.pause),\\n    confirm: playerIndex === 0 && (on(\\\"Enter\\\") || on(\\\"Space\\\")),\\n    back: playerIndex === 0 && (on(\\\"Escape\\\") || on(\\\"Backspace\\\")),\\n90→    menuX,\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { clamp } from \\\"./math.js\\\";\\n\\nexport const TOUCH_MESSAGE = \\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\";\\nexport const ATTRACT_IDLE_SEC = 10;\\nconst DEADZONE = 0.18;\\n\\nexport function neutralAction() {\\n  return {\\n    steer: 0,\\n10→    accel: false,\\n    brake: false,\\n    hop: false,\\n    useItem: false,\\n    camera: false,\\n    pause: false,\\n    confirm: false,\\n    back: false,\\n    menuX: 0,\\n    menuY: 0,\\n20→  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function applyAxisInvert(x, y, settings) {\\n  return {\\n    x: settings && settings.invertX ? -x : x,\\n    y: settings && settings.invertY ? -y : y,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n30→export function touchGateVisible(env) {\\n  return !!(env && env.coarsePointer && !env.hover && env.maxTouchPoints > 0);\\n}\\n\\nfunction buttonDown(buttons, index, threshold = 0.5) {\\n  return (buttons && buttons[index] ? buttons[index] : 0) > threshold;\\n}\\n\\nexport function actionsFromPad(pad, settings) {\\n  const axes = (pad && pad.axes) || [0, 0, 0, 0];\\n40→  const buttons = (pad && pad.buttons) || [];\\n  const stick = applyAxisInvert(axes[0] || 0, axes[1] || 0, settings || {});\\n  const steer = Math.abs(stick.x) < DEADZONE ? 0 : clamp(stick.x, -1, 1);\\n  const sy = Math.abs(stick.y) < DEADZONE ? 0 : stick.y;\\n  const dpadX = (buttonDown(buttons, 15) ? 1 : 0) - (buttonDown(buttons, 14) ? 1 : 0);\\n  const dpadY = (buttonDown(buttons, 13) ? 1 : 0) - (buttonDown(buttons, 12) ? 1 : 0);\\n  return {\\n    steer,\\n    accel: buttonDown(buttons, 7, 0.12),\\n    brake: buttonDown(buttons, 6, 0.12),\\n50→    hop: buttonDown(buttons, 5),\\n    useItem: buttonDown(buttons, 4),\\n    camera: buttonDown(buttons, 3),\\n    pause: buttonDown(buttons, 9),\\n    confirm: buttonDown(buttons, 0),\\n    back: buttonDown(buttons, 1),\\n    menuX: dpadX || (Math.abs(steer) > 0.55 ? Math.sign(steer) : 0),\\n    menuY: dpadY || (Math.abs(sy) > 0.55 ? Math.sign(sy) : 0),\\n  };\\n}\\n60→\\nconst KEYSETS = [\\n  { accel: \\\"KeyW\\\", brake: \\\"KeyS\\\", left: \\\"KeyA\\\", right: \\\"KeyD\\\", hop: \\\"Space\\\", item: \\\"KeyF\\\", camera: \\\"KeyC\\\", pause: \\\"Escape\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"ArrowUp\\\", brake: \\\"ArrowDown\\\", left: \\\"ArrowLeft\\\", right: \\\"ArrowRight\\\", hop: \\\"ShiftRight\\\", item: \\\"Slash\\\", camera: \\\"Quote\\\", pause: \\\"Enter\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"KeyI\\\", brake: \\\"KeyK\\\", left: \\\"KeyJ\\\", right: \\\"KeyL\\\", hop: \\\"KeyU\\\", item: \\\"KeyO\\\", camera: \\\"KeyP\\\", pause: \\\"\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"Numpad8\\\", brake: \\\"Numpad5\\\", left: \\\"Numpad4\\\", right: \\\"Numpad6\\\", hop: \\\"Numpad7\\\", item: \\\"Numpad9\\\", camera: \\\"NumpadAdd\\\", pause: \\\"\\\" },\\n];\\n\\nexport function actionsFromKeys(down, playerIndex) {\\n  const keys = KEYSETS[playerIndex] || KEYSETS[0];\\n70→  const on = (code) => !!(code && down && down[code]);\\n  let steer = 0;\\n  if (on(keys.left)) steer -= 1;\\n  if (on(keys.right)) steer += 1;\\n  const menuX = playerIndex === 0\\n    ? (on(\\\"ArrowRight\\\") || on(\\\"KeyD\\\") ? 1 : 0) - (on(\\\"ArrowLeft\\\") || on(\\\"KeyA\\\") ? 1 : 0)\\n    : 0;\\n  const menuY = playerIndex === 0\\n    ? (on(\\\"ArrowDown\\\") || on(\\\"KeyS\\\") ? 1 : 0) - (on(\\\"ArrowUp\\\") || on(\\\"KeyW\\\") ? 1 : 0)\\n    : 0;\\n80→  return {\\n    steer,\\n    accel: on(keys.accel),\\n    brake: on(keys.brake),\\n    hop: on(keys.hop),\\n    useItem: on(keys.item),\\n    camera: on(keys.camera),\\n    pause: on(keys.pause),\\n    confirm: playerIndex === 0 && (on(\\\"Enter\\\") || on(\\\"Space\\\")),\\n    back: playerIndex === 0 && (on(\\\"Escape\\\") || on(\\\"Backspace\\\")),\\n90→    menuX,\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/input.js\",\"offset\":1,\"limit\":90,\"raw_output\":\"import { clamp } from \\\"./math.js\\\";\\n\\nexport const TOUCH_MESSAGE = \\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\";\\nexport const ATTRACT_IDLE_SEC = 10;\\nconst DEADZONE = 0.18;\\n\\nexport function neutralAction() {\\n  return {\\n    steer: 0,\\n    accel: false,\\n    brake: false,\\n    hop: false,\\n    useItem: false,\\n    camera: false,\\n    pause: false,\\n    confirm: false,\\n    back: false,\\n    menuX: 0,\\n    menuY: 0,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function applyAxisInvert(x, y, settings) {\\n  return {\\n    x: settings && settings.invertX ? -x : x,\\n    y: settings && settings.invertY ? -y : y,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function touchGateVisible(env) {\\n  return !!(env && env.coarsePointer && !env.hover && env.maxTouchPoints > 0);\\n}\\n\\nfunction buttonDown(buttons, index, threshold = 0.5) {\\n  return (buttons && buttons[index] ? buttons[index] : 0) > threshold;\\n}\\n\\nexport function actionsFromPad(pad, settings) {\\n  const axes = (pad && pad.axes) || [0, 0, 0, 0];\\n  const buttons = (pad && pad.buttons) || [];\\n  const stick = applyAxisInvert(axes[0] || 0, axes[1] || 0, settings || {});\\n  const steer = Math.abs(stick.x) < DEADZONE ? 0 : clamp(stick.x, -1, 1);\\n  const sy = Math.abs(stick.y) < DEADZONE ? 0 : stick.y;\\n  const dpadX = (buttonDown(buttons, 15) ? 1 : 0) - (buttonDown(buttons, 14) ? 1 : 0);\\n  const dpadY = (buttonDown(buttons, 13) ? 1 : 0) - (buttonDown(buttons, 12) ? 1 : 0);\\n  return {\\n    steer,\\n    accel: buttonDown(buttons, 7, 0.12),\\n    brake: buttonDown(buttons, 6, 0.12),\\n    hop: buttonDown(buttons, 5),\\n    useItem: buttonDown(buttons, 4),\\n    camera: buttonDown(buttons, 3),\\n    pause: buttonDown(buttons, 9),\\n    confirm: buttonDown(buttons, 0),\\n    back: buttonDown(buttons, 1),\\n    menuX: dpadX || (Math.abs(steer) > 0.55 ? Math.sign(steer) : 0),\\n    menuY: dpadY || (Math.abs(sy) > 0.55 ? Math.sign(sy) : 0),\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nconst KEYSETS = [\\n  { accel: \\\"KeyW\\\", brake: \\\"KeyS\\\", left: \\\"KeyA\\\", right: \\\"KeyD\\\", hop: \\\"Space\\\", item: \\\"KeyF\\\", camera: \\\"KeyC\\\", pause: \\\"Escape\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"ArrowUp\\\", brake: \\\"ArrowDown\\\", left: \\\"ArrowLeft\\\", right: \\\"ArrowRight\\\", hop: \\\"ShiftRight\\\", item: \\\"Slash\\\", camera: \\\"Quote\\\", pause: \\\"Enter\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"KeyI\\\", brake: \\\"KeyK\\\", left: \\\"KeyJ\\\", right: \\\"KeyL\\\", hop: \\\"KeyU\\\", item: \\\"KeyO\\\", camera: \\\"KeyP\\\", pause: \\\"\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"Numpad8\\\", brake: \\\"Numpad5\\\", left: \\\"Numpad4\\\", right: \\\"Numpad6\\\", hop: \\\"Numpad7\\\", item: \\\"Numpad9\\\", camera: \\\"NumpadAdd\\\", pause: \\\"\\\" },\\n];\\n\\nexport function actionsFromKeys(down, playerIndex) {\\n  const keys = KEYSETS[playerIndex] || KEYSETS[0];\\n  const on = (code) => !!(code && down && down[code]);\\n  let steer = 0;\\n  if (on(keys.left)) steer -= 1;\\n  if (on(keys.right)) steer += 1;\\n  const menuX = playerIndex === 0\\n    ? (on(\\\"ArrowRight\\\") || on(\\\"KeyD\\\") ? 1 : 0) - (on(\\\"ArrowLeft\\\") || on(\\\"KeyA\\\") ? 1 : 0)\\n    : 0;\\n  const menuY = playerIndex === 0\\n    ? (on(\\\"ArrowDown\\\") || on(\\\"KeyS\\\") ? 1 : 0) - (on(\\\"ArrowUp\\\") || on(\\\"KeyW\\\") ? 1 : 0)\\n    : 0;\\n  return {\\n    steer,\\n    accel: on(keys.accel),\\n    brake: on(keys.brake),\\n    hop: on(keys.hop),\\n    useItem: on(keys.item),\\n    camera: on(keys.camera),\\n    pause: on(keys.pause),\\n    confirm: playerIndex === 0 && (on(\\\"Enter\\\") || on(\\\"Space\\\")),\\n    back: playerIndex === 0 && (on(\\\"Escape\\\") || on(\\\"Backspace\\\")),\\n    menuX,\\n\",\"total_lines\":161}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-1189604a-5fee-4701-9a19-3a8911c4641c-12","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"200→      mesh = paintMesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(obstacle.r, obstacle.r, 2.4, 12), mats.toon(0xd7c4a2), true);\\n      mesh.position.set(obstacle.x, 1.2, obstacle.z);\\n    } else {\\n      mesh = paintMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(obstacle.hx * 2, 2.2, obstacle.hz * 2), mats.toon(0xb08968), true);\\n      mesh.position.set(obstacle.x, 1.1, obstacle.z);\\n    }\\n    scene.add(mesh);\\n  }\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\\n    const lamp = paintMesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.28, 8, 8), mats.basic(0xffd6a5), false);\\n210→    const angle = (i / 10) * Math.PI * 2;\\n    lamp.position.set(Math.cos(angle) * (course.width / 2 - 1), 2.6, Math.sin(angle) * (course.depth / 2 - 1));\\n    scene.add(lamp);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction buildKart(raceKart, mats) {\\n  const stats = raceKart.stats;\\n  const body = stats.body;\\n  const group = new THREE.Group();\\n220→  group.rotation.order = \\\"YXZ\\\";\\n  const chassis = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(body[0], body[1], body[2]), mats.toon(stats.color));\\n  chassis.position.y = 0.42;\\n  chassis.castShadow = true;\\n  chassis.receiveShadow = true;\\n  chassis.userData.outlineMaterial = mats.outline;\\n  addOutline(chassis);\\n  const nose = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(body[0] * 0.62, body[1] * 0.55, body[2] * 0.28), mats.toon(stats.color));\\n  nose.position.set(0, 0.4, body[2] * 0.52);\\n  nose.castShadow = true;\\n230→  group.add(chassis, nose);\\n  const wheelGeo = new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.26, 0.26, 0.18, 8);\\n  const wheels = [];\\n  for (const [sx, sz] of [[-1, -1], [1, -1], [-1, 1], [1, 1]]) {\\n    const pivot = new THREE.Group();\\n    const wheel = new THREE.Mesh(wheelGeo, mats.toon(0x1c1c22));\\n    wheel.rotation.z = Math.PI / 2;\\n    wheel.castShadow = true;\\n    pivot.add(wheel);\\n    pivot.position.set(sx * body[0] * 0.42, 0.28, sz * body[2] * 0.34);\\n240→    group.add(pivot);\\n    wheels.push(pivot);\\n  }\\n  const driver = new THREE.Group();\\n  const torso = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.34, 0.36, 0.26), mats.toon(stats.cloth));\\n  torso.position.y = 0.72;\\n  torso.castShadow = true;\\n  torso.userData.outlineMaterial = mats.outline;\\n  addOutline(torso);\\n  const head = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.2, 10, 8), mats.toon(stats.accent));\\n250→  head.position.y = 1.05;\\n  head.castShadow = true;\\n  head.userData.outlineMaterial = mats.outline;\\n  addOutline(head);\\n  const eye = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.05, 0.05, 0.04), mats.basic(0x1b1b22));\\n  eye.position.set(0.07, 1.08, 0.16);\\n  const eye2 = eye.clone();\\n  eye2.position.x = -0.07;\\n  driver.add(torso, head, eye, eye2);\\n  if (stats.id === \\\"pip\\\") {\\n260→    for (const x of [-0.18, 0.18]) {\\n      const puff = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.1, 8, 6), mats.toon(stats.color));\\n      puff.position.set(x, 1.12, -0.02);\\n      driver.add(puff);\\n    }\\n  } else if (stats.id === \\\"quill\\\") {\\n    const quill = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.16, 8, 6), mats.toon(0xfff1b0));\\n    quill.scale.set(0.45, 1.4, 0.45);\\n    quill.position.set(0, 1.32, -0.02);\\n    driver.add(quill);\",\"content_concise\":\"200→      mesh = paintMesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(obstacle.r, obstacle.r, 2.4, 12), mats.toon(0xd7c4a2), true);\\n      mesh.position.set(obstacle.x, 1.2, obstacle.z);\\n    } else {\\n      mesh = paintMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(obstacle.hx * 2, 2.2, obstacle.hz * 2), mats.toon(0xb08968), true);\\n      mesh.position.set(obstacle.x, 1.1, obstacle.z);\\n    }\\n    scene.add(mesh);\\n  }\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\\n    const lamp = paintMesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.28, 8, 8), mats.basic(0xffd6a5), false);\\n210→    const angle = (i / 10) * Math.PI * 2;\\n    lamp.position.set(Math.cos(angle) * (course.width / 2 - 1), 2.6, Math.sin(angle) * (course.depth / 2 - 1));\\n    scene.add(lamp);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction buildKart(raceKart, mats) {\\n  const stats = raceKart.stats;\\n  const body = stats.body;\\n  const group = new THREE.Group();\\n220→  group.rotation.order = \\\"YXZ\\\";\\n  const chassis = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(body[0], body[1], body[2]), mats.toon(stats.color));\\n  chassis.position.y = 0.42;\\n  chassis.castShadow = true;\\n  chassis.receiveShadow = true;\\n  chassis.userData.outlineMaterial = mats.outline;\\n  addOutline(chassis);\\n  const n