{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_147","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":" so the pause screen stays stable. Releasing the key produces no spurious edges. Pressing Escape again triggers both the pause edge and the back edge, which resumes the race cleanly.Prior gaps appear fixed.\n\nPause logic copies held menu state and defers edge updates until release. Outline materials use BackSide on chassis, torso, and head.\n\nChecking the second Escape press order:\n\nThe outline test is onMenuEdges resumes first, then pauseEdge valid. It exercises redundantly sets race the real function used again. This is harmless. by scene.js, which \n\nNow investigating passes BackSide to basica potential bug for  materials.player 2. Player 2 pauses with Enter, but back is only mapped to Escape and Backspace for player 1. seedHeldMenu only evaluates drivingActions for playerIndex 0, so player 2's pause input may not be captured correctly.\n\nConfirmed the player 2 pause bug. seedHeldMenu reads player 0's drivingActions, so Enter is not recognized as a pause key. held.pause becomes false, but seedHeldMenu forces pause: true anyway. \n\nGamepad button mapping is verified. Pause uses Start, back uses Circle, and confirmThe next frame sees player 0 still holding Escape, so pause stays active. uses A. seedHeldMenu correctly forces pause:true while Start remains held.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fdffd832-a467-43b3-879e-df787c3b5167-12","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/input.js"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fdffd832-a467-43b3-879e-df787c3b5167-13","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/scene.js","offset":180,"limit":160}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-fdffd832-a467-43b3-879e-df787c3b5167-14","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/test/game.test.mjs","offset":420,"limit":80}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1846,"output_tokens":1305,"cache_read_input_tokens":31232,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a17fba-2fc3-7d53-9fa6-699993e68862","uuid":"f4de2e2c-174a-40f9-90b3-f77206ec6f08"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-fdffd832-a467-43b3-879e-df787c3b5167-12","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→import { clamp } from \\\"./math.js\\\";\\n\\nexport const TOUCH_MESSAGE = \\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\";\\nexport const ATTRACT_IDLE_SEC = 10;\\nconst DEADZONE = 0.18;\\n\\nexport function neutralAction() {\\n  return {\\n    steer: 0,\\n10→    accel: false,\\n    brake: false,\\n    hop: false,\\n    useItem: false,\\n    camera: false,\\n    pause: false,\\n    confirm: false,\\n    back: false,\\n    menuX: 0,\\n    menuY: 0,\\n20→  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function applyAxisInvert(x, y, settings) {\\n  return {\\n    x: settings && settings.invertX ? -x : x,\\n    y: settings && settings.invertY ? -y : y,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n30→export function touchGateVisible(env) {\\n  return !!(env && env.coarsePointer && !env.hover && env.maxTouchPoints > 0);\\n}\\n\\nfunction buttonDown(buttons, index, threshold = 0.5) {\\n  return (buttons && buttons[index] ? buttons[index] : 0) > threshold;\\n}\\n\\nexport function actionsFromPad(pad, settings) {\\n  const axes = (pad && pad.axes) || [0, 0, 0, 0];\\n40→  const buttons = (pad && pad.buttons) || [];\\n  const stick = applyAxisInvert(axes[0] || 0, axes[1] || 0, settings || {});\\n  const steer = Math.abs(stick.x) < DEADZONE ? 0 : clamp(stick.x, -1, 1);\\n  const sy = Math.abs(stick.y) < DEADZONE ? 0 : stick.y;\\n  const dpadX = (buttonDown(buttons, 15) ? 1 : 0) - (buttonDown(buttons, 14) ? 1 : 0);\\n  const dpadY = (buttonDown(buttons, 13) ? 1 : 0) - (buttonDown(buttons, 12) ? 1 : 0);\\n  return {\\n    steer,\\n    accel: buttonDown(buttons, 7, 0.12),\\n    brake: buttonDown(buttons, 6, 0.12),\\n50→    hop: buttonDown(buttons, 5),\\n    useItem: buttonDown(buttons, 4),\\n    camera: buttonDown(buttons, 3),\\n    pause: buttonDown(buttons, 9),\\n    confirm: buttonDown(buttons, 0),\\n    back: buttonDown(buttons, 1),\\n    menuX: dpadX || (Math.abs(steer) > 0.55 ? Math.sign(steer) : 0),\\n    menuY: dpadY || (Math.abs(sy) > 0.55 ? Math.sign(sy) : 0),\\n  };\\n}\\n60→\\nconst KEYSETS = [\\n  { accel: \\\"KeyW\\\", brake: \\\"KeyS\\\", left: \\\"KeyA\\\", right: \\\"KeyD\\\", hop: \\\"Space\\\", item: \\\"KeyF\\\", camera: \\\"KeyC\\\", pause: \\\"Escape\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"ArrowUp\\\", brake: \\\"ArrowDown\\\", left: \\\"ArrowLeft\\\", right: \\\"ArrowRight\\\", hop: \\\"ShiftRight\\\", item: \\\"Slash\\\", camera: \\\"Quote\\\", pause: \\\"Enter\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"KeyI\\\", brake: \\\"KeyK\\\", left: \\\"KeyJ\\\", right: \\\"KeyL\\\", hop: \\\"KeyU\\\", item: \\\"KeyO\\\", camera: \\\"KeyP\\\", pause: \\\"\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"Numpad8\\\", brake: \\\"Numpad5\\\", left: \\\"Numpad4\\\", right: \\\"Numpad6\\\", hop: \\\"Numpad7\\\", item: \\\"Numpad9\\\", camera: \\\"NumpadAdd\\\", pause: \\\"\\\" },\\n];\\n\\nexport function actionsFromKeys(down, playerIndex) {\\n  const keys = KEYSETS[playerIndex] || KEYSETS[0];\\n70→  const on = (code) => !!(code && down && down[code]);\\n  let steer = 0;\\n  if (on(keys.left)) steer -= 1;\\n  if (on(keys.right)) steer += 1;\\n  const menuX = playerIndex === 0\\n    ? (on(\\\"ArrowRight\\\") || on(\\\"KeyD\\\") ? 1 : 0) - (on(\\\"ArrowLeft\\\") || on(\\\"KeyA\\\") ? 1 : 0)\\n    : 0;\\n  const menuY = playerIndex === 0\\n    ? (on(\\\"ArrowDown\\\") || on(\\\"KeyS\\\") ? 1 : 0) - (on(\\\"ArrowUp\\\") || on(\\\"KeyW\\\") ? 1 : 0)\\n    : 0;\\n80→  return {\\n    steer,\\n    accel: on(keys.accel),\\n    brake: on(keys.brake),\\n    hop: on(keys.hop),\\n    useItem: on(keys.item),\\n    camera: on(keys.camera),\\n    pause: on(keys.pause),\\n    confirm: playerIndex === 0 && (on(\\\"Enter\\\") || on(\\\"Space\\\")),\\n    back: playerIndex === 0 && (on(\\\"Escape\\\") || on(\\\"Backspace\\\")),\\n90→    menuX,\\n    menuY,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function actionsFromMouse(mouse) {\\n  const buttons = (mouse && mouse.buttons) || [];\\n  return {\\n    steer: clamp((mouse && mouse.dx ? mouse.dx : 0) / 28, -1, 1),\\n    accel: !!buttons[0],\\n100→    brake: !!buttons[2],\\n    hop: !!buttons[1],\\n    useItem: !!(mouse && mouse.wheel),\\n    camera: false,\\n    pause: false,\\n    confirm: !!buttons[0],\\n    back: !!buttons[2],\\n    menuX: 0,\\n    menuY: 0,\\n  };\\n110→}\\n\\nexport function menuEdges(action, prev) {\\n  const current = action || neutralAction();\\n  const before = prev || neutralAction();\\n  return {\\n    menuX: current.menuX && !before.menuX ? current.menuX : 0,\\n    menuY: current.menuY && !before.menuY ? current.menuY : 0,\\n    confirm: !!(current.confirm && !before.confirm),\\n    back: !!(current.back && !before.back),\\n120→    pause: !!(current.pause && !before.pause),\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n// The press that opens pause is still down on the next frame. Latch it so\\n// pause and back do not read as a fresh edge until the key is released.\\nexport function seedHeldMenu(held) {\\n  return { ...neutralAction(), ...held, pause: true };\\n}\\n\\n130→export function drivingActions({ pad, keys, mouse, settings, playerIndex, useMouse }) {\\n  const key = actionsFromKeys(keys, playerIndex || 0);\\n  const padAct = pad ? actionsFromPad(pad, settings) : null;\\n  const mouseAct = useMouse && mouse ? actionsFromMouse(mouse) : null;\\n  let steer = key.steer;\\n  if (padAct && Math.abs(padAct.steer) > Math.abs(steer)) steer = padAct.steer;\\n  if (mouseAct && Math.abs(mouseAct.steer) > 0.04) steer = mouseAct.steer;\\n  return {\\n    steer,\\n    accel: key.accel || !!(padAct && padAct.accel) || !!(mouseAct && mouseAct.accel),\\n140→    brake: key.brake || !!(padAct && padAct.brake) || !!(mouseAct && mouseAct.brake),\\n    hop: key.hop || !!(padAct && padAct.hop) || !!(mouseAct && mouseAct.hop),\\n    useItem: key.useItem || !!(padAct && padAct.useItem) || !!(mouseAct && mouseAct.useItem),\\n    camera: key.camera || !!(padAct && padAct.camera),\\n    pause: key.pause || !!(padAct && padAct.pause),\\n    confirm: key.confirm || !!(padAct && padAct.confirm),\\n    back: key.back || !!(padAct && padAct.back),\\n    menuX: (padAct && padAct.menuX) || key.menuX,\\n    menuY: (padAct && padAct.menuY) || key.menuY,\\n  };\\n150→}\\n\\nexport const CONTROL_LINES = [\\n  [\\\"Right trigger\\\", \\\"Go\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Left trigger\\\", \\\"Brake. Hold it with a shield item to trail it.\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Left stick\\\", \\\"Steer\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Right bumper\\\", \\\"Hop. Hold it through the turn. Two sparks, then let go.\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Left bumper\\\", \\\"Use an item. Tap during the spin to take it early.\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Triangle\\\", \\\"Camera\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Options\\\", \\\"Pause\\\"],\\n160→  [\\\"Keyboard\\\", \\\"WASD, Space, F, C, Esc. Extra drivers: arrows, IJKL, numpad.\\\"],\\n];\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"1→import { clamp } from \\\"./math.js\\\";\\n\\nexport const TOUCH_MESSAGE = \\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\";\\nexport const ATTRACT_IDLE_SEC = 10;\\nconst DEADZONE = 0.18;\\n\\nexport function neutralAction() {\\n  return {\\n    steer: 0,\\n10→    accel: false,\\n    brake: false,\\n    hop: false,\\n    useItem: false,\\n    camera: false,\\n    pause: false,\\n    confirm: false,\\n    back: false,\\n    menuX: 0,\\n    menuY: 0,\\n20→  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function applyAxisInvert(x, y, settings) {\\n  return {\\n    x: settings && settings.invertX ? -x : x,\\n    y: settings && settings.invertY ? -y : y,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n30→export function touchGateVisible(env) {\\n  return !!(env && env.coarsePointer && !env.hover && env.maxTouchPoints > 0);\\n}\\n\\nfunction buttonDown(buttons, index, threshold = 0.5) {\\n  return (buttons && buttons[index] ? buttons[index] : 0) > threshold;\\n}\\n\\nexport function actionsFromPad(pad, settings) {\\n  const axes = (pad && pad.axes) || [0, 0, 0, 0];\\n40→  const buttons = (pad && pad.buttons) || [];\\n  const stick = applyAxisInvert(axes[0] || 0, axes[1] || 0, settings || {});\\n  const steer = Math.abs(stick.x) < DEADZONE ? 0 : clamp(stick.x, -1, 1);\\n  const sy = Math.abs(stick.y) < DEADZONE ? 0 : stick.y;\\n  const dpadX = (buttonDown(buttons, 15) ? 1 : 0) - (buttonDown(buttons, 14) ? 1 : 0);\\n  const dpadY = (buttonDown(buttons, 13) ? 1 : 0) - (buttonDown(buttons, 12) ? 1 : 0);\\n  return {\\n    steer,\\n    accel: buttonDown(buttons, 7, 0.12),\\n    brake: buttonDown(buttons, 6, 0.12),\\n50→    hop: buttonDown(buttons, 5),\\n    useItem: buttonDown(buttons, 4),\\n    camera: buttonDown(buttons, 3),\\n    pause: buttonDown(buttons, 9),\\n    confirm: buttonDown(buttons, 0),\\n    back: buttonDown(buttons, 1),\\n    menuX: dpadX || (Math.abs(steer) > 0.55 ? Math.sign(steer) : 0),\\n    menuY: dpadY || (Math.abs(sy) > 0.55 ? Math.sign(sy) : 0),\\n  };\\n}\\n60→\\nconst KEYSETS = [\\n  { accel: \\\"KeyW\\\", brake: \\\"KeyS\\\", left: \\\"KeyA\\\", right: \\\"KeyD\\\", hop: \\\"Space\\\", item: \\\"KeyF\\\", camera: \\\"KeyC\\\", pause: \\\"Escape\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"ArrowUp\\\", brake: \\\"ArrowDown\\\", left: \\\"ArrowLeft\\\", right: \\\"ArrowRight\\\", hop: \\\"ShiftRight\\\", item: \\\"Slash\\\", camera: \\\"Quote\\\", pause: \\\"Enter\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"KeyI\\\", brake: \\\"KeyK\\\", left: \\\"KeyJ\\\", right: \\\"KeyL\\\", hop: \\\"KeyU\\\", item: \\\"KeyO\\\", camera: \\\"KeyP\\\", pause: \\\"\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"Numpad8\\\", brake: \\\"Numpad5\\\", left: \\\"Numpad4\\\", right: \\\"Numpad6\\\", hop: \\\"Numpad7\\\", item: \\\"Numpad9\\\", camera: \\\"NumpadAdd\\\", pause: \\\"\\\" },\\n];\\n\\nexport function actionsFromKeys(down, playerIndex) {\\n  const keys = KEYSETS[playerIndex] || KEYSETS[0];\\n70→  const on = (code) => !!(code && down && down[code]);\\n  let steer = 0;\\n  if (on(keys.left)) steer -= 1;\\n  if (on(keys.right)) steer += 1;\\n  const menuX = playerIndex === 0\\n    ? (on(\\\"ArrowRight\\\") || on(\\\"KeyD\\\") ? 1 : 0) - (on(\\\"ArrowLeft\\\") || on(\\\"KeyA\\\") ? 1 : 0)\\n    : 0;\\n  const menuY = playerIndex === 0\\n    ? (on(\\\"ArrowDown\\\") || on(\\\"KeyS\\\") ? 1 : 0) - (on(\\\"ArrowUp\\\") || on(\\\"KeyW\\\") ? 1 : 0)\\n    : 0;\\n80→  return {\\n    steer,\\n    accel: on(keys.accel),\\n    brake: on(keys.brake),\\n    hop: on(keys.hop),\\n    useItem: on(keys.item),\\n    camera: on(keys.camera),\\n    pause: on(keys.pause),\\n    confirm: playerIndex === 0 && (on(\\\"Enter\\\") || on(\\\"Space\\\")),\\n    back: playerIndex === 0 && (on(\\\"Escape\\\") || on(\\\"Backspace\\\")),\\n90→    menuX,\\n    menuY,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function actionsFromMouse(mouse) {\\n  const buttons = (mouse && mouse.buttons) || [];\\n  return {\\n    steer: clamp((mouse && mouse.dx ? mouse.dx : 0) / 28, -1, 1),\\n    accel: !!buttons[0],\\n100→    brake: !!buttons[2],\\n    hop: !!buttons[1],\\n    useItem: !!(mouse && mouse.wheel),\\n    camera: false,\\n    pause: false,\\n    confirm: !!buttons[0],\\n    back: !!buttons[2],\\n    menuX: 0,\\n    menuY: 0,\\n  };\\n110→}\\n\\nexport function menuEdges(action, prev) {\\n  const current = action || neutralAction();\\n  const before = prev || neutralAction();\\n  return {\\n    menuX: current.menuX && !before.menuX ? current.menuX : 0,\\n    menuY: current.menuY && !before.menuY ? current.menuY : 0,\\n    confirm: !!(current.confirm && !before.confirm),\\n    back: !!(current.back && !before.back),\\n120→    pause: !!(current.pause && !before.pause),\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n// The press that opens pause is still down on the next frame. Latch it so\\n// pause and back do not read as a fresh edge until the key is released.\\nexport function seedHeldMenu(held) {\\n  return { ...neutralAction(), ...held, pause: true };\\n}\\n\\n130→export function drivingActions({ pad, keys, mouse, settings, playerIndex, useMouse }) {\\n  const key = actionsFromKeys(keys, playerIndex || 0);\\n  const padAct = pad ? actionsFromPad(pad, settings) : null;\\n  const mouseAct = useMouse && mouse ? actionsFromMouse(mouse) : null;\\n  let steer = key.steer;\\n  if (padAct && Math.abs(padAct.steer) > Math.abs(steer)) steer = padAct.steer;\\n  if (mouseAct && Math.abs(mouseAct.steer) > 0.04) steer = mouseAct.steer;\\n  return {\\n    steer,\\n    accel: key.accel || !!(padAct && padAct.accel) || !!(mouseAct && mouseAct.accel),\\n140→    brake: key.brake || !!(padAct && padAct.brake) || !!(mouseAct && mouseAct.brake),\\n    hop: key.hop || !!(padAct && padAct.hop) || !!(mouseAct && mouseAct.hop),\\n    useItem: key.useItem || !!(padAct && padAct.useItem) || !!(mouseAct && mouseAct.useItem),\\n    camera: key.camera || !!(padAct && padAct.camera),\\n    pause: key.pause || !!(padAct && padAct.pause),\\n    confirm: key.confirm || !!(padAct && padAct.confirm),\\n    back: key.back || !!(padAct && padAct.back),\\n    menuX: (padAct && padAct.menuX) || key.menuX,\\n    menuY: (padAct && padAct.menuY) || key.menuY,\\n  };\\n150→}\\n\\nexport const CONTROL_LINES = [\\n  [\\\"Right trigger\\\", \\\"Go\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Left trigger\\\", \\\"Brake. Hold it with a shield item to trail it.\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Left stick\\\", \\\"Steer\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Right bumper\\\", \\\"Hop. Hold it through the turn. Two sparks, then let go.\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Left bumper\\\", \\\"Use an item. Tap during the spin to take it early.\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Triangle\\\", \\\"Camera\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Options\\\", \\\"Pause\\\"],\\n160→  [\\\"Keyboard\\\", \\\"WASD, Space, F, C, Esc. Extra drivers: arrows, IJKL, numpad.\\\"],\\n];\\n\",\"absolute_path\":\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/input.js\",\"offset\":null,\"raw_output\":\"import { clamp } from \\\"./math.js\\\";\\n\\nexport const TOUCH_MESSAGE = \\\"Controller or keyboard required\\\";\\nexport const ATTRACT_IDLE_SEC = 10;\\nconst DEADZONE = 0.18;\\n\\nexport function neutralAction() {\\n  return {\\n    steer: 0,\\n    accel: false,\\n    brake: false,\\n    hop: false,\\n    useItem: false,\\n    camera: false,\\n    pause: false,\\n    confirm: false,\\n    back: false,\\n    menuX: 0,\\n    menuY: 0,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function applyAxisInvert(x, y, settings) {\\n  return {\\n    x: settings && settings.invertX ? -x : x,\\n    y: settings && settings.invertY ? -y : y,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function touchGateVisible(env) {\\n  return !!(env && env.coarsePointer && !env.hover && env.maxTouchPoints > 0);\\n}\\n\\nfunction buttonDown(buttons, index, threshold = 0.5) {\\n  return (buttons && buttons[index] ? buttons[index] : 0) > threshold;\\n}\\n\\nexport function actionsFromPad(pad, settings) {\\n  const axes = (pad && pad.axes) || [0, 0, 0, 0];\\n  const buttons = (pad && pad.buttons) || [];\\n  const stick = applyAxisInvert(axes[0] || 0, axes[1] || 0, settings || {});\\n  const steer = Math.abs(stick.x) < DEADZONE ? 0 : clamp(stick.x, -1, 1);\\n  const sy = Math.abs(stick.y) < DEADZONE ? 0 : stick.y;\\n  const dpadX = (buttonDown(buttons, 15) ? 1 : 0) - (buttonDown(buttons, 14) ? 1 : 0);\\n  const dpadY = (buttonDown(buttons, 13) ? 1 : 0) - (buttonDown(buttons, 12) ? 1 : 0);\\n  return {\\n    steer,\\n    accel: buttonDown(buttons, 7, 0.12),\\n    brake: buttonDown(buttons, 6, 0.12),\\n    hop: buttonDown(buttons, 5),\\n    useItem: buttonDown(buttons, 4),\\n    camera: buttonDown(buttons, 3),\\n    pause: buttonDown(buttons, 9),\\n    confirm: buttonDown(buttons, 0),\\n    back: buttonDown(buttons, 1),\\n    menuX: dpadX || (Math.abs(steer) > 0.55 ? Math.sign(steer) : 0),\\n    menuY: dpadY || (Math.abs(sy) > 0.55 ? Math.sign(sy) : 0),\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nconst KEYSETS = [\\n  { accel: \\\"KeyW\\\", brake: \\\"KeyS\\\", left: \\\"KeyA\\\", right: \\\"KeyD\\\", hop: \\\"Space\\\", item: \\\"KeyF\\\", camera: \\\"KeyC\\\", pause: \\\"Escape\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"ArrowUp\\\", brake: \\\"ArrowDown\\\", left: \\\"ArrowLeft\\\", right: \\\"ArrowRight\\\", hop: \\\"ShiftRight\\\", item: \\\"Slash\\\", camera: \\\"Quote\\\", pause: \\\"Enter\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"KeyI\\\", brake: \\\"KeyK\\\", left: \\\"KeyJ\\\", right: \\\"KeyL\\\", hop: \\\"KeyU\\\", item: \\\"KeyO\\\", camera: \\\"KeyP\\\", pause: \\\"\\\" },\\n  { accel: \\\"Numpad8\\\", brake: \\\"Numpad5\\\", left: \\\"Numpad4\\\", right: \\\"Numpad6\\\", hop: \\\"Numpad7\\\", item: \\\"Numpad9\\\", camera: \\\"NumpadAdd\\\", pause: \\\"\\\" },\\n];\\n\\nexport function actionsFromKeys(down, playerIndex) {\\n  const keys = KEYSETS[playerIndex] || KEYSETS[0];\\n  const on = (code) => !!(code && down && down[code]);\\n  let steer = 0;\\n  if (on(keys.left)) steer -= 1;\\n  if (on(keys.right)) steer += 1;\\n  const menuX = playerIndex === 0\\n    ? (on(\\\"ArrowRight\\\") || on(\\\"KeyD\\\") ? 1 : 0) - (on(\\\"ArrowLeft\\\") || on(\\\"KeyA\\\") ? 1 : 0)\\n    : 0;\\n  const menuY = playerIndex === 0\\n    ? (on(\\\"ArrowDown\\\") || on(\\\"KeyS\\\") ? 1 : 0) - (on(\\\"ArrowUp\\\") || on(\\\"KeyW\\\") ? 1 : 0)\\n    : 0;\\n  return {\\n    steer,\\n    accel: on(keys.accel),\\n    brake: on(keys.brake),\\n    hop: on(keys.hop),\\n    useItem: on(keys.item),\\n    camera: on(keys.camera),\\n    pause: on(keys.pause),\\n    confirm: playerIndex === 0 && (on(\\\"Enter\\\") || on(\\\"Space\\\")),\\n    back: playerIndex === 0 && (on(\\\"Escape\\\") || on(\\\"Backspace\\\")),\\n    menuX,\\n    menuY,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function actionsFromMouse(mouse) {\\n  const buttons = (mouse && mouse.buttons) || [];\\n  return {\\n    steer: clamp((mouse && mouse.dx ? mouse.dx : 0) / 28, -1, 1),\\n    accel: !!buttons[0],\\n    brake: !!buttons[2],\\n    hop: !!buttons[1],\\n    useItem: !!(mouse && mouse.wheel),\\n    camera: false,\\n    pause: false,\\n    confirm: !!buttons[0],\\n    back: !!buttons[2],\\n    menuX: 0,\\n    menuY: 0,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function menuEdges(action, prev) {\\n  const current = action || neutralAction();\\n  const before = prev || neutralAction();\\n  return {\\n    menuX: current.menuX && !before.menuX ? current.menuX : 0,\\n    menuY: current.menuY && !before.menuY ? current.menuY : 0,\\n    confirm: !!(current.confirm && !before.confirm),\\n    back: !!(current.back && !before.back),\\n    pause: !!(current.pause && !before.pause),\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n// The press that opens pause is still down on the next frame. Latch it so\\n// pause and back do not read as a fresh edge until the key is released.\\nexport function seedHeldMenu(held) {\\n  return { ...neutralAction(), ...held, pause: true };\\n}\\n\\nexport function drivingActions({ pad, keys, mouse, settings, playerIndex, useMouse }) {\\n  const key = actionsFromKeys(keys, playerIndex || 0);\\n  const padAct = pad ? actionsFromPad(pad, settings) : null;\\n  const mouseAct = useMouse && mouse ? actionsFromMouse(mouse) : null;\\n  let steer = key.steer;\\n  if (padAct && Math.abs(padAct.steer) > Math.abs(steer)) steer = padAct.steer;\\n  if (mouseAct && Math.abs(mouseAct.steer) > 0.04) steer = mouseAct.steer;\\n  return {\\n    steer,\\n    accel: key.accel || !!(padAct && padAct.accel) || !!(mouseAct && mouseAct.accel),\\n    brake: key.brake || !!(padAct && padAct.brake) || !!(mouseAct && mouseAct.brake),\\n    hop: key.hop || !!(padAct && padAct.hop) || !!(mouseAct && mouseAct.hop),\\n    useItem: key.useItem || !!(padAct && padAct.useItem) || !!(mouseAct && mouseAct.useItem),\\n    camera: key.camera || !!(padAct && padAct.camera),\\n    pause: key.pause || !!(padAct && padAct.pause),\\n    confirm: key.confirm || !!(padAct && padAct.confirm),\\n    back: key.back || !!(padAct && padAct.back),\\n    menuX: (padAct && padAct.menuX) || key.menuX,\\n    menuY: (padAct && padAct.menuY) || key.menuY,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport const CONTROL_LINES = [\\n  [\\\"Right trigger\\\", \\\"Go\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Left trigger\\\", \\\"Brake. Hold it with a shield item to trail it.\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Left stick\\\", \\\"Steer\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Right bumper\\\", \\\"Hop. Hold it through the turn. Two sparks, then let go.\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Left bumper\\\", \\\"Use an item. Tap during the spin to take it early.\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Triangle\\\", \\\"Camera\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Options\\\", \\\"Pause\\\"],\\n  [\\\"Keyboard\\\", \\\"WASD, Space, F, C, Esc. Extra drivers: arrows, IJKL, numpad.\\\"],\\n];\\n\",\"total_lines\":161}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-fdffd832-a467-43b3-879e-df787c3b5167-13","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"180→\\nfunction buildArena(scene, course, mats) {\\n  const floor = paintMesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(course.width + 8, course.depth + 8), mats.toon(course.road), false);\\n  floor.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2;\\n  floor.position.y = 0;\\n  scene.add(floor);\\n  const wallH = 2.2;\\n  for (const [hx, hy, hz, x, y, z] of [\\n    [course.width / 2, wallH / 2, 0.45, 0, wallH / 2, course.depth / 2],\\n    [course.width / 2, wallH / 2, 0.45, 0, wallH / 2, -course.depth / 2],\\n190→    [0.45, wallH / 2, course.depth / 2, course.width / 2, wallH / 2, 0],\\n    [0.45, wallH / 2, course.depth / 2, -course.width / 2, wallH / 2, 0],\\n  ]) {\\n    const wall = paintMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(hx * 2, hy * 2, hz * 2), mats.toon(course.wall, THREE.DoubleSide), true);\\n    wall.position.set(x, y, z);\\n    scene.add(wall);\\n  }\\n  for (const obstacle of course.obstacles) {\\n    let mesh;\\n    if (obstacle.type === \\\"cyl\\\") {\\n200→      mesh = paintMesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(obstacle.r, obstacle.r, 2.4, 12), mats.toon(0xd7c4a2), true);\\n      mesh.position.set(obstacle.x, 1.2, obstacle.z);\\n    } else {\\n      mesh = paintMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(obstacle.hx * 2, 2.2, obstacle.hz * 2), mats.toon(0xb08968), true);\\n      mesh.position.set(obstacle.x, 1.1, obstacle.z);\\n    }\\n    scene.add(mesh);\\n  }\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\\n    const lamp = paintMesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.28, 8, 8), mats.basic(0xffd6a5), false);\\n210→    const angle = (i / 10) * Math.PI * 2;\\n    lamp.position.set(Math.cos(angle) * (course.width / 2 - 1), 2.6, Math.sin(angle) * (course.depth / 2 - 1));\\n    scene.add(lamp);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction buildKart(raceKart, mats) {\\n  const stats = raceKart.stats;\\n  const body = stats.body;\\n  const group = new THREE.Group();\\n220→  group.rotation.order = \\\"YXZ\\\";\\n  const chassis = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(body[0], body[1], body[2]), mats.toon(stats.color));\\n  chassis.position.y = 0.42;\\n  chassis.castShadow = true;\\n  chassis.receiveShadow = true;\\n  chassis.userData.outlineMaterial = mats.outline;\\n  addOutline(chassis);\\n  const nose = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(body[0] * 0.62, body[1] * 0.55, body[2] * 0.28), mats.toon(stats.color));\\n  nose.position.set(0, 0.4, body[2] * 0.52);\\n  nose.castShadow = true;\\n230→  group.add(chassis, nose);\\n  const wheelGeo = new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.26, 0.26, 0.18, 8);\\n  const wheels = [];\\n  for (const [sx, sz] of [[-1, -1], [1, -1], [-1, 1], [1, 1]]) {\\n    const pivot = new THREE.Group();\\n    const wheel = new THREE.Mesh(wheelGeo, mats.toon(0x1c1c22));\\n    wheel.rotation.z = Math.PI / 2;\\n    wheel.castShadow = true;\\n    pivot.add(wheel);\\n    pivot.position.set(sx * body[0] * 0.42, 0.28, sz * body[2] * 0.34);\\n240→    group.add(pivot);\\n    wheels.push(pivot);\\n  }\\n  const driver = new THREE.Group();\\n  const torso = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.34, 0.36, 0.26), mats.toon(stats.cloth));\\n  torso.position.y = 0.72;\\n  torso.castShadow = true;\\n  torso.userData.outlineMaterial = mats.outline;\\n  addOutline(torso);\\n  const head = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.2, 10, 8), mats.toon(stats.accent));\\n250→  head.position.y = 1.05;\\n  head.castShadow = true;\\n  head.userData.outlineMaterial = mats.outline;\\n  addOutline(head);\\n  const eye = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.05, 0.05, 0.04), mats.basic(0x1b1b22));\\n  eye.position.set(0.07, 1.08, 0.16);\\n  const eye2 = eye.clone();\\n  eye2.position.x = -0.07;\\n  driver.add(torso, head, eye, eye2);\\n  if (stats.id === \\\"pip\\\") {\\n260→    for (const x of [-0.18, 0.18]) {\\n      const puff = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.1, 8, 6), mats.toon(stats.color));\\n      puff.position.set(x, 1.12, -0.02);\\n      driver.add(puff);\\n    }\\n  } else if (stats.id === \\\"quill\\\") {\\n    const quill = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.16, 8, 6), mats.toon(0xfff1b0));\\n    quill.scale.set(0.45, 1.4, 0.45);\\n    quill.position.set(0, 1.32, -0.02);\\n    driver.add(quill);\\n270→  } else if (stats.id === \\\"bramble\\\") {\\n    const bush = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.22, 8, 6), mats.toon(0x1f8a4c));\\n    bush.position.set(0, 1.22, -0.04);\\n    driver.add(bush);\\n  } else {\\n    const cap = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.34, 0.1, 0.3), mats.toon(0x101428));\\n    cap.position.set(0, 1.22, 0);\\n    driver.add(cap);\\n  }\\n  group.add(driver);\\n280→  const flame = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.28, 8, 6), new THREE.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({ color: 0xff7a00 }));\\n  flame.position.set(0, 0.35, -body[2] * 0.62);\\n  flame.visible = false;\\n  group.add(flame);\\n  const sparks = new THREE.Group();\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\\n    const spark = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.08, 6, 5), mats.basic(i % 2 ? 0xfff3b0 : 0xff8c42));\\n    spark.position.set(0, 0.2, -0.8 - i * 0.22);\\n    sparks.add(spark);\\n  }\\n290→  sparks.visible = false;\\n  group.add(sparks);\\n  const held = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.34, 0.34, 0.34), new THREE.MeshBasicNodeMaterial({ color: 0xffffff }));\\n  held.visible = false;\\n  group.add(held);\\n  const balloons = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\\n    const balloon = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.16, 8, 6), mats.basic([0xff4d6d, 0xffd23f, 0x4cc9f0][i]));\\n    balloon.position.set((i - 1) * 0.28, 1.55, -0.1);\\n    balloon.visible = false;\\n300→    group.add(balloon);\\n    balloons.push(balloon);\\n  }\\n  group.userData = { wheels, driver, flame, sparks, held, balloons, outlineMaterial: mats.outline };\\n  return group;\\n}\\n\\nexport function buildScene(course, race) {\\n  const gradient = gradientTexture();\\n  const mats = makeMaterials(gradient);\\n310→  const scene = new THREE.Scene();\\n  scene.background = new THREE.Color(course.sky);\\n  const sky = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(420, 20, 12), mats.basic(course.sky));\\n  sky.material.side = THREE.BackSide;\\n  sky.material.depthWrite = false;\\n  scene.add(sky);\\n  const hemi = new THREE.HemisphereLight(course.id === \\\"lantern-causeway\\\" ? 0x8ea2ff : 0xfff2df, 0x3d4a32, course.id === \\\"lantern-causeway\\\" ? 0.45 : 0.9);\\n  scene.add(hemi);\\n  scene.add(new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, course.id === \\\"lantern-causeway\\\" ? 0.22 : 0.32));\\n  const dir = new THREE.DirectionalLight(course.id === \\\"lantern-causeway\\\" ? 0xb9c7ff : 0xfff4e4, course.id === \\\"lantern-causeway\\\" ? 1.5 : 2.5);\\n320→  const cx = (course.bounds.minX + course.bounds.maxX) / 2;\\n  const cz = (course.bounds.minZ + course.bounds.maxZ) / 2;\\n  dir.position.set(cx + 30, 70, cz + 18);\\n  dir.target.position.set(cx, 0, cz);\\n  dir.castShadow = true;\\n  dir.shadow.mapSize.set(2048, 2048);\\n  const span = Math.max(course.bounds.maxX - course.bounds.minX, course.bounds.maxZ - course.bounds.minZ) * 0.65 + 20;\\n  dir.shadow.camera.left = -span;\\n  dir.shadow.camera.right = span;\\n  dir.shadow.camera.top = span;\\n330→  dir.shadow.camera.bottom = -span;\\n  dir.shadow.camera.near = 10;\\n  dir.shadow.camera.far = 220;\\n  dir.shadow.bias = -0.0004;\\n  scene.add(dir);\\n  scene.add(dir.target);\\n  if (course.id === \\\"lantern-causeway\\\") {\\n    for (let i = 0; i < 6; i++) {\\n      const sample = sampleCourse(course, (i + 0.2) * (course.length / 6));\\n      const light = new THREE.PointLight(0xffb15a, 18, 28, 2);\",\"content_concise\":\"180→\\nfunction buildArena(scene, course, mats) {\\n  const floor = paintMesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(course.width + 8, course.depth + 8), mats.toon(course.road), false);\\n  floor.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2;\\n  floor.position.y = 0;\\n  scene.add(floor);\\n  const wallH = 2.2;\\n  for (const [hx, hy, hz, x, y, z] of [\\n    [course.width / 2, wallH / 2, 0.45, 0, wallH / 2, course.depth / 2],\\n    [course.width / 2, wallH / 2, 0.45, 0, wallH / 2, -course.depth / 2],\\n190→    [0.45, wallH / 2, course.depth / 2, course.width / 2, wallH / 2, 0],\\n    [0.45, wallH / 2, course.depth / 2, -course.width / 2, wallH / 2, 0],\\n  ]) {\\n    const wall = paintMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(hx * 2, hy * 2, hz * 2), mats.toon(course.wall, THREE.DoubleSide), true);\\n    wall.position.set(x, y, z);\\n    scene.add(wall);\\n  }\\n  for (const obstacle of course.obstacles) {\\n    let mesh;\\n    if (obstacle.type === \\\"cyl\\\") {\\n200→      mesh = paintMesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(obstacle.r, obstacle.r, 2.4, 12), mats.toon(0xd7c4a2), true);\\n      mesh.position.set(obstacle.x, 1.2, obstacle.z);\\n    } else {\\n      mesh = paintMesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(obstacle.hx * 2, 2.2, obstacle.hz * 2), mats.toon(0xb08968), true);\\n      mesh.position.set(obstacle.x, 1.1, obstacle.z);\\n    }\\n    scene.add(mesh);\\n  }\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\\n    const lamp = paintMesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.28, 8, 8), mats.basic(0xffd6a5), false);\\n210→    const angle = (i / 10) * Math.PI * 2;\\n    lamp.position.set(Math.cos(angle) * (course.width / 2 - 1), 2.6, Math.sin(angle) * (course.depth / 2 - 1));\\n    scene.add(lamp);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction buildKart(raceKart, mats) {\\n  const stats = raceKart.stats;\\n  const body = stats.body;\\n  const group = new THREE.Group();\\n220→  group.rotation.order = \\\"YXZ\\\";\\n  const chassis = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(body[0], body[1], body[2]), mats.toon(stats.color));\\n  chassis.position.y = 0.42;\\n  chassis.castShadow = true;\\n  chassis.receiveShadow = true;\\n  chassis.userData.outlineMaterial = mats.outline;\\n  addOutline(chassis