{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_154","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"grok-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nThe pause entry logic is solid. menuPrev seeds correctly on the first frame. Escape held on the next frameInvestigating a potential produces no false back edge. The same-frame bug in the pause menu guard prevents duplicate logic. When opened  menu triggers. After pause opens, a heldwith Escape, seedHeldMenu Escape updates menuPrev sets both pause and without generating spurious edges. back to true.\n\nA forced pause edge for the wrong player is harmless. The held key still produces no confirm or back edge, so the menu stays paused without triggering activation.","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Both prior defects are fixed in the shipped loop and the rebuilt HTML. I’ll record a not-refuted"},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n\nConfirmed the Escape","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":" verdict."},{"type":"thinking","thinking":" menu flow works correctly. Now checking if a second Escape press triggers the bug, since the released state updates on release and the next press sets both pause and back edges.\n\nThe second Escape press behavior is intentional. It resumes the game via the back edge. Resume and Quit remain reachable through menu navigation after release. This is not a bug. Now searching for a real, demonstrable core behavior issue.\n\nA cheap scan of high-risk areas is underway. The pause quit path is the first target.\n\nChecking whether the bundled Three.js import exposes THREE.BackSide. If BackSide is missing, the outline material would default to FrontSide and reintroduce the bug.","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-18a43ad8-c564-4a2e-b259-4e643c4d1153-26","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637.html","offset":1,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-18a43ad8-c564-4a2e-b259-4e643c4d1153-27","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/main.js","offset":200,"limit":50}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call-18a43ad8-c564-4a2e-b259-4e643c4d1153-28","name":"read_file","input":{"target_file":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/grok-xhigh__example__v2__cel__free__efficient__on/work/Kartesian-Derby-Mario-Kart-64-for-N64-grok-4.7-xhigh-20261027-1637/src/main.js","offset":390,"limit":90}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3456,"output_tokens":938,"cache_read_input_tokens":46848,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01a17fba-2fc3-7d53-9fa6-699993e68862","uuid":"d47cc99f-5963-402e-885a-ca9bd66284cd"}
